{"time": 1764096344, "type": "recv", "message_id": "427853009", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……这样不好”她抓着你的手，有些恨铁不成钢地看着你"}
{"time": 1764096512, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1687633297", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...怎么了...\"不敢看她"}
{"time": 1764096852, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2061271386", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“你帮他做的他都不知道，我知道喜欢是无私的感情……但是不能这样”"}
{"time": 1764096882, "type": "recv", "message_id": "266755342", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“‘在一起’不是一句话，三个字那么简单”"}
{"time": 1764096982, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1229041851", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"但是...但是...那我该...做什么?\"小声嗫嚅，全然没了主意。"}
{"time": 1764097016, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1846376560", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“去把他叫过来，让他自己说”"}
{"time": 1764097175, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1345144168", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我甚至没见到你们手牵着手一起站在我面前，大大方方地说我们交往了”她眼眶有点红“倒是先看到你这幅样子了”"}
{"time": 1764097296, "type": "recv", "message_id": "697516519", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"拉着她的手抖个不停，自己好像惹妈妈生气了，\"舒茉...舒茉现在去...现在去吗？\""}
{"time": 1764097567, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1666779665", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“他要是不肯来……以后也就别来了”她闭上眼睛，最后闪过的不是愤怒，而是失望"}
{"time": 1764097656, "type": "recv", "message_id": "622444941", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "被妈妈的样子吓到了，连忙站起身，送开妈妈的手去隔壁房间敲门，整个人一直在发抖，\"伊恩...伊恩?\"声音倒是也不敢太大"}
{"time": 1764097708, "type": "recv", "message_id": "426421538", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（感觉要问你可知罪了）"}
