{"time": 1764118471, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1682426401", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "思绪被打断，意识逐渐从懵懵懂懂变得清晰，去把门打开"}
{"time": 1764119837, "type": "recv", "message_id": "665421911", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "门外当然是自己，战战兢兢，浑浑噩噩，身体一直在发抖，见到伊恩的时候咬住唇，\"妈妈...妈妈要见伊恩...\"小声，\"因为刚刚的事...\""}
{"time": 1764119965, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1098209840", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？......刚刚的事？“有点没反应过来”是因为我把舒茉一个人留在这里吗...”有一种无力感“对不起，我好差劲....”"}
{"time": 1764120248, "type": "recv", "message_id": "130763357", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（话说龙哥呢）"}
{"time": 1764120529, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1892578729", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...现在还有机会...好好讲清楚的话...\"妈妈这么生气的样子，自己真的很少见到..."}
{"time": 1764120657, "type": "recv", "message_id": "352958717", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯.....”本来就是自己的错，也不能怪舒茉告诉阿姨“那...舒茉对我生气了吗....”此刻更关心这个问题"}
{"time": 1764120875, "type": "recv", "message_id": "327431359", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我没生气...但是妈妈生气了...\"低着头，自己好像应该生气，\"我...\"沉默下来"}
{"time": 1764120953, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2043433372", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(原来龙哥没醒)"}
