{"time": 1764132625, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1011419480", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（可以，很有权谋感）"}
{"time": 1764139546, "type": "recv", "message_id": "199938618", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……”舒蕾的面色青一阵白一阵，大概是觉得有点……荒诞。听你们你一句我一句地说完，终于开口到“舒茉，在你想明白之前，你们两个不准再独处了”"}
{"time": 1764139852, "type": "recv", "message_id": "591514291", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"知道眼下这是最好的处理，自己不想让妈妈难过，点点头，\"舒茉不会让妈妈担心的...\"再度轻轻抱住她，不知不觉自己都和妈妈差不多高了..."}
{"time": 1764140299, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1361468274", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（[CQ:at,qq=1040972910] 你可有何话说）"}
{"time": 1764140307, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1627390508", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（@伊恩（诺薇菈） 你可有何话说）"}
{"time": 1764140309, "type": "recv", "message_id": "568562625", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "再无话说"}
{"time": 1764140364, "type": "recv", "message_id": "568936810", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯.....”舒蕾在怎么说也是舒茉的母亲，自己的恩人，没有资格去拒绝她的要求"}
{"time": 1764140461, "type": "recv", "message_id": "342163573", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“行了”她吸一吸鼻子“……就这样吧，下午还有人要来”"}
{"time": 1764140629, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1723274233", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=568936810]（你拒绝的立场是什么（）"}
{"time": 1764140651, "type": "recv", "message_id": "398196277", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（居然只是禁止独处.jpg）"}
{"time": 1764140656, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1781074282", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（都说自己没有资格了，你还要问我（））"}
{"time": 1764140670, "type": "recv", "message_id": "463413682", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我的意思是为什么会有拒绝的想法）"}
{"time": 1764140807, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1654547831", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（可能有私奔的说法吧，但是没有资格已经包含了各种了）"}
{"time": 1764140811, "type": "recv", "message_id": "285830513", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=342163573]抱着她，抬起头仔仔细细地端详母亲的面庞，\"呼...妈妈是世界最好的妈妈，舒茉最重要的人，不要再生气了，生气会变老的。\""}
{"time": 1764141316, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2058102740", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "她有点生硬地别过了头，惊鸿一瞥间，能看得见因为被泪水沾湿又擦干后显得有些脏乱的面容。她抿着嘴，似是有些故作坚强"}
{"time": 1764141597, "type": "recv", "message_id": "871935684", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "感觉自己在这里有点多余...说什么做什么都不太对，但离开的话就更不对了，只能呆呆站在原地...."}
{"time": 1764141858, "type": "recv", "message_id": "181102122", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "轻轻亲一口妈妈的脸颊，后退两步站起身，拉拉妈妈的手摇晃，\"妈妈，舒茉陪妈妈去洗漱一下啦。\""}
{"time": 1764141964, "type": "recv", "message_id": "482396135", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我在想以后会不会发展到什么这是两百万离开我女儿这种桥段）"}
{"time": 1764142019, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1974139264", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "她没说什么，站起身来，跟着你一起往浴室走"}
{"time": 1764142172, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1508466237", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "挽着妈妈的手，尝试支撑着她，虽然可能并不需要，另一只手在身后稍微朝着伊恩摆了摆，示意他现在可以出去了。"}
{"time": 1764142425, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1242656576", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "如蒙大赦，静悄悄的离开了...."}
{"time": 1764142476, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1867909714", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "在走廊上，思考一下接下来该怎么办"}
{"time": 1764142788, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1240143429", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1508466237]走还是走的稳路的，不过依然一言不发。进了浴室后，她随手取下一块毛巾打湿，洗起脸来"}
{"time": 1764142840, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1607881420", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "算了，先回房间吧，给汉斯叔叔说一声可能比较好？"}
{"time": 1764143027, "type": "recv", "message_id": "640625041", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "在她身边跟着，自己的脸估计也花得差不多了，但是妈妈没开口，自己还是有些心慌...等着妈妈发话"}
{"time": 1764143076, "type": "recv", "message_id": "834151282", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "打开房间门，看看汉斯叔叔在干嘛"}
