{"time": 1764178518, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1781467036", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1754361935]“嗯……？”他把报纸放下，朝你这边看来“怎么了？刚刚不是还”"}
{"time": 1764178756, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1351803789", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“....叔叔去看看吧...”"}
{"time": 1764179299, "type": "recv", "message_id": "910145584", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1861496007]“……哎”舒蕾靠在床头，幽幽地叹了口气“我不是不能理解……可是我觉得……不值当。他把你一个人抛下，你还要向着他……图什么呢？”"}
{"time": 1764179487, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1765514699", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1351803789]“嗯”他放下报纸起身，就推门而出"}
{"time": 1764179542, "type": "recv", "message_id": "374949061", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "有些坐立难安了...感觉在房间里休息好像也不太对，去走廊待着吧"}
{"time": 1764180680, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1727292438", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你好喜欢走廊（）"}
{"time": 1764180961, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1213217502", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1765514699]“算了……算了。就算这次是事出有因吧”"}
{"time": 1764180975, "type": "recv", "message_id": "457137384", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=910145584]\"因为...他穿着的女装是我要求的吧...\"坐在床边，\"嗯...我还记得妈妈说...要让别人成为自己喜欢的样子和喜欢自己的样子...嗯...舒茉知道妈妈的想法...\"扶着妈妈的肩膀靠着坐下，\"也不能说向着他吧...\""}
{"time": 1764181153, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1244494466", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1213217502]（回错了原来）"}
{"time": 1764181161, "type": "recv", "message_id": "564310513", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（这是舒蕾说的）"}
{"time": 1764181237, "type": "recv", "message_id": "488563285", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"妈妈是舒茉第一重要的人...\""}
{"time": 1764181577, "type": "recv", "message_id": "33693253", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=457137384]“那，这种事情”舒蕾抿了抿嘴“要保证它不再发生的人，是你才对”"}
{"time": 1764182112, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1472519697", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"舒茉知道啦。\"终于可以露出一些笑容，脑袋搭在妈妈肩膀上，\"妈妈～千万不要生气——舒茉真的很怕...\"语气有些委屈"}
{"time": 1764183387, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1909206571", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1472519697]“能不生气么……我也不想生气”她刮刮你的鼻子“如果换当年的我来……谁敢临阵脱逃，我可不饶他”"}
{"time": 1764183608, "type": "recv", "message_id": "430813973", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1765514699]随后敲了敲舒蕾房间的门"}
{"time": 1764183758, "type": "recv", "message_id": "60360028", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"舒茉去开门。\"吐吐舌头，起身去门口打开房门，\"嗯嗯...?爸爸怎么来了?\""}
{"time": 1764183782, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1701269375", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（翔哥睡了吗[CQ:at,qq=1040972910] ）"}
{"time": 1764183957, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1450196828", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我估计是)"}
{"time": 1764184011, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1139864448", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“来看看你妈妈”他声音不大，还是和以往一样不形于色，伸长脖子绕开你，视线努力往房间里探"}
{"time": 1764184226, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1977807751", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "让开身位，或者说干脆小跑回去床边继续在妈妈身边坐下，自然地靠在她身上，\"嗯...\"不好提起刚刚的事，自己果然还是有些害怕..."}
