{"time": 1764225506, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1257530904", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看见开门的是舒茉...但是现在自己也做不了什么"}
