{"time": 1764225662, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1783055094", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "刚刚被这么叮嘱，还没有后续的时候，朝着伊恩稍微点了点脑袋，关上门"}
{"time": 1764225681, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1408293538", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1977807751](然后接这里咯)"}
