{"time": 1764227251, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1057886233", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（[CQ:at,qq=825734198] 龙）"}
{"time": 1764227784, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1262585606", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1977807751]“怎么了？”汉斯在另一侧坐下，不必牵手，平淡地开口“怎么真不高兴了？我一开始还不太信”"}
{"time": 1764228294, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1097264242", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "舒蕾用鼻音轻轻咳了咳，和汉斯简单对视了眼，又飘向别处“没什么，在想操心事而已……怎么还专门过来一趟？”"}
{"time": 1764228791, "type": "recv", "message_id": "933777218", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那当然要来了”汉斯又不依不饶地钻到舒蕾视线里“舒蕾心情不好可是大事……说起来，最近真是辛苦你了。好不容易回到赫顿玛尔，不如……久违地？”"}
{"time": 1764229129, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1894794023", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“久违地什么？”舒蕾的视线躲不开汉斯，最后只能叹口气，用还沾着点红晕的眼睛望着他"}
{"time": 1764229507, "type": "recv", "message_id": "282537399", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“去趟酒馆吧，怎么样？”汉斯帮舒蕾把鬓角的头发归拢，有些图穷匕见地说"}
{"time": 1764229511, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2117003534", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎，父母爱情）"}
