{"time": 1764269157, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2045307532", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1940138642]("}
{"time": 1764269217, "type": "recv", "message_id": "8602074", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "哎，之后会怎么样呢，叔叔会不会揍我一顿呢，好像被揍也正常，逃跑什么的肯定不会也不可能去做，听天由命吧...."}
{"time": 1764269354, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1326316234", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=282537399]“诶？啊……”舒蕾重新抬起头来“怎么……还当我是酒鬼？早就喝不动咯。而且，不能当坏榜样”"}
{"time": 1764269502, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1211342100", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "其实自己也没有异议，\"舒茉没意见——妈妈今天也很需要放松一下...\"停了一下，\"我喝酒也没什么问题的，哪里是坏榜样了?\"话是这么说，还是靠着自己的床头，之前没发现床头怎么这么硬的事。"}
{"time": 1764269798, "type": "recv", "message_id": "734614075", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“小屁孩懂什么……酒馆不是你该去的地方啦”舒蕾转头轻弹你的额头\n“好啦，就只喝一点点，就……两瓶？”汉斯不依不饶“不至于这点都喝不了吧，嗯？八点去，九点就能回来”"}
{"time": 1764269896, "type": "recv", "message_id": "691564210", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "找个墙角坐下...感觉不管做什么心里都不踏实，抱着膝盖思考"}
{"time": 1764269931, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1139770340", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "跟着点头，\"爸爸难得提这种事，妈妈今天就答应吧。\"一只手抓着她的手臂摇了摇，\"不放松一下不行呢...\"另一只手擦了擦额头，\"到时间舒茉会去接爸爸妈妈的。\""}
{"time": 1764270012, "type": "recv", "message_id": "533997670", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哎呀，真是的！”舒蕾佯装愠怒地摆了摆手，声音越来越小“万一喝醉了遇到什么事，你指望舒茉她们拿主意么……”"}
{"time": 1764270156, "type": "recv", "message_id": "425529065", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "虽然很想说自己也可以拿主意，但是想到刚刚的事...话到嘴边咽了下去，偏过脑袋，\".......\""}
{"time": 1764270309, "type": "recv", "message_id": "763144010", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不给点机会怎么让他们拿主意？”汉斯伸手握住舒蕾挥动的胳膊“你啊……虽然我说有点怪……一直都把大家保护的太好了”"}
{"time": 1764270411, "type": "recv", "message_id": "502900874", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "自己可能没有资格跟着父亲的话重复，整个人稍微蜷缩了一些，低下头看着脚尖。"}
{"time": 1764270584, "type": "recv", "message_id": "866382531", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“你不知道……”舒蕾下意识往你这边瞥了一眼，正好看见你蜷缩的样子“……哎好吧好吧，真是……我不答应也别想安生了”"}
{"time": 1764270588, "type": "recv", "message_id": "668147077", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "会不会以后....赶紧停止了继续想下去，完全不敢想象没有舒茉的未来，不断的摇头试图驱散，但依旧忧心忡忡....."}
{"time": 1764270779, "type": "recv", "message_id": "506991305", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯，舒蕾早就该放放假了，或者说……放纵一次？”汉斯上手捏捏她的肩膀“找回一点年轻的感觉？”"}
{"time": 1764270856, "type": "recv", "message_id": "886757125", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "双手攥紧按在自己的大腿上，依然没抬头，语气倒是佯装轻快，虽然略微有些抖，\"嗯...到九点了舒茉会去接爸爸妈妈回来..\""}
{"time": 1764271061, "type": "recv", "message_id": "512105004", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“好啦好啦，别无精打采的……该做些准备咯？去月光酒馆的话，总不能穿成这样”汉斯牵着舒蕾的手，把她从床上拉了起来“走吧走吧，我们去逛逛街”"}
{"time": 1764271135, "type": "recv", "message_id": "682631450", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "而且感觉有些在意...阿姨问舒茉的那个问题...."}
{"time": 1764271149, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1628301843", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（月光酒馆我怎么记得在西海岸呢）"}
{"time": 1764271203, "type": "recv", "message_id": "211876848", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（说明你记错了）"}
{"time": 1764271239, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1939571886", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好的，确实是我记错了）"}
{"time": 1764271273, "type": "recv", "message_id": "993617939", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=512105004]“下午，圣职者来的时候”汉斯半推半搡地带着舒蕾往门口走去，不往回头看一眼你“就交给你们处理了”"}
{"time": 1764271353, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1410040445", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "挤出勉强的笑容，对着爸爸点点头，\"舒茉知道了。\"不过坐在床头没动，心里还有积压着些阴霾。"}
{"time": 1764271386, "type": "recv", "message_id": "108318855", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=682631450]会不会舒茉其实根本不喜欢我...不对，应该是喜欢的...不对，说不定只是把和感谢的心情搞混了..不对不对不对....脑子越想越乱"}
{"time": 1764271502, "type": "recv", "message_id": "740936683", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=108318855]总之，在你脑子发乱的时候，里面的脚步声靠近了"}
{"time": 1764271574, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1939666376", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "脑子里在疯狂的头脑风暴，并没有意识到"}
{"time": 1764271695, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1746367909", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "门开了，汉斯挽着舒蕾的胳膊从房间步入走廊，自然是一眼看见了你"}
{"time": 1764271755, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1016046530", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“怎么在这蹲着？”汉斯看起来有点意外，舒蕾则闭口不语，目光直接落在你身上"}
{"time": 1764271800, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1195434721", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "门开的声音倒是足够明显，足以把注意力吸引过去，有些尴尬，起身拍拍身上的灰...“房间里有点闷...我出来凉快一会，叔叔阿姨是要出门吗...”"}
{"time": 1764271854, "type": "recv", "message_id": "992239701", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "伊恩还在门口?听到这话才转过头，克制住自己想过去查探的想法，把身体牢牢控制在床头到坐姿上。听着...听着就可以。"}
{"time": 1764271943, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2090601221", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯，去买点东西”汉斯说到“大概下午也没那么快回来。如果圣职者到了，得交给你们处理了”"}
{"time": 1764271985, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1530918237", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯....好的...叔叔阿姨再见”看着汉斯，有点不太敢去直视舒蕾"}
{"time": 1764272085, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1893003830", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯，晚上见”他点点头，从头到尾都没对你投来什么异样的眼神……大概并不知道刚刚发生了什么"}
{"time": 1764272208, "type": "recv", "message_id": "44882775", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "舒蕾身上的压迫感减轻了许多，不知道和你自己有多少关系……总之，随着两人的身影消失在升降梯上，走廊重新变得空荡透亮起来"}
{"time": 1764272305, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1984479821", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "松了一口气，但仍旧只是在门口坐着玩，没有直接去找舒茉，一方面是之前舒蕾的要求，另一方面是不太敢去确认舒茉的答案"}
{"time": 1764272318, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1583132962", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "松了一口气，但仍旧只是在门口坐着，没有直接去找舒茉，一方面是之前舒蕾的要求，另一方面是不太敢去确认舒茉的答案"}
{"time": 1764272401, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1143701662", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "伴随着父母离开，本来就有些阴霾的心情更显空荡，居然会有些莫名的寂寞，但是自己也无事可做，母亲的要求...现在的自己不敢违背。\n看了看一旁一直没换的衣服，拿起来走进洗漱间试一下。"}
{"time": 1764272546, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1764271098", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那）"}
{"time": 1764272553, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1337516394", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（（换（）"}
{"time": 1764272562, "type": "recv", "message_id": "683524801", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我哪记得款式）"}
{"time": 1764272600, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1383438161", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "靠着墙静静的坐着，虽然现在和舒茉仅仅只有一墙之隔....但，自己也说不清，感觉心里乱乱的"}
{"time": 1764272601, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1674977285", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(好像是长裙白色圆领卫衣，还有绿色风衣)"}
{"time": 1764272624, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1388056098", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1143701662]（要求不是让你自己去给他讲明白底线要求吗）"}
{"time": 1764272643, "type": "recv", "message_id": "548887450", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(不是不能两人独处?)"}
{"time": 1764272667, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1283477193", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（想明白了就可以了（）"}
{"time": 1764272673, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1518935797", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(咦，翔哥尺寸应该比我大点吧)"}
{"time": 1764272684, "type": "recv", "message_id": "969957184", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(所以胸口应该不会紧?)"}
{"time": 1764272698, "type": "recv", "message_id": "740273636", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（其实差不多）"}
{"time": 1764272711, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1431438098", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（你当我有胸肌便好（）"}
{"time": 1764272809, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1947561513", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"脱掉之前的衣服，先换上上衣，再轻轻穿好裙子，束好腰带，郑重地把蓝宝石项链挂在胸前，梳了一下头发穿上最外层的风衣，\"呼...\"照一照镜子"}
{"time": 1764272822, "type": "recv", "message_id": "370623499", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你的意思是，胸小的连你的胸肌都不如?)"}
{"time": 1764272839, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1478001267", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=FFF8BF9E76DFFF3DB7FCE9C3431EBB66.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQJm2O3IWWmJAzrfAQLAELj2PFW1Ri50QEg_woovuPbvoyTkQMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQHVSFOyVLi_6LMJJlbMeBEnoCTb6CAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAMSMG6hn6gjlWoqqny9BhIUeStuyFqmGjQ_TC7Ishl6IQFq48X-mtKvIX6tega70oUUlA,file_size=26809]"}
{"time": 1764272847, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1669355058", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=B7B349F16D120F811A99F3225193F7E4.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhTicEm7yO-HoX2bRx7m3e7Vc1rLixiwgQEg_woomYLNwoyTkQMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQiVUDIJtGPcQBepJ_9s62rHoCBa-CAQJuag&amp;rkey=CAMSMG6hn6gjlWoqqny9BhIUeStuyFqmGjQ_TC7Ishl6IQFq48X-mtKvIX6tega70oUUlA,file_size=16560]"}
{"time": 1764272930, "type": "recv", "message_id": "506889692", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "项链挂在胸前，蓝的像天空的心脏。虽然和衣服风格不太搭，但考虑到发色又是另一回事了"}
{"time": 1764273084, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1092983683", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "兴许还算合适，知道伊恩还在门口，站在门边...想了一会才开口，\"伊恩?\"声音不高，也没有打开门"}
{"time": 1764273188, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1068325519", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...我在.....”有点想问舒茉，但还是算了吧...“那个，对不起...都是因为我的缘故，才让阿姨刚刚那么伤心....”"}
{"time": 1764273312, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2109613797", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...妈妈说我也该生气...\"隔着门轻轻开口，\"伊恩是怎么想的呢?那个时候。\""}
{"time": 1764273377, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1096435869", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不管怎么说...我都不该丢下舒茉一个人的...抱歉...”"}
{"time": 1764273410, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1042485062", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“以后我再也不会这样了”"}
