{"time": 1764302169, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1069347223", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[顾时汐]演奏出: 1D20+1={15}+1=16"}
{"time": 1764302548, "type": "recv", "message_id": "43157680", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "那种程度的烧伤，尽管致死性不如伊恩先前受过的重伤，但在不剃肉重长的情况下，治愈难度却应该说得上接近……按理说，是资深圣职者才能做到的事。看起来她说她擅长疗伤还算保守了\n很快她和莫辛与甘纳许道了别，走向门口……你才感觉好像少了什么"}
{"time": 1764302588, "type": "recv", "message_id": "902909399", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"等等，露莉亚姐姐。\"走上前，\"我们还没有付报酬。\""}
{"time": 1764302623, "type": "recv", "message_id": "260127037", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这次真的很麻烦姐姐，报酬您来提...\"不知道这么说自己能不能付得起，\"嗯...您来提。\""}
{"time": 1764302693, "type": "recv", "message_id": "597643198", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（圣人也不会不要报酬？）"}
{"time": 1764302701, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1307412191", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（笑）"}
{"time": 1764302732, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1528929499", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(是啊，圣人会把报酬收下然后捐出去)"}
{"time": 1764302750, "type": "recv", "message_id": "388071766", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不过我还真不知道，不卖赎罪券的教会除了接受捐赠还有什么收入来源吗）"}
{"time": 1764302761, "type": "recv", "message_id": "687170556", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(有土地)"}
