{"time": 1764302924, "type": "recv", "message_id": "334731345", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那么高的教育都想不到吗（））"}
{"time": 1764302951, "type": "recv", "message_id": "175766270", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“汉斯先生已经付过酬金了哟”她拉开门的时候，你能看出她的额角沾着些汗珠，不过依旧带着微笑“嗯……你们有什么需要我帮助的吗？”"}
{"time": 1764303004, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2131905781", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（比较难想）"}
