{"time": 1764303052, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2048492651", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（支线罢了）"}
{"time": 1764303066, "type": "recv", "message_id": "464071658", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...应该，应该没有了吧...\"眨了眨眼，\"姐姐要喝杯水坐一会再走吗？治疗很花费体力吧...\""}
{"time": 1764303156, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1309269468", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "仔细看看她的眼睛"}
{"time": 1764303340, "type": "recv", "message_id": "782487132", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……好，谢谢舒茉”露利亚欣然接受。双眼和先前一样，目光落在你身上，却总感觉迷蒙而不真切"}
{"time": 1764303350, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1710602405", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "递给她一些纸巾“姐姐擦擦汗吧”"}
{"time": 1764303379, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1551682221", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（其实眼睛是很神必的设定，不重要）"}
{"time": 1764303390, "type": "recv", "message_id": "411501122", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（只是告诉你不是纯路人.jpg）"}
{"time": 1764303409, "type": "recv", "message_id": "314121368", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "去接一杯水，拿一条干净的毛巾，递给她，\"嗯...姐姐治疗过记忆吗？\"打开话题"}
{"time": 1764303594, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1337420430", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=314121368]她接过毛巾，擦了擦额头，随后接过水象征性喝了一口“嗯？记忆？没有哦。我只会疗伤，也没听过有谁会这个”"}
{"time": 1764303628, "type": "recv", "message_id": "881025717", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "舒茉还在时刻想着自己...好感动"}
{"time": 1764303674, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2032386003", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好吧...\"对这个回答倒也是意料之中，“嗯...露莉亚姐姐见过歌兰蒂斯大人吗？”"}
{"time": 1764303817, "type": "recv", "message_id": "979165040", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯，在宣誓的时候见过”她捧着水杯，轻点臻首“比我想象中的……年轻，很厉害”"}
{"time": 1764303961, "type": "recv", "message_id": "423390935", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"有机会的话，果然舒茉也想亲眼见见...\"按着脸颊使劲摇摇头，\"我去看看莫辛她们。\"去隔壁房间看看"}
{"time": 1764303999, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1351413712", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"有机会的话，果然舒茉也想亲眼见见...\"按着脸颊使劲摇摇头，\"露莉亚姐姐，失陪一下，我去看看莫辛她们。\"去隔壁房间看看"}
{"time": 1764304057, "type": "recv", "message_id": "487529559", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "自己也有点想跟上，但留露利亚姐姐一个人呆在这好像也不太好..."}
{"time": 1764304171, "type": "recv", "message_id": "809258812", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(睡!)"}
{"time": 1764304463, "type": "recv", "message_id": "839639007", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1351413712]莫辛看起来比你们初次见面的时候状态还好些，除了头发还没长回来，耳朵已经和常人无异了。四肢看起来稍显粗粝，但还算得上白净。甘纳许的绷带也拆下来了，被灼烧过、原本干枯下去的肢体现在已经恢复了正常的色泽，只是看起来有些不够饱满，大概需要一段时间的锻炼才能真正恢复。遮着眼睛的绷带拆了下来，不过望过去……眼底终究有些浑浊，而且转动的时候幅度总是不能完全跟上另一边"}
{"time": 1764304636, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1944474780", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=839639007]\"呼...\"稍微点了点头，虽然还有些许的不完美，不过露莉亚姐姐还在外面，\"感觉怎么样?\"露出会心的笑容，不管怎么样，看见她们好起来心情也跟着好起来了。"}
{"time": 1764304864, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1627814483", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（睡）"}
{"time": 1764313323, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1406846248", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(都没醒?)"}
{"time": 1764313330, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1145493745", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（）"}
{"time": 1764313960, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1037073572", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（）"}
{"time": 1764314207, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1772921092", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "和露利亚待在一起...但也不知道说些什么，算了 让露利亚小姐安心休息一会吧，不打扰她了，在一旁静静坐着"}
{"time": 1764314715, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1344364766", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1944474780]“感觉活力满满了，就像，嗯……身体睡了很久，终于又苏醒了”莫辛轻盈地转了个圈，甘纳许坐在床沿，尝试着抓握水杯，也算是稳当“真厉害啊，那位圣职者小姐……”"}
{"time": 1764315158, "type": "recv", "message_id": "393772975", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯嗯。\"在莫辛旁边招呼着她，\"小心点，别摔着了。\"爸爸还真是请来了很厉害的人...也不知道怎么请来的...既然确认了她们的状态，\"那我就继续去接待露莉亚姐姐了，晚上要不要一起出门买衣服?\"笑着对莫辛伸手"}
{"time": 1764315331, "type": "recv", "message_id": "280556602", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1772921092]“真的没有要帮忙的吗？”她又确认了一遍“上来的时候，我听见了哭声”"}
{"time": 1764315346, "type": "recv", "message_id": "491850821", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=393772975]（诶，你发现了）"}
{"time": 1764315355, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1909950854", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（其实完全不像见习）"}
{"time": 1764315398, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1613816419", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“没有啦...谢谢姐姐关心，已经基本解决好了”"}
{"time": 1764315415, "type": "recv", "message_id": "271452312", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我听见了哭声)"}
{"time": 1764315474, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1778995359", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“姐姐好厉害啊，那么重的伤感觉好快就治好了”"}
{"time": 1764315485, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1611902272", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=393772975]“嗯，妈妈也说，走得时候就没怎么带……”莫辛放松地笑着“终于……可以开始新生活了吗？”"}
{"time": 1764315696, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1619271793", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好啦，舒茉一开始就说过了吧？\"一只手叉着腰，另一只朝她伸着，\"过去的那些只用记得就好啦～完全没必要影响未来的幸福!\""}
{"time": 1764315943, "type": "recv", "message_id": "738564958", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1778995359]“这是我为数不多擅长的事情，当然要做到最好”她点点头，把喝完的水杯放在桌上“那，没有别的问题的话，我就准备走了”"}
{"time": 1764316027, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1491787372", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“像姐姐这样厉害的人一定很忙吧...就不多打扰了”起身“我去送送姐姐”"}
{"time": 1764316040, "type": "recv", "message_id": "642640868", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(翔哥不问一下，她明明说自己是见习这件事?)"}
{"time": 1764316083, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1269236222", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1778995359]（这里不是大概问了一下，还要继续追问吗（）"}
{"time": 1764316084, "type": "recv", "message_id": "978713176", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1619271793]（哎，怎么是握手）"}
{"time": 1764316148, "type": "recv", "message_id": "338037179", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“话说姐姐之前说自己是见习来着,姐姐这样的水平居然也只是见习吗”跟着她一起往外走，有些好奇"}
