{"time": 1764316477, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1258172949", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(失踪的时候就)"}
{"time": 1764316647, "type": "recv", "message_id": "183728780", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1619271793] “唔唔……光是记着……不行的啦”莫辛轻轻摇了摇头，不过还是把手和你握在一起“妈妈和我说过了，等生活稳定下来……要给父亲立冢，希望能找得到能下葬的东西”"}
{"time": 1764316884, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1250978452", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=338037179]“嗯，还没有得到正式的称号”她点点头“我也不太在意” 她说这话的时候语气稍有些不自然，可能也并非完全不在意……？"}
{"time": 1764316969, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1453777469", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=183728780]\"嗯嗯。\"稍微用力把她往自己这边拉了过来，轻轻抱住她，\"那...到时候记得叫上我...而且...不管什么时候，舒茉都会是莫辛的后盾，有事一定要记得找我呢——\""}
{"time": 1764317017, "type": "recv", "message_id": "554037958", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（为什么要叫上你啊.jpg）"}
{"time": 1764317021, "type": "recv", "message_id": "358142325", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "是被排挤了吗，自己虽和她只是萍水相逢，但忍不住追问“哎？姐姐这么厉害为什么没有称号...”"}
{"time": 1764317025, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1652361042", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（见过面吗）"}
