{"time": 1764318419, "type": "recv", "message_id": "776812939", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=344930110]“诶？发生什么事了吗？噢……可以问吗？这个”莫辛给你留了些空间，坐回母亲身边，抚摸着她的手臂，像是要为肌肉复健按摩"}
{"time": 1764318477, "type": "recv", "message_id": "573314110", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2047214498]“再见，伊恩”格栅门拉上了，她的笑容被分成一格一格，随后消失在地板以下"}
{"time": 1764318621, "type": "recv", "message_id": "913757057", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...不是什么大事...有空的时候再说给莫辛听。\"甩甩脑袋，重新露出笑容\"呼...好了，待会一起出门吧?\""}
{"time": 1764318648, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1294394882", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "毕竟自己和她也不是特别熟，也不好多说什么，送走她之后，去莫辛房间外等舒茉"}
{"time": 1764318997, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2087593604", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=913757057]“嗯，好~”她的笑容由衷而单纯，倒真如花束一般"}
{"time": 1764319066, "type": "recv", "message_id": "371829291", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "跟着露出会心的笑容，\"那，甘纳许阿姨，莫辛我就先带走了？\"语气带着些调皮"}
{"time": 1764319084, "type": "recv", "message_id": "116759761", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不是等会吗）"}
{"time": 1764319121, "type": "recv", "message_id": "459214439", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（而且你的意思是，甘纳许不用买吗（））"}
{"time": 1764319172, "type": "recv", "message_id": "960678446", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(莫辛应该知道尺寸吧，我想的是阿姨出不了门的话，就我们两买三人的)"}
{"time": 1764319253, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1957240454", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（出得了啊）"}
{"time": 1764319264, "type": "recv", "message_id": "278287167", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(好的)"}
{"time": 1764319299, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1053808145", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "跟着露出会心的笑容，\"那，甘纳许阿姨要一起出门吗？\"语气带着些调皮，\"不然的话，我可要带着莫辛走咯?\""}
{"time": 1764319741, "type": "recv", "message_id": "690770270", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“当然……过一会一起走吧”甘纳许点点头，下地试着走着“不过我可能半路就会回来……到时候再说吧”"}
{"time": 1764319793, "type": "recv", "message_id": "52455511", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯嗯。\"看一眼时间"}
{"time": 1764319882, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2052127013", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "大概，下午一点"}
{"time": 1764319944, "type": "recv", "message_id": "209735747", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "似乎确实有点早，点点头开口，\"嘛，那莫辛和阿姨休息一会——三点的时候再出发吧～?\""}
{"time": 1764320135, "type": "recv", "message_id": "389093115", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“好……那，一会见”她看起来心情也不错，尽管眼睛看起来有些吓人"}
{"time": 1764320320, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1656856990", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "不打扰母女二人，推开门出去。今天的事情让自己属实有些累...扶着脑袋，感觉有些昏沉。"}
{"time": 1764320353, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1943835611", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "你发现伊恩站在门口"}
{"time": 1764320375, "type": "recv", "message_id": "218282694", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看舒茉走路好像有点不太稳，上前扶住她“怎么了，你看起来不怎么好的样子”"}
{"time": 1764320673, "type": "recv", "message_id": "278542975", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"有点累...\"关上门才开口，\"感觉...今天做了好多事...好累...\""}
{"time": 1764320716, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1342567781", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那舒茉去稍微睡会吧....露莉亚姐姐也已经走了”"}
{"time": 1764320772, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1099472607", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对了”掏出之前省下来的钱“剩下了一些”递给舒茉"}
{"time": 1764320919, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1609070098", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"没有伸手接，\"本来就留给伊恩了...\"捂住嘴巴，慢慢打了个哈欠，\"我约了莫辛她们三点去买新衣服...嗯，要是没睡醒...待会伊恩喊我吧。\""}
{"time": 1764320995, "type": "recv", "message_id": "995533472", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哦，好的....舒茉就安心睡吧”"}
{"time": 1764321173, "type": "recv", "message_id": "101287016", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "点点头，慢悠悠地走回自己的房间，关好门。倒也没必要再换衣服了，轻轻盖上被子睡了下去。"}
{"time": 1764321245, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1182280681", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "虽然自己也有点累，但害怕睡着了就睡过去了，在房间里看看汉斯叔叔的报纸吧，看看他天天都在看什么"}
