{"time": 1764431839, "type": "recv", "message_id": "872214688", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "自己倒是买过新衣服，虽然说...到了这个地方，还是想再买一些...手缩在兜里，仔细看"}
{"time": 1764432039, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1082014261", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1464398113]“嗯……想试试新的种类”莫辛的手有些拘谨地收在胸前，另一只手小心翼翼地拨开密如林的一家，翻看着款式"}
{"time": 1764432061, "type": "recv", "message_id": "164576475", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（衣架）"}
{"time": 1764432406, "type": "recv", "message_id": "596978702", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"连衣裙也可以多拿几件嘛。\"跟着一起翻看衣架，\"不过，莫辛要是喜欢别的...\"从里面抽出一件连袖风衣，\"试试看这种?正好马上要入冬了。\"笑"}
{"time": 1764432794, "type": "recv", "message_id": "922729000", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（变成助手了？）"}
{"time": 1764432807, "type": "recv", "message_id": "3673997", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(话说有1吗)"}
{"time": 1764432967, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2077733558", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(无)"}
{"time": 1764435023, "type": "recv", "message_id": "388295471", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（怎么忽然不动了）"}
{"time": 1764435128, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1744407618", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（因为在三角洲）"}
{"time": 1764435985, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1713503543", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=596978702]“嗯嗯”她点头“那我先去试衣间吧”"}
{"time": 1764436019, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1010237575", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "说罢，她拎着风衣，绕过密集的架子，往里间的试衣间去了"}
{"time": 1764436096, "type": "recv", "message_id": "743176666", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（诶，那说不定）"}
{"time": 1764436104, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1010956650", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（其实露莉亚是主线）"}
{"time": 1764436111, "type": "recv", "message_id": "140752808", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（想进阶的话）"}
{"time": 1764436134, "type": "recv", "message_id": "153213946", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "走到前台，看看这里的接待小姐，\"小姐?您好，可以给我推荐一些套衣吗？\""}
{"time": 1764436281, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1662611620", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "你看向前台，发现……和你对上了眼"}
{"time": 1764436292, "type": "recv", "message_id": "150533938", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "似乎观察了你有一阵子"}
{"time": 1764436347, "type": "recv", "message_id": "807004539", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...?\"也看着她，\"小姐为什么一直看着我?\""}
{"time": 1764437135, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1571185268", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“没什么，感觉小姐这身衣品不错”她似笑非笑地看着你"}
{"time": 1764437738, "type": "recv", "message_id": "397540384", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哦...谢谢您...\"有些不好意思地捏捏自己的衣角，\"这是今天收到的礼物...\""}
{"time": 1764437988, "type": "recv", "message_id": "227211055", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯，蛮合身的”她微笑着点点头“要我推荐的话……果然还是白色吧”"}
{"time": 1764438106, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1668088675", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（给你原立绘如何）"}
{"time": 1764438142, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1254640210", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"白色?\"沉吟了片刻，\"好吧——选什么衣服比较合适?\"总感觉她的态度有点奇怪，\"嗯...\"继续自己的提问"}
{"time": 1764438144, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1273431528", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(善)"}
{"time": 1764440317, "type": "recv", "message_id": "441940072", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（人呢？）"}
{"time": 1764440474, "type": "recv", "message_id": "25092722", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(善)"}
{"time": 1764440738, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1606615036", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "店员走到一处货架前，取下两件光亮的织物。一件是带着宽大泡泡袖、领口和袖口带着蓝色褶皱的宽大套裙，带着橙蓝两面的披风，蓝色那面用如沙般的金线绣着些星轨。领口为扇贝般的蓝色蝴蝶领巾。下装则是可以收在罩裙下的花瓣般层叠的短裙"}
{"time": 1764440801, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1423623112", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "为弥补遮盖率，还搭了两条过膝长袜"}
{"time": 1764440854, "type": "recv", "message_id": "397443879", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "眨了眨眼，\"啊...\"捂着嘴巴，\"好漂亮的衣服...我..我真的合适吗？\""}
{"time": 1764441398, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1422754687", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“还不错吧？”她点点头“原本是天界贵族带来的版型，我稍微改良了一下，不过颜色有些鲜艳，一直没等到合适的人呢？”"}
{"time": 1764441539, "type": "recv", "message_id": "851003795", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1422754687]\"诶...\"指了指自己，\"我真的合适吗？\"眼睛却紧紧盯着衣服，\"嗯...我觉得...这个衣服应该适合更漂亮的人吧...\"扭头"}
{"time": 1764441556, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1328114205", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（又不是只有一件（）"}
{"time": 1764441611, "type": "recv", "message_id": "594584875", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是你这么喜欢这件，会不会显得伊恩有点，神（）"}
{"time": 1764441704, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1485589302", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（神在哪）"}
{"time": 1764441709, "type": "recv", "message_id": "665233884", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（就）"}
{"time": 1764441714, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2012219219", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（拼尽全力挑了两件）"}
{"time": 1764441723, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1001311430", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不如店员随手一摸）"}
{"time": 1764441730, "type": "recv", "message_id": "484664739", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你上原皮是这样的)"}
{"time": 1764441734, "type": "recv", "message_id": "288597813", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（看最后穿哪件多吧）"}
{"time": 1764441738, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2013472356", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(还能不喜欢吗)"}
{"time": 1764441825, "type": "recv", "message_id": "321056737", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=851003795]“又不是皇袍”她偷笑着“好看就是合适咯。不过价格自然，也会比较‘合适’”"}
{"time": 1764441935, "type": "recv", "message_id": "953727209", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶...\"手伸到一半停住了，\"多少...\"自己也不是很有钱，希望不会很贵。"}
{"time": 1764441959, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1286474871", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（一件当三件了）"}
{"time": 1764441997, "type": "recv", "message_id": "364669007", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“三枚金币啦”她把衣服放在桌上，伸出三根手指"}
{"time": 1764442159, "type": "recv", "message_id": "327243862", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"呃...\"自己身上大概还有五个金币，虽然很想直接拿下这件衣服，但是...\"可以便宜些吗？\"不敢看她，低头看着衣服下摆"}
{"time": 1764442701, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2051297914", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“看在你算半个老客户的份上？”她倒是没有露出不悦的神色“给你打个……85折？”"}
{"time": 1764442858, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2045243740", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“以后记得带朋友一起来哦”"}
{"time": 1764443041, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1035507944", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"老客户?为什么?我是第一次来...\"这次终于伸手接过了衣服，\"谢谢您...\"同时抬头看着她，重复了一遍，\"我身上的衣服也是在这里买的吗？\""}
{"time": 1764443160, "type": "recv", "message_id": "100871201", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哦，我还以为他会和你说的”她点头“是在这”"}
{"time": 1764443337, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2013862753", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...那，看在那家伙那么辛苦的份上，再打个折吧。\"对着她眨眨眼。"}
{"time": 1764444249, "type": "recv", "message_id": "362676283", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“已经是看在他份上才有的优惠咯”"}
{"time": 1764444302, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1625316058", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶...\"最后还是点点头，去试衣间换上衣服，走出来对着镜子仔细看看自己。"}
{"time": 1764444371, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1819531155", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=90280825D9B2C15D095639230E0D344B.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhSKpZsqXSfU5JMHFhp3vMzzPm7-vhj4iQcg_wooitS3v4uYkQMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQY0nQC-DBKgiKxs5WMPNTFHoChWyCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAQSMA0MNxQTljvD071Cm2ljRSAFvc1Ct-9Saqd_qW-O9EdioV4PkF6fKh3TJwrT-ZFJsw,file_size=115960]"}
{"time": 1764444372, "type": "recv", "message_id": "217086257", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（）"}
{"time": 1764444379, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1396671703", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（）"}
{"time": 1764444392, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1914828411", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（）"}
{"time": 1764444518, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1721466803", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "看看莫辛出来没有，同时抖了抖裙子下摆，对着店员小姐开口，\"嗯...怎么样?\"想寻求她的认可。"}
{"time": 1764444682, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2130978930", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1721466803]莫辛披着风衣出来，稍显宽大的风衣配着瘦削的身材反倒有些学者的派头\n店员伸长了脖子，前后左右围着你看了一圈“嗯，不错不错，我的眼光还是很好的嘛”"}
{"time": 1764444796, "type": "recv", "message_id": "210116482", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"舒茉也觉得...很好看。谢谢您...\"听见称赞不免松了口气，走到莫辛身边，仔细打量着她，\"感觉怎么样?莫辛～\""}
{"time": 1764445273, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1485122976", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（）"}
{"time": 1764445697, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1201583784", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“有点大……没试过这样的”她左右扭身，看着自己的衣摆"}
{"time": 1764445700, "type": "recv", "message_id": "170089351", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（诶，那不就是）"}
{"time": 1764445702, "type": "recv", "message_id": "622365304", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（克拉拉）"}
{"time": 1764445878, "type": "recv", "message_id": "160445205", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这种衣服就是这样啦。\"伸手，帮她牵一牵衣摆，\"再试试别的?\"眯着眼睛直笑，\"不过我觉得这件也很好看，我来结账吧？\""}
{"time": 1764446404, "type": "recv", "message_id": "71471355", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哦，不行不行……妈妈说了，这种花费不可以……中午已经吃了哥哥带的点心”"}
{"time": 1764447605, "type": "recv", "message_id": "976996807", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=71471355]\"诶～可是我想送莫辛一个礼物嘛。\"笑笑，捏捏她的脸蛋，\"不可以?\"狡黠地眨眨眼，\"不喜欢姐姐吗？\""}
{"time": 1764449581, "type": "recv", "message_id": "539110782", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不行不行”她坚持地摇头“在我们回礼之前……不太好嘛”"}
{"time": 1764450241, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1163372744", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=539110782]\"就这一件啦～\"双手揉搓她的脸颊，\"真是的～要是再拒绝的话，姐姐就不开心了哦——\"拖长音"}
{"time": 1764462287, "type": "recv", "message_id": "175936005", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(几点睡)"}
{"time": 1764462943, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1818066462", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1764462955, "type": "recv", "message_id": "191769414", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(字面)"}
{"time": 1764462970, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1551167621", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（中午再说）"}
{"time": 1764463005, "type": "recv", "message_id": "26722551", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(中午睡?)"}
{"time": 1764463083, "type": "recv", "message_id": "224273939", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1163372744]“唔嗯……那，那就现在吧”莫辛深吸一口气“姐姐的衣服，我们来付。我的衣服才给姐姐付”"}
{"time": 1764463406, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1883598775", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=224273939]\"这次不需要啦——\"腾出一只手摸摸头，\"好啦好啦，之后给我东西的机会还多着呢。\"转头看向阿姨，\"我也没送过莫辛什么，嘛，就当是...初见的问候。\"放下手挡在她的嘴巴前，\"如果喜欢姐姐就不要反对～\""}
{"time": 1764464201, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1581073694", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“你哪还需要送什么见面礼……”甘纳许摇头“我们也还没来得及做什么，又何必……”"}
{"time": 1764464403, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1070009530", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嘛，没关系啦。\"转过视线笑着揉乱莫辛的头发，\"毕竟都是我提出来的嘛，不送一套衣服给莫辛，多不好意思～\"对她眨眨一边眼睛，\"点点头，好吗？\""}
{"time": 1764464842, "type": "recv", "message_id": "667083080", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（）"}
{"time": 1764465224, "type": "recv", "message_id": "514013964", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哎……算了，这时候不该叹气对不对”她整理了一番表情，最后微笑着点点头“那便恭敬不如从命了”"}
{"time": 1764465388, "type": "recv", "message_id": "438566395", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "使劲点点脑袋，帮莫辛理顺头发，\"那我就先结账——\"摸索出自己的钱包，\"多少钱?\""}
{"time": 1764465536, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1172090869", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这两件算在一起，3金20银吧”她随意报了个数字“懒得算了，应该是这么多？”"}
{"time": 1764465540, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1386371099", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（328（））"}
{"time": 1764465689, "type": "recv", "message_id": "109572130", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"数出金币递给她，看了看自己的钱包，安静地收起来，其实有点肉痛，\"好啦，莫辛和阿姨接着挑一挑吧?\""}
{"time": 1764465694, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1998264926", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(328也太邪恶了)"}
{"time": 1764465775, "type": "recv", "message_id": "732846952", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（为什么）"}
{"time": 1764465783, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1784922458", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（感觉369更邪恶（））"}
{"time": 1764466298, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1258835959", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=109572130]“谢谢惠顾~欢迎随时再来”她收好钱，甚至没怎么点\n莫辛点点头，把新衣服穿在身上，接着去看她最习惯的连衣裙了"}
{"time": 1764466475, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1740780860", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "事已至此，当然自己也就不换衣服了，收起之前穿的那一身，跟在她们后面，饶有兴趣地看着她们挑衣服。虽然很有购物的欲望，不过姑且还是留着身上剩下这点钱币吧。"}
{"time": 1764466780, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1380839092", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "最后莫辛还是挑了件前襟用白布和丝带做了假两层、别着玫瑰碎花的连衣裙。甘纳许则挑了两身分体的常服"}
{"time": 1764466841, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1229850615", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "看一眼时间，如果差不多到晚餐的时间的话，自己就该去酒馆那边看看了。"}
{"time": 1764466921, "type": "recv", "message_id": "942834276", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（翔哥去哪里来着）"}
{"time": 1764466988, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2100409481", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(她也去酒馆的样子)"}
{"time": 1764467335, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1088506061", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（酒馆）"}
{"time": 1764467344, "type": "recv", "message_id": "100927962", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（索性先在酒馆前见面吧）"}
{"time": 1764467404, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1755104499", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...莫辛?\"准备离开的时候和她们打个招呼，\"我去找一下妈妈，有些放心不下，就先走咯?\""}
{"time": 1764467580, "type": "recv", "message_id": "272191591", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“知道了，姐姐再见”莫辛点点头，看起来打算直接回去了"}
{"time": 1764467687, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1144859222", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯。\"离开店里直奔之前爸爸提过的酒馆"}
{"time": 1764467763, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1209948526", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "打定主意进去的时候他们要是在喝酒的话，自己也要喝一些。走得很快"}
{"time": 1764468141, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1318919033", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "月光酒馆——这酒馆在赫顿玛尔找不到哪怕一处广告，地段也并不繁华，但几乎每处路牌都会标出通往那里的路。原因很简单，因为酒馆的女主人是赫顿玛尔唯一已知还存于世的精灵，索西雅·赫尔敏。而月光酒馆也绝不仅仅是一处酒吧，更是小道消息与冒险经历如烟花般飞溅的地方"}
{"time": 1764468264, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1004688218", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "站在酒馆门前，深呼吸，说到底自己也是第一次来这种地方，再次深呼吸几下，伸手准备推门而入。"}
{"time": 1764468419, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1961862730", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "偶尔——也会是格斗场。不过那是后话。至于现在，在古朴的街道前，有个熟人在朝这边走"}
{"time": 1764468496, "type": "recv", "message_id": "508802368", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "停在门口，\"嗯?\"定睛打量一番，挥挥手，\"伊恩?\"喊他"}
{"time": 1764468502, "type": "recv", "message_id": "347695259", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "([CQ:at,qq=1040972910] )"}
{"time": 1764468574, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1045751870", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“咦，舒茉，你怎么也来了，新衣服好好看，感觉舒茉眼光比我还好”有些巧，没想到舒茉也在这里"}
{"time": 1764468874, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1357505937", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这是店员小姐挑的啦～\"等他过来，原地转个圈，\"怎么样?舒茉感觉有点太华丽了...可能不适合我...但是...好漂亮...\""}
{"time": 1764468980, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1310481854", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“很适合舒茉啊，就跟量身定制的一样，而且舒茉本身也很漂亮啊，漂亮的人就该穿漂亮的衣服”"}
{"time": 1764469120, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1936645780", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（虽然是人话）"}
{"time": 1764469130, "type": "recv", "message_id": "128318354", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是就是，有点和立绘对不上）"}
{"time": 1764469160, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2140795845", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶...\"伸手挑着自己垂落的发梢，\"这么说我都不好意思了...\"咳两声，推开酒馆的门。"}
{"time": 1764469174, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1676598325", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(何意味，我怎么听着去打101了)"}
{"time": 1764469221, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1906758903", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我打半天了）"}
{"time": 1764469263, "type": "recv", "message_id": "344424738", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“所以舒茉还没告诉我，怎么来这里了，找阿姨吗？”"}
{"time": 1764469328, "type": "recv", "message_id": "315703261", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"稍微点点头，手指依然卷着发梢，\"我稍微...也想喝一点酒...\""}
{"time": 1764469405, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1140778217", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“啊？”有些吃惊“舒茉的酒量...”"}
{"time": 1764469466, "type": "recv", "message_id": "452651922", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我酒量很好才是。\"直接走进酒馆，在人群中扫一扫，看看爸爸妈妈在不在。"}
{"time": 1764469553, "type": "recv", "message_id": "537261398", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "跟上去"}
{"time": 1764469598, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1123268505", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "叔叔阿姨包括自己都在这里，就算喝醉了应该也没事吧....不过还是能让她别喝酒不要喝"}
{"time": 1764469605, "type": "recv", "message_id": "258195257", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（就）"}
{"time": 1764469908, "type": "recv", "message_id": "542132337", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "酒馆人还不多，想来是夜还不够深。舒蕾和汉斯坐在离前台稍远的位置，周围没什么人。前台，一名扎着高高的团子头、裹着鲜红礼裙的尖耳女子指尖轻摇着一个矮v字酒杯，眼神优雅地巡视这酒厂"}
{"time": 1764469984, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1638224153", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "找个侍者问一下“打扰一下，请问索菲娅小姐在哪”"}
{"time": 1764470027, "type": "recv", "message_id": "584613349", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "不打算现在去打扰爸妈，走上前台，\"您好...索菲娅女士，这里有什么酒推荐吗？\""}
{"time": 1764470054, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1280509615", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（咦，你怎么知道她是索菲娅（）"}
{"time": 1764470067, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1396017427", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（索西雅（）"}
{"time": 1764470076, "type": "recv", "message_id": "227539077", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（oh,索西雅）"}
{"time": 1764470099, "type": "recv", "message_id": "208162643", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（总之你应该不认识她吧）"}
{"time": 1764470252, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1399336062", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(传闻吧)"}
{"time": 1764470264, "type": "recv", "message_id": "272462080", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(既然是旁白内容，应该听说过?)"}
{"time": 1764470291, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1168411936", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你才来多久就）"}
{"time": 1764470481, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1939532525", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(好的，那就)"}
{"time": 1764470513, "type": "recv", "message_id": "22092985", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"您好，美丽的女士，这里有什么酒推荐吗？\"压着声音，其实也不想父母注意到"}
{"time": 1764470622, "type": "recv", "message_id": "302356447", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（咦，好像，其实）"}
{"time": 1764470649, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1997737273", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（毕竟有尖耳朵）"}
{"time": 1764470679, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1593938719", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(对啊，尖耳朵不是一眼认出来)"}
{"time": 1764470691, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1304163496", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(如果我听说过精灵的名字的话)"}
