{"time": 1764471178, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2131135437", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（要不你们上号）"}
{"time": 1764471182, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2102633274", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我就不用带了）"}
{"time": 1764471301, "type": "recv", "message_id": "790657806", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你在跟谁打?)"}
{"time": 1764471693, "type": "recv", "message_id": "768896609", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我的习惯一般是长岛冰茶，好像算烈酒吗)"}
{"time": 1764471716, "type": "recv", "message_id": "831520114", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（肯定算啊）"}
{"time": 1764471780, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1651681441", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那就对了)"}
{"time": 1764471823, "type": "recv", "message_id": "242798734", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1638224153]（所以你还是，维持原问？）"}
{"time": 1764472058, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1311351371", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(是啊，问都问了)"}
{"time": 1764472430, "type": "recv", "message_id": "487181244", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1638224153]（所以说是索西雅（）"}
{"time": 1764472485, "type": "recv", "message_id": "372924109", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“打扰一下，索西雅小姐在哪”"}
{"time": 1764472959, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1841402574", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“两位……可爱的客人”她的微笑带着些几乎是与生俱来的优雅“我就是”"}
{"time": 1764473189, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2137086217", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“索西雅女士...”抬起头看一看酒单，低头朝她微微行礼，“我想来一杯，很烈的酒...”"}
{"time": 1764473232, "type": "recv", "message_id": "604543937", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“......”想要阻止舒茉“索西雅女士，她还没成年”"}
{"time": 1764475114, "type": "recv", "message_id": "872886756", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“我十六岁了...”小声开口"}
{"time": 1764475548, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1537863903", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哦？”她压低身子，更靠近你们一些“烈酒可不是好受的东西……可不是故事那种可以左耳朵进右耳朵出的”"}
{"time": 1764475926, "type": "recv", "message_id": "153068611", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "声音也很低，不敢大声说话，\"嗯...舒茉没问题的。\""}
{"time": 1764476056, "type": "recv", "message_id": "250258438", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"只是...今天想试一试...我的酒量...应该也可以。\"小声，与其说是对话，不如说是自己给自己打气"}
{"time": 1764476616, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1495599078", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=250258438]“嚯……”索西雅看了看伊恩，又看了眼你“烈酒也分不同种类，有什么想法？”"}
{"time": 1764476630, "type": "recv", "message_id": "465198063", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“.....”想阻止舒茉，但感觉她不会听自己的话"}
{"time": 1764476712, "type": "recv", "message_id": "14554152", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "哎，至少不能两个人都喝醉“emmm，我酒量有点差，喝果酒就好了....”"}
{"time": 1764477049, "type": "recv", "message_id": "365645438", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...最烈的。\"自己不太清楚有什么酒类，直接开口"}
{"time": 1764477609, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2038804213", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"喝了之后，会头晕，什么都不用想。\""}
{"time": 1764478129, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1550558053", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“喔，看起来，有故事？”索西雅没再阻拦，开始从酒柜上拿原料"}
{"time": 1764478461, "type": "recv", "message_id": "640254217", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"有一点点。\"还是很小声，偷偷瞟一眼爸爸妈妈"}
{"time": 1764478628, "type": "recv", "message_id": "630138379", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=640254217]看起来有说有笑，大概是在聊自己的话题"}
{"time": 1764478694, "type": "recv", "message_id": "636522974", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "没有注意到自己就好，回过头，看着索西雅小姐调酒。"}
{"time": 1764478774, "type": "recv", "message_id": "12395122", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "她在等你开口，不过你不开口她也不会真的停手，但她转头先问了伊恩“你呢？为什么今天会走进这个酒馆？”"}
{"time": 1764478854, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1498801070", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"只是觉得...今天到了该喝一点的时候了...\"坐在台前，尽量靠近角落，让自己隐没在人群里。"}
{"time": 1764479233, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1060541655", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（没有人情）"}
{"time": 1764479235, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1189790381", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（人群）"}
{"time": 1764479376, "type": "recv", "message_id": "289835879", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(隐没在阴影里"}
{"time": 1764479753, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2001241175", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（[CQ:at,qq=1040972910] ）"}
{"time": 1764480442, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1678254226", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(\"明天\"说是)"}
{"time": 1764487641, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1255222243", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "([CQ:at,qq=1040972910] 睡醒了?)"}
{"time": 1764488072, "type": "recv", "message_id": "807172503", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（嗯，但龙哥现在睡了吧）"}
{"time": 1764488417, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1861215631", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(没有)"}
{"time": 1764488420, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1963210276", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我笑了)"}
{"time": 1764488770, "type": "recv", "message_id": "44042109", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=12395122]“我想来请教索西雅小姐一个魔法方面的问题...教会的露莉亚姐姐推荐我过来的”"}
{"time": 1764489259, "type": "recv", "message_id": "449952028", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哦？找我？”她看起来颇有兴趣，用高脚杯将一杯金红在上深红在下的酒液推给你“暮夏，请用”"}
{"time": 1764489305, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1891579028", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"谢谢...\"接过杯子，端起来放在唇边，先闻一闻。"}
{"time": 1764489315, "type": "recv", "message_id": "581481825", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不是给你的（）"}
{"time": 1764489349, "type": "recv", "message_id": "519728858", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“oh，谢谢姐姐...”接过酒小酌一口“我感觉最近对魔力的使用好像陷入瓶颈期了，不知道该怎么突破...”"}
{"time": 1764489500, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2133832409", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（实际上酒的度数和原料并没有绝对关系，主要还是看蒸不蒸馏）"}
{"time": 1764489554, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2110834317", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(好的)"}
{"time": 1764489652, "type": "recv", "message_id": "998616234", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"自己好像隐约有相似的问题?但是在这里不打算说什么，在一旁看着和听着。"}
{"time": 1764489698, "type": "recv", "message_id": "826530938", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "酒液晃荡，霞虹与雪色如云般交融。入口先是甜的有些盖过酒味的橙味，随后是涩得微弱但回味无穷的石榴香\n“水到渠成的事……无非是水不够，或者渠未成。为何非要找我不可？”\n她不在推脱，而是切实地好奇"}
{"time": 1764489754, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1486167370", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“教会的露莉亚姐姐说...我的问题只能找您或者西海岸的莎兰姐姐解决”"}
{"time": 1764489793, "type": "recv", "message_id": "186944670", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（tmd，能不能说重点）"}
{"time": 1764489807, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2045134331", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（车轱辘话说来说去）"}
