{"time": 1764489968, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1525871474", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（）"}
{"time": 1764490236, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1267785023", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1486167370]“露莉亚……”她点点头“她有没有说原因？”"}
{"time": 1764490268, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2028004731", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=12395122]（索西雅也在等你的故事）"}
{"time": 1764490347, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1108731885", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“没...她只说不让我跟除了您以外的其他人说...当时她先感知了下我的魔力，然后问了我魔法是天生还是后生的，我说失忆了，记得不太清楚....然后她的脸色忽然就很难看....”"}
{"time": 1764490401, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1322591342", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1108731885]（有，有说吗）"}
{"time": 1764490436, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2136400485", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "这杯似乎不是自己想要的烈酒，趴在桌面上，眼巴巴看着，\"我...我好像有点辜负了母亲的期待...让母亲伤心...\"语气依然很低，\"嗯...虽然我知道麻痹自己是不好的...但是爸爸妈妈都很喜欢喝酒...所以...我也想试试...\"总感觉自己的话没什么逻辑，也许只是自己心血来潮也说不定。"}
{"time": 1764490484, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2114891196", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1456637611]（也别谈论我，的意思难道不是和其他人吗）"}
