{"time": 1764490757, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1195934606", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我其实看出来是说不要再说她的事和你的事了)"}
{"time": 1764490767, "type": "recv", "message_id": "354484697", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那她闲得蛋疼不当面制止，等你问完了又过了十几分钟才说）"}
{"time": 1764490782, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1940980839", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（可能十几分钟这样的事情发生好几次了）"}
