{"time": 1764520484, "type": "recv", "message_id": "870056288", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(酒精中毒)"}
{"time": 1764520881, "type": "recv", "message_id": "90726080", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "头有些晕，但后脑还没开始疼。视线有些摇晃，不知道动摇的是世界还是你自己……咦，你体验过那种感觉吗？算了，不重要，惹人迷醉的东西不一定是酒精，酒精只是个借口。不过口干舌燥的感觉却尤为强烈，绝非伪造"}
{"time": 1764521128, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1757835655", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1597592529]\"水...\"伸手掐着自己喉咙，就像是酒精被点燃了一般，整个人的视野模模糊糊，摇晃得有些过分，\"好难受...\""}
{"time": 1764521176, "type": "recv", "message_id": "772269891", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“水...水...舒茉别急”抱着她去附近的商店，然后买瓶水"}
{"time": 1764521209, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1764839859", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（该喝口水了）"}
{"time": 1764521267, "type": "recv", "message_id": "605619135", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（难道是已经不能自主喝水了，只能嘴对嘴喂？）"}
