{"time": 1764521460, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1610440581", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那你act啊)"}
{"time": 1764521473, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1648378321", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=772269891]（已经买到了吗？）"}
{"time": 1764521484, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1284580214", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（龙哥不应该水一句么）"}
{"time": 1764521573, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1728991425", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“舒茉...你还能自己喝吗”自己抱着她没有手去喂她"}
{"time": 1764521592, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1256368641", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（懒得水了）"}
{"time": 1764521640, "type": "recv", "message_id": "300332933", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "不过看她晕晕的样子感觉自己也是白问，找个凳子，把舒茉放下来，让她先坐在上面"}
{"time": 1764521665, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1970392255", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "就当你们找了个大排档吧.jpg"}
{"time": 1764521668, "type": "recv", "message_id": "787427677", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "然后打开瓶口，放到舒茉的嘴唇，微微倾倒"}
{"time": 1764521772, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1308991177", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "衔住瓶口，下意识屏住呼吸小口小口喝着，直到被一口水呛得连连咳嗽，\"咳咳...咳咳咳!\""}
{"time": 1764521829, "type": "recv", "message_id": "392156036", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎....”拿开瓶子，拍拍背“对不起,是我倒得有点快了”"}
{"time": 1764522187, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1559810763", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "趴在桌子上，不太清楚现在的自己到底是什么样子，只感觉酒精蔓延到了头胸，依然还是好难受，郁结不仅没有像最初那般消融，反而囤积了起来，抓着左边胸口的衣服，\"呜...\""}
{"time": 1764522224, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1546572915", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎...以后不管说什么，都不会再让你碰酒了....”"}
{"time": 1764522274, "type": "recv", "message_id": "619309186", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看舒茉脸因为酒精涨红 把手上凝聚一些冰元素，帮忙降降温"}
{"time": 1764522296, "type": "recv", "message_id": "304448761", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“要不...去吐一下...也许吐出来就好受多了..”"}
{"time": 1764522390, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1553456805", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1298239727]()"}
