{"time": 1764527200, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1410645091", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "点点头，带着舒茉四处逛逛"}
{"time": 1764527214, "type": "recv", "message_id": "96137682", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“所以舒茉为什么突然想喝酒了....”"}
{"time": 1764527401, "type": "recv", "message_id": "331661460", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不知道。\"恶狠狠地掐一把对方的胳膊，\"不回——\"突然停下来，捂着自己的肚子，上涌的胃液让自己的嗓子呛着酸气，感觉有些抑制不住..."}
{"time": 1764527418, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1549746701", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "醉酒的华服少女和衣着朴素、看起来有些小白脸的少年，走在大街上，总是惹人注目的"}
{"time": 1764527544, "type": "recv", "message_id": "710610728", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“怎么了，哪里不舒服吗”看舒茉突然停了下来，有些疑惑"}
{"time": 1764527560, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1049829227", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“果然我还是带你去找圣职者治疗一下吧”"}
{"time": 1764527697, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2046210148", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "尽管索西雅已经很收着力了，但似乎对某人托大的程度还是低估了。空腹饮酒带来的排异感相当磨人"}
{"time": 1764527709, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1110420830", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎，空腹）"}
{"time": 1764527847, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1751911795", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（所以理论上带她吃点东西也可以）"}
{"time": 1764527861, "type": "recv", "message_id": "522340404", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（难道是醒酒汤其实就是，高蛋白）"}
{"time": 1764527905, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1004775363", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"胃...不舒服...\"紧紧皱着眉，捂着嘴，身体不停地往地上掉，双腿完全支持不住，腹部开始痉挛，\"...痛...\"浑身有些冰凉。"}
{"time": 1764528305, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1801195044", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "抱起舒茉“稍微坚持一下....我这就带你去找圣职者”去教会找露莉亚"}
{"time": 1764528385, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1799757835", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（伊神，你烧的水）"}
{"time": 1764528394, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1782477041", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（还洗吗）"}
{"time": 1764528394, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1357746329", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（冷了吗）"}
{"time": 1764528402, "type": "recv", "message_id": "405321354", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（还烧着啊）"}
{"time": 1764528405, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1655568144", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你不洗我就洗了）"}
{"time": 1764528406, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1171323282", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（不洗吧）"}
{"time": 1764528410, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1474701289", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（你洗）"}
{"time": 1764528490, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1028430501", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1801195044]“...”虽然想要阻止他，但现在光是应付身体各种突发的状况就已经拼尽全力，“唔...”额头不停有冷汗滑下，再加上之前掉的眼泪，此刻可以说得上是狼狈至极。"}
{"time": 1764528764, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2033971442", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“都怪我...要是我在稍微强硬一点就好了....”有些后悔，自己刚刚明明有两次机会可以让舒茉稍微好受一点，却都错过了...往教会赶"}
{"time": 1764528783, "type": "recv", "message_id": "890441413", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "迎面而来的，擦身而过的。伊恩走在路上，只觉往来人群看着你的眼神都带着些促狭。当然，也有些带着警惕"}
{"time": 1764528820, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1532898039", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "不过好在等你进了教会，那些目光便也一并消散了"}
{"time": 1764528888, "type": "recv", "message_id": "390502728", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "去找露莉亚。不在意那些目光，现在当务之急是先把舒茉治好"}
{"time": 1764528923, "type": "recv", "message_id": "907223820", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "你已经知道位置了.jpg"}
{"time": 1764528982, "type": "recv", "message_id": "775546136", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "一路都在压着自己的胃，只感觉自己好像突然到了室内，对光暗的变化几乎已经分不太清，眼睛看上去是眯着，其实已经有些看不见了，视野被一片一片的漆黑遮盖，烧灼感...眩晕感，再加上时不时的痉挛，很想就此断片，却总被一口气吊着"}
{"time": 1764529003, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1211754161", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "敲门.jpg"}
{"time": 1764529021, "type": "recv", "message_id": "612332565", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "\"露莉亚姐姐，舒茉很不舒服，可以帮她看看吗\""}
{"time": 1764529101, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1141407028", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（理论上，进门应该就有人上来问你需不需要帮助了，就当你推掉了？）"}
{"time": 1764529215, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1392664460", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（嗯）"}
{"time": 1764529367, "type": "recv", "message_id": "301495968", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "你敲了两三声，门内无应答，不过没等多久，身后传来规律的脚步声。露莉亚面无表情地低头看着路和手上托着放着果酱面包和牛奶的托盘，朝这边走来。她看到你们，先是愣了一下，随后紧闭双眼，很快又重新睁开，恢复成带着微笑的模样“请问，有什么需要帮助的吗？”"}
{"time": 1764529632, "type": "recv", "message_id": "979444637", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"呜呜...\"发出几声呜咽，这幅样子有些过于不成器，其实不想被认识的人看见"}
{"time": 1764529701, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1617886203", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=301495968][CQ:at,qq=825734198] “舒茉喝了点酒...现在很难受，可以帮她治疗一下吗”"}
{"time": 1764529760, "type": "recv", "message_id": "584996866", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（诶，基督教教义是不是，忌酗酒来着）"}
{"time": 1764529813, "type": "recv", "message_id": "411102095", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我也没酗酒啊，我就像是做礼拜喝了杯葡萄酒)"}
{"time": 1764529830, "type": "recv", "message_id": "841204377", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（只是这么一说）"}
{"time": 1764529838, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1921145404", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不记得有没有记错）"}
{"time": 1764529850, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1363369793", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(hh，原来是不忌酗酒)"}
{"time": 1764529856, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1367554854", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(忌醉酒)"}
{"time": 1764529950, "type": "recv", "message_id": "154164271", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“醉酒啊……”露莉亚点头，一手托着托盘，另一手拿出钥匙打开门“……先带她进去吧”"}
{"time": 1764530096, "type": "recv", "message_id": "712006164", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"没...\"但只敢小声嗫嚅，不敢在她面前说出来"}
{"time": 1764530115, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1083467465", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯。谢谢露莉亚姐姐...”抱着舒茉进去"}
{"time": 1764530480, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1124420588", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "房间里的陈设简单得像是旅店房间，一张木板桌，一张铺着素白床单的木架床，还有几个敞着口的储物柜，放着些衣物和日用品。装饰很少，只有些羽翼状的挂饰或摆件。含有宗教意味的装饰尤其少，除了银质的烛台，只有一本书皮上带着十字装饰的卷经摆在桌上。"}
{"time": 1764530682, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1331929112", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“把舒茉先放到床上？”征求一下露莉亚的同意"}
{"time": 1764530683, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1580470902", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(原来我网卡了)"}
{"time": 1764530727, "type": "recv", "message_id": "160598689", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "露莉亚把餐盘放在桌上，示意你把舒茉放在床上，自己则蹲在床边，伸手盖在舒茉的小腹上“抱歉，我只能缓解她的不适。酒属食粮，我不能消解它，只能等它被排出，或者中和。简单来说……食补”"}
{"time": 1764530792, "type": "recv", "message_id": "654124898", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唔...\"想看一看她的动作，但是有点有心无力，干脆闭上眼不看"}
{"time": 1764530813, "type": "recv", "message_id": "900505221", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢露莉亚姐姐...”"}
{"time": 1764530953, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1694281363", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "依旧是熟悉的金绿色光芒，舒茉只觉得腹部翻腾的辛辣感被抚平成暖流，视线也清明了一些。头还是有些晕，四肢依旧有些不灵光，但已经不影响思考了"}
{"time": 1764531014, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1874710017", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“之后，吃点东西，或者喝点牛奶，应该就好了”"}
{"time": 1764531062, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1783526441", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢姐姐...”总算能松一口气了“那个...姐姐，怎么收费”"}
{"time": 1764531163, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1805644469", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"思考开始逐渐回转，\"谢谢...姐姐...\"虽然还是很丢脸，捂着脸，想要从床上爬起来"}
{"time": 1764531321, "type": "recv", "message_id": "875554131", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“既然还是孩子，就不收你们钱了”她摇头，依旧带着面具般不变的微笑"}
{"time": 1764531341, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1882881080", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"姐姐...可以帮舒茉...也看看魔力吗？\"醉酒时听到伊恩说的事情倒是记得很清晰。"}
{"time": 1764531367, "type": "recv", "message_id": "329679437", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（趁机偷偷看她过去（）"}
