{"time": 1764531774, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2040417829", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我不保证一定正确。不过，让我看看吧”她对你伸出手"}
{"time": 1764531788, "type": "recv", "message_id": "985012989", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "递出手，\"嗯...谢谢姐姐...\""}
{"time": 1764531899, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2110264102", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（释放？）"}
{"time": 1764532043, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1466643847", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "放出自己的魔力?或者说雾气"}
{"time": 1764532206, "type": "recv", "message_id": "176120316", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……好……奇妙。既轻快，又厚重；既灵动，又坚实……非常……矛盾”露莉亚摇头“我从没见过这样的魔力”"}
{"time": 1764532357, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1825133704", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=176120316]\"呃...什么意思?\"继续放出自己的雾气，\"不太懂...\""}
{"time": 1764532435, "type": "recv", "message_id": "442199986", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我也不明白，只是……感受”露莉亚摇头“希望不会带来困扰”"}
{"time": 1764532530, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1988972772", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这样...姐姐也不清楚的话...\"收回自己的魔力，\"谢谢姐姐...这次也麻烦您了...舒茉沾酒就有点...不太正常...\""}
{"time": 1764532921, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1005427930", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“没关系，大家都有会犯错的时候”她把桌上的面包和牛奶端过来“要是一时走不动，可以先吃这些”"}
{"time": 1764533063, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1324469805", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这怎么好意思...这本来就是您的\""}
{"time": 1764533198, "type": "recv", "message_id": "135762506", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "尝试站起身，\"麻烦您的事已经很多了...舒茉先告辞...谢礼之后...\""}
{"time": 1764533285, "type": "recv", "message_id": "234113654", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "她只是端着托盘，看你没接，也没有强求的意思“那，请慢走。愿神指引你的道路”"}
{"time": 1764533461, "type": "recv", "message_id": "904696646", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "点头...今天发生的事情打从心底不想让爸爸妈妈知道，但是...其实又有些让妈妈知道，矛盾的感觉在心底盘旋，晕晕乎乎站起身，\"回去酒馆吧...\""}
