{"time": 1764551517, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1501690674", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“...不行，舒茉这次必须听我的....我们吃个饭就早点回去休息吧...”"}
