{"time": 1764556649, "type": "recv", "message_id": "658034641", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（总之就，有点咸味的水分多的，还不用怎么动筷子，一勺接一勺就行的）"}
{"time": 1764556658, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1843459191", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "给舒茉点一碗白粥，然后点个小葱豆腐，一碗米饭，炒个油麦"}
