{"time": 1764560984, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1294100779", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（没什么好说的）"}
{"time": 1764560990, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1349921428", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不...不是...\"有些不知道该怎么表达，\"舒茉...先是没有好好照顾好自己...又偷偷跑去喝酒...肯定让妈妈很失望吧...\"说着又低下头"}
{"time": 1764561051, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1744437395", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“都怪我....都是我的错...不是我让舒茉伤心的话，舒茉也不会去喝酒...”"}
{"time": 1764561204, "type": "recv", "message_id": "266250343", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"舒茉...看见妈妈之前的样子...心里很难受...也想试一试...但是...\"咬了咬嘴唇，\"我果然...喝不了酒...\""}
{"time": 1764561231, "type": "recv", "message_id": "350078278", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“mo，真是的”她抬手锤了一下汉斯的上臂，发出清脆的噼啪声“你看，我就说会当坏榜样吧？”\n“好好好……”汉斯有些吃痛，赔笑道“都是我的错，我的错”"}
{"time": 1764561376, "type": "recv", "message_id": "725230248", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（吃饭）"}
