{"time": 1764563910, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2130578762", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(这里该相逢一笑泯恩仇了，先喝再说)"}
{"time": 1764564030, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1212204832", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那种事情还是别了”汉斯开口“我们问过索西雅小姐了，给你们俩调的酒度数都差不多，都只是基础款。再去也只能喝果汁了”"}
{"time": 1764564122, "type": "recv", "message_id": "437347749", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2130578762]（新三国舒茉）"}
{"time": 1764564127, "type": "recv", "message_id": "850052456", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"所以，当时爸爸妈妈一直都在旁边看着?\"眨了眨眼，\"我喝的时候也在看吗？\""}
{"time": 1764564131, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1067370138", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（酒是至高无上的存在）"}
{"time": 1764564136, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1789572683", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(?)"}
{"time": 1764564142, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1059408517", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(从今日起，戒酒)"}
{"time": 1764564152, "type": "recv", "message_id": "802349933", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(新三国不熟)"}
{"time": 1764564161, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1372097608", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你说我也接不上梗啊)"}
{"time": 1764564171, "type": "recv", "message_id": "699625610", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不行、不行……我还能……”舒蕾的话头被汉斯敲额头打断“好了好了，舒蕾也差不多了……你不说这话可能还能喝点”"}
{"time": 1764564195, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1502135654", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我只是想说也许新三国的人不是全都逆天，但全都是酒蒙子，不管干什么事都要喝酒）"}
{"time": 1764564219, "type": "recv", "message_id": "781379644", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(好的)"}
{"time": 1764564279, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1223660972", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=850052456]“也没有，但是你们跑出去的动静太大了嘛，舒茉蓝头发又特别显眼”舒蕾撅了噘嘴，这才不提酒的事“起码不是一个人去的，算你还有点心眼……”"}
{"time": 1764564300, "type": "recv", "message_id": "530528559", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;挠头&#93;,file=8D5C754CAACCC39ED88722B15BE3C81E.jpg,sub_type=7,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhR8j15zThYJMOd6bWHhyY0IS6FrZhjl0QIg_woo3-b9ocqbkQMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQNfvpbK1jOU5Out6HZ1OjuXoCR3WCAQJuag&amp;rkey=CAQSMA-b30-V60pVEAA_Q8UbfipRyDn3OO2x_ABX4jI-BCtr94B6ZUHdn8rIjjel4uSCAA,file_size=43237]"}
{"time": 1764564350, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1017297088", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我也...可以...至少现在都没醉。\"但是说出口总有些没底气，听完妈妈的话，更是有点尴尬地笑了笑，\"原本我打算一个人去的...在门口遇见了...\""}
{"time": 1764564462, "type": "recv", "message_id": "528469561", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“以后不要一个人去喝酒。。。不对，舒茉以后不准喝酒”"}
{"time": 1764564500, "type": "recv", "message_id": "450352470", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“啊啊，那怎么行！”舒蕾伸出手，越过桌面捏住了你的耳朵，自己的身体也半越过桌面，嘴巴几乎要贴到你耳朵旁边“这种事情绝对不可以再做，绝对！”"}
{"time": 1764564544, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1600283486", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“好了好了……”汉斯打着哈哈，抱着舒蕾的腰把她拖回来“这种事情你也干过好几次吧……初次见面的时候不就……”"}
{"time": 1764564606, "type": "recv", "message_id": "773198600", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“唔……”舒蕾嘟起嘴，松开捏着耳朵的手“那时候我已经是冠军了嘛……又没人打得过我……”说是这么说，她的声音却越来越心虚"}
{"time": 1764564810, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1727250485", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "忽然觉得心情舒畅了一些，\"嗯嗯...妈妈也干过这种事?\"手心揉揉耳朵尖，\"那舒茉做一样的事...也算情有可原——\"眨眨眼睛，说完连忙摆摆手，\"舒茉知道了啦，以后不会一个人去喝酒的...\""}
{"time": 1764564827, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1024971033", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不对，舒茉以后不能喝酒”"}
{"time": 1764564977, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1883476876", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哪有...我现在明明没有醉吧。\"虽然在嘴硬，但是自己好像真的不太能沾酒精的样子，\"我还要，和妈妈一起试试。\""}
{"time": 1764565004, "type": "recv", "message_id": "485470851", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你刚刚...反正不准喝”"}
{"time": 1764565124, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1069314771", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（翔哥，你发一句话只有话，不带神态动作，不会觉得难受吗（）"}
{"time": 1764565172, "type": "recv", "message_id": "103925680", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "义正言辞的说道，态度坚决"}
{"time": 1764565181, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1578095816", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“喝酒这种事……总是不需要的时候就会觉得不好了”汉斯不置可否，只是这么提了一嘴"}
{"time": 1764565200, "type": "recv", "message_id": "636512462", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（看不懂）"}
{"time": 1764565228, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1334852142", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好比时候才会想起来纵欲的坏处）"}
{"time": 1764565235, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1816284881", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好比事后才会想起来纵欲的坏处）"}
{"time": 1764565240, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1855660302", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1764565261, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1242964832", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（情感到位的时候，就是会忘记一些条框的）"}
{"time": 1764565268, "type": "recv", "message_id": "392100416", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“舒茉明明喝一口就那么难受了...为什么一直想和”"}
