{"time": 1764573158, "type": "recv", "message_id": "860255170", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1977293676]“那还日算了吧”舒蕾连忙开口“起码先稀释个……三倍？不过兑水了也不好喝诶……”"}
{"time": 1764573737, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1242224377", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "撒了葱花和豉油的清蒸冬瓜排骨和两例虾球味噌汤也很快上了桌。味噌汤内两颗蛋黄大小的虾球在赭色的豆粉中沉浮，鲜甜的香气弥散，顺着食道直勾不安的胃袋"}
{"time": 1764574026, "type": "recv", "message_id": "139031908", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "稀释三倍都来了，\"呃..\"有稍稍些不满，\"我只是想试一词...一次——"}
{"time": 1764574928, "type": "recv", "message_id": "927327093", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那就……”舒蕾想了想“我们两个喝一杯吧，给你根吸管……”"}
{"time": 1764577154, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1038647726", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（咦，伊神居然醒了吗）"}
{"time": 1764577243, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1759653587", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“.....”无言了，有舒蕾在，想让舒茉不喝酒感觉好难."}
{"time": 1764579097, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2036638622", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（然后呢）"}
