{"time": 1764581034, "type": "recv", "message_id": "853747325", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1242224377]汉斯伸手，把汤盏分别摆在舒蕾和舒茉面前"}
{"time": 1764581087, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1443901659", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“舒茉...现在感觉怎么样，还有力气拿筷子吗”"}
{"time": 1764581216, "type": "recv", "message_id": "931868237", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...没关系...\"拿起勺子，小口小口抿起来，\"妈妈不要点什么平常不喝的很淡的果酒，那算作弊，偷懒啦。\""}
