{"time": 1764581934, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1829113682", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "汉斯叔叔也没说什么...哎，算了...最后一次，以后再也不会让舒茉碰酒了"}
{"time": 1764581993, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1387725626", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（等以后舒茉边喝边笑你就不会这么觉得了（）"}
{"time": 1764582018, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2007262503", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（这次是因为边喝边哭）"}
{"time": 1764582149, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2122834505", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=931868237]“嗯……到时候给你发一根喝咖啡的细吸管……”她咯咯笑着“不许一口喝一杯了，好浪费诶……”"}
{"time": 1764582285, "type": "recv", "message_id": "981547151", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(咦，我居然觉得舒蕾是一口喝一杯的类型)"}
{"time": 1764582356, "type": "recv", "message_id": "909172720", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（喝那种没味道的烈酒才会吧）"}
{"time": 1764582366, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1905026520", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你去月光酒馆，肯定）"}
{"time": 1764582373, "type": "recv", "message_id": "388411120", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不这么喝啊）"}
{"time": 1764582497, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1495439120", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯嗯...\"囫囵喝下一杯的时候，确实没感觉出明显的味道，\"妈妈说得对啦，刚刚喝下去的时候...几乎没感觉到什么味道。\"一口一口喝汤，肚子里渗出暖流，终于不像之前一样一直有股恶寒。"}
{"time": 1764582562, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2006280510", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "吃着米饭就着菜，自己中午几乎没吃饭，再加上背着舒茉走了好长好长一段路 现在已经饿的前胸贴后背了"}
{"time": 1764582693, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1288811738", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "汤处理得很好，完全吃不出虾或木鱼花的腥味。暖意从腹中升起，连带舌根剩的苦涩也一同洗去"}
{"time": 1764582817, "type": "recv", "message_id": "548740869", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "葱烧豆腐裹着饱满却不糊嗓子的汤汁，咸鲜可口，相当下饭。冬瓜蒸排骨火候恰到好处，冬瓜可以轻松夹断，蔬菜的清香和肉汁相互渗透，吃着完全不逊于大肉菜"}
{"time": 1764582875, "type": "recv", "message_id": "695034444", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "这么多人，味道果然不错，虽然很饿，但也不敢太失礼，慢慢的吃着"}
{"time": 1764582927, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1885156602", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "放下心结之后不自觉喝完了整碗，\"唔...\"放下勺子，摸了摸肚子，还是不打算打饭，随便夹点菜下肚。"}
{"time": 1764583203, "type": "recv", "message_id": "487157030", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "自己这时的胃口大体上很快就不想继续了，放下筷子，等着其他人吃完，双手叠在桌上，很期待待会的事情。"}
{"time": 1764583235, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2024528653", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（给你点的鱼汤是不是没喝）"}
{"time": 1764583244, "type": "recv", "message_id": "264204741", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "舒蕾倒是很快喝完了汤，留了个汤底，就着米饭喝起了汤泡饭。汉斯也差不多，不过用的是稍后上桌的鱼汤"}
{"time": 1764583248, "type": "recv", "message_id": "243983800", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（因为还没上啊）"}
{"time": 1764583463, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1711270184", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "今天发生的事情能够平稳落地，松了口气，待会就以喝到意识戛然而止为目标好了，暗暗决定好。"}
{"time": 1764583482, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1058500925", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我觉得吃完饭就该困了）"}
{"time": 1764583508, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1845864154", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（一天又哭又笑又逛街，最后暖烘烘吃顿饱的）"}
{"time": 1764583541, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1327072001", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（这样看的话，我好像快昏迷了啊（）"}
{"time": 1764583546, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1666356195", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(是，但是有人会强撑着)"}
{"time": 1764583557, "type": "recv", "message_id": "623820093", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我的意思是）"}
{"time": 1764583565, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1764335442", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（舒蕾先睡了你怎么办（）"}
{"time": 1764583632, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2104369425", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那就跟着睡)"}
{"time": 1764583657, "type": "recv", "message_id": "362982378", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（算了，喝一杯再睡吧.jpg）"}
{"time": 1764583676, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1425939112", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(本质是和妈妈一起做事，肯定，以她优先咯)"}
{"time": 1764583795, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1035386672", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "不多时，桌上的菜消得差不多了。舒蕾看着也有些眼神迷离，越发用力地抱着汉斯的胳膊。汉斯没有办法，只能把钱拿出来“你们去买下单吧。然后……舒蕾，还走得动？”"}
{"time": 1764583888, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1816457717", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "舒蕾像是在课堂上打瞌睡被点名的学生一般猛抬头“啊？唔……可以”"}
{"time": 1764583934, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1851279121", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "酒足饭饱，接过钱，去结账，吃饱了之后感觉困困的，想想也是，白天毕竟干了那么多事那么累，忍不住连打了几个哈欠...但是得跟着一起，要不到时候汉斯叔叔背着两个人肯定会很累"}
{"time": 1764584054, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1151206099", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"妈妈要是不行的话...\"一脸笑意坐到她旁边，忍不住在她眼前挥手，\"回去睡觉也可以啦。\""}
{"time": 1764584112, "type": "recv", "message_id": "776357597", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "感觉最近冰元素用的好多，是自己一直太亢奋了吗...用魔力提提神，精神一点"}
{"time": 1764584288, "type": "recv", "message_id": "594459890", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "努力掩藏住自己的疲态“....舒茉还能走吗...还晕吗..要不我背你过去吧...”"}
{"time": 1764584396, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1429417689", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1151206099]“嗯……还……还可以”她哼唧着，但是眼皮又耷拉下去。汉斯耸了耸肩“要不我们在路上买一瓶……放她们回房间自己喝去”"}
{"time": 1764584591, "type": "recv", "message_id": "284809651", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“感觉....不看着的话...很不放心”"}
{"time": 1764584663, "type": "recv", "message_id": "87001545", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那……伊恩觉得？”"}
{"time": 1764584690, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1330512710", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"没事...我自己走也没问题...\"伸手掐了掐妈妈的脸，\"哼哼...妈妈明明酒量也不怎么好呢。\""}
{"time": 1764584709, "type": "recv", "message_id": "945047404", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“...现在我去买两瓶酒过来...在这里喝完然后回去睡觉？”"}
{"time": 1764584730, "type": "recv", "message_id": "623583231", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（她也没说过自己酒量好啊（）"}
{"time": 1764584750, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1835334779", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=945047404]（那他妈为什么不在酒店里喝完睡觉呢）"}
{"time": 1764584761, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1609241995", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(确实)"}
{"time": 1764584790, "type": "recv", "message_id": "767683252", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“在酒店喝也可以吧...不过感觉也得在旁边看着”"}
{"time": 1764584836, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2127070891", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"为什么不回旅馆?\"说完之后注意力就不在这边，双手齐上，轻轻揉搓，小声开口\"妈妈觉得舒茉的新衣服怎么样?\""}
{"time": 1764584860, "type": "recv", "message_id": "373358656", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嘛……区别不大”汉斯点点头，这就搀起舒蕾“走了老婆，我们去……月光酒馆”"}
{"time": 1764584883, "type": "recv", "message_id": "64437947", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2127070891]（我会说忘了说了，不过其实，大概也确实没注意）"}
{"time": 1764585052, "type": "recv", "message_id": "726614425", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2127070891]“嗯……嗯？”舒蕾睁开眼，揉了揉眼睛“喔，很好看……就该穿这样的……哼……”"}
{"time": 1764585140, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1440072981", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "虽然舒茉说自己能走，但还是扶着她"}
{"time": 1764585214, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1645585822", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "妈妈现在的样子比自己醉得还厉害，跟着一起起身，既然伊恩来扶着的话...稍微点点头，没说什么，跟着爸妈去酒馆。"}
{"time": 1764585246, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1520650819", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（路上买什么，你们自己看着办里）"}
{"time": 1764585492, "type": "recv", "message_id": "824183007", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "路上看看有没有粮食酒，\"伊恩，能帮着买一瓶吗...\""}
{"time": 1764585550, "type": "recv", "message_id": "64834538", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎，白酒）"}
{"time": 1764585562, "type": "recv", "message_id": "608006177", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不过啤酒也算）"}
{"time": 1764585568, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1957881534", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（粮食酒）"}
{"time": 1764585708, "type": "recv", "message_id": "245322449", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(确实也算，但我说的肯定是)"}
{"time": 1764585757, "type": "recv", "message_id": "901524225", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "不过先确认一下路是往哪边走，自己其实也就靠着一口气吊着，困倦感还是相当浓郁。"}
{"time": 1764585785, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1351486091", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "当然还是，往旅店走的"}
{"time": 1764585793, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1594202836", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（[CQ:at,qq=1040972910] ）"}
{"time": 1764585831, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1932158679", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我说买两瓶换下包装（）"}
{"time": 1764585885, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1371993478", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...那舒茉小心一点，别摔着了”去到商店“老板你这里度数最低的酒是什么，给我来两瓶”"}
{"time": 1764585912, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1485806100", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那你的包装换在哪了）"}
{"time": 1764585922, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1588338905", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（先买酒，在问包装的事情）"}
{"time": 1764585976, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1004366739", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "被伊恩松开之后自然地紧凑到妈妈身边靠着，很喜欢靠在她身上时的安心感。"}
{"time": 1764585992, "type": "recv", "message_id": "325412535", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“度数最低……米酒，花酒，或者酒糟呗。要哪种？”"}
{"time": 1764586027, "type": "recv", "message_id": "828557726", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“就米酒吧.....”应该也算粮食酒“可以帮我换下包装吗，换成烈酒的”"}
{"time": 1764586045, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1984269205", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（就有没有可能）"}
{"time": 1764586049, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1384166316", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（都是配套的呢）"}
{"time": 1764586074, "type": "recv", "message_id": "368842562", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（hh,万一老板心善就给换了）"}
{"time": 1764586101, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1070856919", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不行的话...再来瓶烈酒吧，米酒也就只要一瓶好了”"}
{"time": 1764586142, "type": "recv", "message_id": "164665325", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“？”他愣了愣，大概没听过这样的要求“要么是瓶装贴标签，要么是礼盒的。不买可没办法换……”"}
{"time": 1764586174, "type": "recv", "message_id": "103914667", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emm，一瓶米酒，一瓶烈酒，这样可以吧”"}
{"time": 1764586263, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1676134527", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“行”总之它给你挑了两瓶，瓶身比较接近的，一瓶是高度的白酒，一瓶则是带点乳白色的米酒"}
{"time": 1764586447, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1668917024", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（《它》）"}
{"time": 1764586466, "type": "recv", "message_id": "542185353", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢老板”交钱，然后把两瓶酒的标签换一下"}
{"time": 1764586493, "type": "recv", "message_id": "555718759", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（）"}
{"time": 1764586495, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2054186186", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（别管）"}
{"time": 1764586509, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1447146811", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "一共15银"}
{"time": 1764586519, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1051176724", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你们还记得你们有多少钱吗）"}
{"time": 1764586528, "type": "recv", "message_id": "863037237", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我的钱早记不清了（）"}
{"time": 1764586539, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1301796540", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1764586546, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1586396783", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我还有1金80银的样子)"}
{"time": 1764586558, "type": "recv", "message_id": "547543623", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我只记得之前汉斯给了我金币去开房间）"}
{"time": 1764586581, "type": "recv", "message_id": "808611452", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=219613303]（至于这里，2金币肯定多了.jpg）"}
{"time": 1764586584, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1530262487", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（当时好像剩了一些，我没还回去，然后本身大概一金左右，然后舒茉又给了30）"}
{"time": 1764586813, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1378832875", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "靠着妈妈，听见她稳定均匀像是睡着了的呼吸，自己也自然地在空气里轻微摇摆，困意上涌，拉着她的胳膊一直点头"}
{"time": 1764586865, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1562429666", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1378832875]听起来汉斯身上的负担又重了些，总之伊恩回来了"}
{"time": 1764586982, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1748980132", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"只是随便扫了一眼，轻轻叮咛一声，机械地抬脚继续走。"}
{"time": 1764587026, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1947901965", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "把真烈酒装进小包，然后把“烈酒”拿在手上“我回来了，我们继续走吧，舒茉看起来好像很累的样子？要不我来背你吧”"}
{"time": 1764587100, "type": "recv", "message_id": "345772616", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不走的话...会睡着...\"其实已经有些抬不起眼皮了，半眯着眼睛有些勉强，\"嗯...嗯...\""}
{"time": 1764587274, "type": "recv", "message_id": "595278824", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "搀扶着舒茉“靠着我吧...我还不是很累..”嘴硬道"}
{"time": 1764587541, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1025358973", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"松开妈妈，等着伊恩靠过来，打了个长长的哈欠。"}
{"time": 1764587581, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1507365364", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“走吧”承担着舒茉一部分的重量，慢慢朝旅馆走去"}
{"time": 1764587604, "type": "recv", "message_id": "471954757", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（感觉过力量好邪恶）"}
{"time": 1764587819, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1423634878", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=471954757]（过力量是不是还有惩罚骰）"}
{"time": 1764587860, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1220412880", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不过了，万一摔了好变态）"}
{"time": 1764588009, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1073316807", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "总之是到了，尽管一路上多少有点东倒西歪"}
{"time": 1764588045, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1506825203", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "一路上都有些半睡半醒，自己的状态...\"嗯——\"朝伊恩伸手要刚买的酒瓶。"}
{"time": 1764588074, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1717274497", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎，小酒鬼，最后一次啦，以后别碰酒了”把“烈酒”递过去"}
{"time": 1764588262, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1828190010", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "接过来，也没仔细看，\"妈——\"拖着长音拉着她的胳膊，不知道她有没有睡着"}
{"time": 1764588361, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1358092952", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……我知道我知道……到了”她推搡着汉斯进了门，倒也没管是哪里的门“嗯……好困……”"}
{"time": 1764588496, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1214339832", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "被带着一起进去，\"那...妈妈睡吧...\"一边打着哈欠一边自己拧开瓶盖。"}
{"time": 1764588538, "type": "recv", "message_id": "60352038", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我突然想到好邪恶的桥段）"}
{"time": 1764588567, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1169672972", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（如果是点酒上酒，那就需要一个侍者。但是舒蕾再怎么样也不至于认不出你们）"}
{"time": 1764588578, "type": "recv", "message_id": "433126053", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那是不是轮到某人女装出场了）"}
{"time": 1764588739, "type": "recv", "message_id": "811539574", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那也太邪恶了)"}
{"time": 1764588785, "type": "recv", "message_id": "794015795", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "升降梯很快到了三楼，汉斯摸出舒蕾房间的钥匙，打开了门，用最后的力气把她架了进去，这才喘出气来"}
{"time": 1764588913, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1683367209", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "在路上闻闻开封之后的味道，后几步才进门，把酒瓶随手放在桌上，帮着安顿好妈妈。"}
{"time": 1764588940, "type": "recv", "message_id": "812249341", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“叔叔先去休息？我来看着她们两”"}
{"time": 1764588986, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1907765035", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你在）"}
{"time": 1764588991, "type": "recv", "message_id": "603364273", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（说什么）"}
{"time": 1764588995, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1637717911", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你觉得合适吗）"}
{"time": 1764589011, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1614454191", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你觉得合适吗)"}
{"time": 1764589020, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1287257392", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（你觉得合适吗）"}
{"time": 1764589035, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1472241384", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(有点变态)"}
{"time": 1764589134, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1565460564", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“所以舒茉还要喝吗...阿姨都这个样子了”"}
{"time": 1764589214, "type": "recv", "message_id": "357555616", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "舒蕾靠在床头，看得出来在努力睁眼了。身上的酒气倒是已经散了不少"}
{"time": 1764589242, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2102130000", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"没事没事...我有分寸的。\"坐在母亲旁边，\"让妈妈睡吧。\"给她盖上被子，\"爸爸和伊恩也早点休息。\"自己也不住地打哈欠"}
{"time": 1764589356, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2120769814", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那晚安了”自己也累的"}
{"time": 1764589359, "type": "recv", "message_id": "973831541", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "不得了"}
{"time": 1764589444, "type": "recv", "message_id": "405818751", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……我一会回去”汉斯坐在沙发上，远远地看着坐在床上的你们，大概对你的“分寸”没有那么放心"}
{"time": 1764589477, "type": "recv", "message_id": "216306506", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(唉干嘛，打算白毛小鼠偷烛花)"}
{"time": 1764589520, "type": "recv", "message_id": "984769046", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯....”回去先洗漱一下，然后坐在床上“酒真的有那么好喝吗...”拿出另一瓶酒捧在手上思考"}
{"time": 1764589588, "type": "recv", "message_id": "659766159", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "爸爸在倒是问题不大，起身去拿已经开了的酒瓶，\"嗯...舒茉先试试...\"先轻轻喝一口尝试一下"}
{"time": 1764589603, "type": "recv", "message_id": "541116533", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(虽然这个世界上真的有醉米酒的人)"}
{"time": 1764589611, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1617681546", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(说起来有点变态)"}
{"time": 1764589692, "type": "recv", "message_id": "881321855", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "实践得真知，我到要看看，这东西到底有什么吸引人的，打开瓶盖，小小抿一口"}
{"time": 1764589779, "type": "recv", "message_id": "17079673", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嘶....好辣....”这种东西到底有什么好喜欢的啊，好难喝...但是阿姨喝的那么开心，会不会是喝的方式不对...找一个小杯子，倒上满满一杯"}
{"time": 1764589809, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1271503425", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=659766159]入口没有多少烧灼的感觉，芳香藏在酸甜的头调后，冲击力远没有先前喝过的那么强"}
{"time": 1764589863, "type": "recv", "message_id": "185365517", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "再抿一口确认一下"}
{"time": 1764589892, "type": "recv", "message_id": "534387114", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "还是好辣...难道要一口闷吗...."}
{"time": 1764589904, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1727539740", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...?\"放下瓶子，知道自己好像被伊恩做局了，摇摇脑袋，\"爸爸也回去休息吧，这一瓶就算是舒茉喝完也不会醉的。\""}
{"time": 1764589947, "type": "recv", "message_id": "438754929", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你的意思是，你不让舒茉喝，自己先整上)"}
{"time": 1764589949, "type": "recv", "message_id": "631352617", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=534387114]仍是辛辣得直冲鼻腔。酒气从胃里上涌，几乎要挤走鼻腔里的空气，不咳出来就没法好好呼吸"}
{"time": 1764589986, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1475247940", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“咳咳咳...”到底谁会喜欢这种东西啊...."}
{"time": 1764590025, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1460095548", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "一杯猛的下肚，感觉头好像晕晕的"}
{"time": 1764590038, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1708327075", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1727539740]“就是这种想法才最容易出问题……”汉斯摇摇头，拿了个杯子放在桌边“大概……倒个六、七分吧，剩下的我拿走”"}
{"time": 1764590089, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1981943553", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "眼前似乎一阵阵的黑“咦，谁把灯关了吗”抱着瓶子坐在床上"}
{"time": 1764590127, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1143034129", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那倒也不会两眼一黑）"}
{"time": 1764590143, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1911793244", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（两眼一黑是贫血，但两眼一红倒是有可能）"}
{"time": 1764590145, "type": "recv", "message_id": "264450291", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "恍惚间好像看到蓝色的身影在身边徘徊“？这是什么？”揉揉眼睛试图看清"}
{"time": 1764590173, "type": "recv", "message_id": "312218619", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "但是什么都没有看到"}
{"time": 1764590191, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1158873467", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "再喝一口确认一下"}
{"time": 1764590255, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1627187883", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "顿时感觉天旋地转，不过这次似乎看清了，好像是舒茉？有些不太确定，很快又再次消失了"}
{"time": 1764590257, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1769636602", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "乖乖点着头，朝杯子里倒酒，估摸着差不多了把酒瓶递给爸爸，\"这明明是米酒吧——\"打个哈欠。"}
{"time": 1764590275, "type": "recv", "message_id": "733023218", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(按理说，喝白酒是后劲大，不是喝了就马上有事)"}
{"time": 1764590284, "type": "recv", "message_id": "97608685", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你这不是喝酒，你是在吸毒)"}
{"time": 1764590293, "type": "recv", "message_id": "32400850", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（呵呵）"}
{"time": 1764590350, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1808142857", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（呛是真的呛）"}
{"time": 1764590357, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2018066829", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是我还没喝醉过）"}
{"time": 1764590362, "type": "recv", "message_id": "953438256", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我第一次喝白酒就晕晕的，热热的，不过没幻觉就是了）"}
{"time": 1764590370, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1009775256", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我也没喝醉过）"}
{"time": 1764590372, "type": "recv", "message_id": "295968814", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（所以除了心动过速）"}
{"time": 1764590377, "type": "recv", "message_id": "247386286", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（倒是没什么反应）"}
{"time": 1764590388, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1093162294", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我当时喝了大概五六小杯就没喝了，就感觉头有点晕）"}
{"time": 1764590402, "type": "recv", "message_id": "228662582", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(不可能有幻觉的)"}
{"time": 1764590420, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1989309624", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我都没喝醉过)"}
{"time": 1764590423, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1470548610", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=228662582]（但是其实只是眼花了）"}
{"time": 1764590429, "type": "recv", "message_id": "554832570", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（该说醉话了）"}
{"time": 1764590446, "type": "recv", "message_id": "851737474", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我看你这是海洛因本色了)"}
{"time": 1764590451, "type": "recv", "message_id": "913929577", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(加了几个cl)"}
{"time": 1764590486, "type": "recv", "message_id": "170495899", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(喝酒其实最后是断片，酒品好的话。)"}
{"time": 1764590497, "type": "recv", "message_id": "791415828", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(酒品不好就会发癫)"}
{"time": 1764590518, "type": "recv", "message_id": "684941303", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(还好我一直属于理中客，喝完还能大杀四方铂金局)"}
{"time": 1764590588, "type": "recv", "message_id": "735623856", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "定睛一看，还是什么都没有，指着瓶子“是不是你这家伙...把舒茉藏起来了....都怪你...舒茉...才那么难受...我...我要....我要...消灭你...”提起瓶子咕咚咕咚的灌"}
{"time": 1764590646, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1636834771", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1769636602]“作为练习来说，恰到好处吧”汉斯接过瓶子“反倒是烈酒没什么味道，也很少专门喝那种”"}
{"time": 1764590647, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1951469921", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(想猝死可以这么喝)"}
{"time": 1764590659, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1758459617", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我说有点神人）"}
{"time": 1764590670, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2029211132", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不是有点）"}
{"time": 1764590692, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1532867323", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(不是有点)"}
{"time": 1764590705, "type": "recv", "message_id": "581477202", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1951469921]（普通人可能会猝死，但我是七级的传奇冒险家）"}
{"time": 1764590723, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1680956567", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=735623856]虽然这么想着，但喝了一两口就喝不下去了“好....好难喝”"}
{"time": 1764590740, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1479432001", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这种东西...到底...到底谁会喜欢啊”"}
{"time": 1764590743, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1353064408", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(一次喝一斤白酒，这世上有人能做到吗)"}
{"time": 1764590752, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1149580144", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（喝出了幻觉还对瓶吹）"}
{"time": 1764590753, "type": "recv", "message_id": "519805052", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“咳咳咳......”"}
{"time": 1764590758, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1169631222", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(一口气不停，那我觉得喝完了人也就走了)"}
{"time": 1764590761, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1805867920", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（吃菌子也没这样的）"}
{"time": 1764590774, "type": "recv", "message_id": "510610345", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(挺安详的)"}
{"time": 1764590778, "type": "recv", "message_id": "955224076", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1149580144]（提现了我对酒精的仇恨（）"}
{"time": 1764590825, "type": "recv", "message_id": "795265427", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1636834771]\"妈——\"端着杯子坐回床边，\"舒茉喝完了就不能再生舒茉的气了——\""}
{"time": 1764590833, "type": "recv", "message_id": "341317829", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=519805052]显然不会止于咳嗽，咳嗽是正反馈，一旦开始就停不下来了。染上酒味的胃液也添一把柴，结果自然是……呕吐"}
{"time": 1764590909, "type": "recv", "message_id": "422716240", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“呕....”在床边大吐特吐，随后积累了一天的疲惫也压制不住了，小头一歪，昏了过去"}
{"time": 1764590936, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1914278408", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（感觉有点抖m在的）"}
{"time": 1764590952, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2011746939", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（越难喝越喝说是）"}
{"time": 1764591051, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1188450892", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那我搞得动静，他们能听到吗）"}
{"time": 1764591100, "type": "recv", "message_id": "58435945", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=795265427]“嗯……嗯”她没有接杯子，而是突然伸手抱住你，杯子差点打翻在床上“生气……为什么生气。我爱舒茉……”"}
{"time": 1764591270, "type": "recv", "message_id": "394912485", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1188450892]（没区别吧，回来就能看见了）"}
{"time": 1764591324, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1876533225", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（诶，那你瓶子怎么了）"}
{"time": 1764591332, "type": "recv", "message_id": "640912049", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你还记得盖回去吗）"}
{"time": 1764591365, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1270881233", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我本来写的是放瓶子到地上，但是倒了...但是你说我已经吐了，我就把那段删了（）"}
{"time": 1764591399, "type": "recv", "message_id": "464015700", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "虽然一下没反应过来，但是还好手很稳，\"嗯...\"把杯子放在床头柜上，\"因为...今天妈妈掉了眼泪...舒茉真的很害怕...我...我怎么都不想看见妈妈落泪的样子。\"反手抱住她，把整个人都埋进她的怀里，吸着鼻子。"}
{"time": 1764591416, "type": "recv", "message_id": "926394781", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1270881233]（那这种喝法还能不吐吗）"}
{"time": 1764591486, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1490716918", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"舒茉觉得...肯定惹了妈妈生气，而且...也不知道该怎么弥补...\"声音不大但是很清晰，\"所以...之前才会不敢看妈妈。\""}
{"time": 1764591639, "type": "recv", "message_id": "885113091", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "汉斯拎起酒瓶，回到了另一边的房间，刚进门就看到了新的亟待解决的狼藉。可惜的是，这个点……好像保洁也已经下班了"}
{"time": 1764591699, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1062054072", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=885113091]（现在才六七点吧（）"}
