{"time": 1764641782, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1596481205", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1340558929]\"舒茉原本觉得...会是断片那种样子呢——\"把自己埋进妈妈怀里，\"这样反而还有些睡不着。\""}
{"time": 1764641959, "type": "recv", "message_id": "205180671", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "实际上稍有些不适——尤其是今天在外面走了一天，新衣服也没那么透气。此时两个酒后的人窝在一起，多少有些黏糊，但舒蕾大概没有去洗漱的打算，看起来也没有醒着的打算"}
{"time": 1764642320, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1972396180", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"吹灭油灯，不管三七二十一，就窝在她怀里，闭眼睡过去。"}
{"time": 1764642982, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1739981023", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（第二天？）"}
{"time": 1764643029, "type": "recv", "message_id": "529617324", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（第二天）"}
{"time": 1764643088, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1393909226", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(第二天吧)"}
{"time": 1764643197, "type": "recv", "message_id": "554337040", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "你们各自醒来，这一觉几乎睡得史无前例。舒蕾还没醒，依旧把舒茉抱在怀里，不带任何表情，呼吸因为缺水而有些滞涩。汉斯看起来刚醒不久，坐在床沿按摩着额角。空气中莫名飘着很淡的酸涩味，但是找不到源头"}
{"time": 1764643376, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1488147775", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "门外有人敲门“您好，请问还要续房吗？”"}
{"time": 1764643379, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1420664508", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嘶....头....好痛”昨晚发生了什么来着，有点不太记得了，好像自己喝了点酒？试图回忆清楚发生了什么，但头感觉疼疼的，继续躺下去"}
{"time": 1764643403, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2061744797", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（咦，这个不是12点问的吗（））"}
{"time": 1764643444, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1717609512", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（对啊）"}
{"time": 1764643454, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1620672403", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你都宿醉了，还想9点醒吗）"}
{"time": 1764643470, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1247690288", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我想着第二天晚上六点醒（））"}
{"time": 1764643484, "type": "recv", "message_id": "494607549", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（要在赫顿玛尔呆几天来着）"}
{"time": 1764643489, "type": "recv", "message_id": "364671188", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那很能睡了）"}
{"time": 1764643492, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1752758128", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你问我？）"}
{"time": 1764643507, "type": "recv", "message_id": "996989489", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我问伊神）"}
{"time": 1764643558, "type": "recv", "message_id": "286228029", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "不想打扰到妈妈安眠，虽然有些渴得厉害，而且有些头疼，闭上眼，尝试再睡一会。"}
{"time": 1764643586, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1396837457", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=996989489](我怎么知道，我又不进阶，随时可以走啊)"}
{"time": 1764643615, "type": "recv", "message_id": "374058210", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（原定是待几天来着，今天就走？）"}
{"time": 1764643653, "type": "recv", "message_id": "153690032", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=286228029]（那你外面肯定也会有人敲门啊（）"}
{"time": 1764643690, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1733530238", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1488147775]“嗯……要的”汉斯摇了摇头，回了神，站起了身“在这里付款可以吧。然后……需要保洁”"}
{"time": 1764643772, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1376956894", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=153690032](不回话)"}
{"time": 1764643797, "type": "recv", "message_id": "156036400", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "等汉斯付完钱，侍者离开后“叔叔...昨晚..发生了什么吗，我有点记不太清了”"}
{"time": 1764643903, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1346372687", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那汉斯肯定一起付过了啊，就不用非得敲开门了）"}
{"time": 1764643929, "type": "recv", "message_id": "842943856", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(是这样，我料到汉斯肯定知道舒蕾起不来)"}
{"time": 1764643979, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1248705538", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我也不知道”汉斯摇头，脸上带着些揶揄“回来的时候看见你抱着半瓶酒昏过去了，地上是不知道谁的呕吐物”"}
{"time": 1764644143, "type": "recv", "message_id": "303084578", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？......对不起....对不起...”连忙道歉，没想到自己也酒后失态了，以后再也不会喝了"}
{"time": 1764644199, "type": "recv", "message_id": "954215479", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“还得多练啊”汉斯没多说什么，一如既往不形于色，你也不知道他到底有没有生气"}
{"time": 1764644329, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1812556681", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“............”想说自己以后再也不会喝了，但感觉有些空口无凭，只能点点头“嗯..好的，叔叔....”"}
{"time": 1764644587, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1103809780", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "有些喜欢被抱在怀里的感觉，贪恋着这份缩在被窝和臂弯里的温暖，很快又睡着了。"}
{"time": 1764644632, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1355400235", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“好了，今天有什么打算？她们应该没这么快醒”汉斯站了起来，看起来打算去先洗漱"}
{"time": 1764644847, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1521683583", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“还有些问题要问索西雅小姐...昨天只聊了一半，不过还是先等舒茉醒来吧，看看她怎么说”"}
{"time": 1764644864, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1489099321", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（为什么要等她）"}
{"time": 1764644873, "type": "recv", "message_id": "880316350", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(为什么等我)"}
{"time": 1764644976, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1441510908", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（因为不想一个人行动）"}
{"time": 1764644997, "type": "recv", "message_id": "953656824", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“为什么？”"}
{"time": 1764645069, "type": "recv", "message_id": "240583990", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm.....不想一个人”"}
{"time": 1764645108, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1348533584", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（然后再带舒茉去一次酒吧？）"}
{"time": 1764645303, "type": "recv", "message_id": "521331663", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（然后再带舒茉去一次酒吧？）"}
{"time": 1764645380, "type": "recv", "message_id": "167339629", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（舒茉不想去怎么办，你就不去了？）"}
{"time": 1764645394, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1389683433", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“她要是不打算去，你怎么办？”"}
{"time": 1764645444, "type": "recv", "message_id": "749934871", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（但其实关于进阶的事已经问完了吧，后面已经在问露莉亚相关了）"}
{"time": 1764645477, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1196952371", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（so？）"}
{"time": 1764645486, "type": "recv", "message_id": "940402775", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你想表达什么）"}
{"time": 1764645495, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1767258090", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“她要是不去的话...我再自己一个人去么”"}
{"time": 1764645516, "type": "recv", "message_id": "135775948", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“事情也不是很急”"}
{"time": 1764645531, "type": "recv", "message_id": "866810179", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（高中生上厕所么）"}
{"time": 1764645592, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1374488098", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（总之叫一下表态度，要不到时候可能会有这么不带我环节）"}
{"time": 1764645612, "type": "recv", "message_id": "142388347", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我倒也没事干，一起？”"}
{"time": 1764645671, "type": "recv", "message_id": "805822948", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“正好保洁还要整理房间”"}
{"time": 1764645675, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1675910590", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“咦？叔叔要和我一起？”有些吃惊“也不是不行吧，不过我们走还是跟她们说一声吧”"}
{"time": 1764645693, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1351214039", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1374488098]（？）"}
{"time": 1764645708, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1043802638", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那就再去一次，反正你去了也不喝）"}
{"time": 1764645751, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2057778036", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1675910590]“让她们接着睡不就好了，非叫起来一次做什么”"}
{"time": 1764645785, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1998850149", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那她们找不到我们不会着急吗...”"}
{"time": 1764645809, "type": "recv", "message_id": "99142470", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（为什么会）"}
{"time": 1764645821, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1224065195", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（四个人里有谁是三岁小孩吗）"}
{"time": 1764645823, "type": "recv", "message_id": "21582203", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（就是字面意思啊）"}
{"time": 1764645827, "type": "recv", "message_id": "669807486", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我是病娇吗)"}
{"time": 1764645838, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1552607829", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（人没有自己的生活吗）"}
{"time": 1764645842, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1794333919", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（四个连体婴？）"}
{"time": 1764645955, "type": "recv", "message_id": "80956526", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……”他有些疑惑，不过表现出来的是无言“为什么？我们也不是残疾人”"}
{"time": 1764645974, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2124155218", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（感觉出门说一声很正常啊，尤其是在这种没有电话的年代）"}
{"time": 1764646014, "type": "recv", "message_id": "271232001", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（人没醒也硬说吗）"}
{"time": 1764646025, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1073269767", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那她要是睡到晚上起来你就跳过一天？）"}
{"time": 1764646040, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1984598993", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（但是我怎么知道人醒了没，我们两还没出过房间吧）"}
{"time": 1764646069, "type": "recv", "message_id": "943469722", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是汉斯知道啊）"}
{"time": 1764646079, "type": "recv", "message_id": "570104275", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（他不知道舒蕾什么酒量吗难道）"}
{"time": 1764646126, "type": "recv", "message_id": "256796397", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（而且留个纸条就解决的事情）"}
