{"time": 1764646594, "type": "recv", "message_id": "8659831", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "写张纸条“有事出去一下”从门缝塞进去，然后去酒馆"}
