{"time": 1764646875, "type": "recv", "message_id": "756347921", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "正午的酒馆，显然没什么人。汉斯换了身便服，走在路上顺便买了两个烧饼，分了你一个"}
{"time": 1764646881, "type": "recv", "message_id": "997935892", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不吃饭的人来了）"}
{"time": 1764647012, "type": "recv", "message_id": "591014929", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢叔叔...”抱着烧饼啃啃"}
{"time": 1764647093, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1346363415", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "大概是梅干菜肉沫的，总之到了。尽管没什么顾客但索西雅还是一个人在柜台后坐着。倒是有工人在前厅修……换桌子"}
{"time": 1764647224, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1576865856", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(要醒应该是等老妈喊了)"}
{"time": 1764647261, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2105478056", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "坐到柜台前“要一杯...牛奶，抱歉索西雅姐姐，昨天那么突然就离开了”"}
{"time": 1764647520, "type": "recv", "message_id": "42326006", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“无妨，我倒是有点好奇后续发生了什么”她排出1枚金币和60枚银币“这是昨天的找零，那小姑娘跑得太快了”"}
{"time": 1764647643, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1601110246", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“后面我带她去找露利亚姐姐看了看...”"}
{"time": 1764647646, "type": "recv", "message_id": "152925204", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（吃饭）"}
{"time": 1764648365, "type": "recv", "message_id": "688470206", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(咦，我在想，16岁很容易就能看出来吗，身高上应该和舒蕾差不多吧)"}
{"time": 1764648423, "type": "recv", "message_id": "400092736", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（和身高有什么关系）"}
