{"time": 1764648764, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1589419123", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=849964041]“嗯哼，昨天聊到哪了？”"}
{"time": 1764648801, "type": "recv", "message_id": "261917784", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“露莉亚姐姐的事情...索西雅姐姐知道多少，感觉她人挺好的，但有时候又怪怪的”"}
{"time": 1764649122, "type": "recv", "message_id": "303446403", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“和她有关的话题不算多，虽然也不算难挖，但大多数都是内部消息呐？”索西雅撑着下巴"}
{"time": 1764649126, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1768979479", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（说起来是不是没发过立绘）"}
{"time": 1764649157, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1140982021", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=62A1FD10DFFAA00B03AA75F4FE3296D5.png,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQEEeslkq0LilUVyJjYF1Oj1gbx_RiFswkg_woo6N3xsIaekQMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQuAZFgWPQE9xpIPHUvtnf8XoCJ_2CAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAQSMHwQZfkN5cYPt67AdNu0szD4R8zex1C96Nf0n8Mjmn30fuGQCna4cGWfYETQbz2tkA,file_size=153989]"}
{"time": 1764649281, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1458171726", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“你好奇的，是哪个部分？”"}
{"time": 1764649298, "type": "recv", "message_id": "79644886", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(这尖耳朵确实明显)"}
{"time": 1764649313, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1571396297", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“你觉得她怪，是怪在哪里？”"}
{"time": 1764649387, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1948446020", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“.....emmm,就是姐姐虽然人很好..但是给人一种不太真实的感觉”有些说不上来"}
{"time": 1764649481, "type": "recv", "message_id": "767044912", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“然后身为圣职者...姐姐似乎对神明..”摇摇头“抱歉，只是我个人的感觉...”"}
{"time": 1764649485, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1446958215", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你说这些谁懂啊）"}
{"time": 1764649499, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1753324435", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哦，这个可能懂一点）"}
{"time": 1764649667, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1687317379", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“倒也不算是个人感觉。在教会中，这也不算什么秘密了。”索西雅的指头在桌子上画着圈“她的治愈能力相当出色，但……并不来自祈祷。那是她自己的能力。她确实履行着圣职者该有的一切职责，包括祷告和布道。但至今仍是见习”"}
{"time": 1764649722, "type": "recv", "message_id": "629405585", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(原来是法师拓clw)"}
{"time": 1764649727, "type": "recv", "message_id": "907751276", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那确实很离经叛道了)"}
{"time": 1764649750, "type": "recv", "message_id": "564468997", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“原因……能力和品行都没问题，从进阶标准排查，大概只剩那一个问题了”"}
{"time": 1764649761, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1007877419", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "\"那一个是？\""}
{"time": 1764649831, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1324449598", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不诚心……最开始教会的人还曾对这个问题三缄其口，不过后来教会内部逐渐习惯了这件事，也就有人说漏了嘴”"}
{"time": 1764649887, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1338097568", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(治愈不源于祈祷的时候，就很难在教会里往上走了)"}
{"time": 1764650006, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1454642857", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“.........露莉亚姐姐真的不诚心吗，但她如果不相信神的话，为什么还要做圣职者呢”"}
{"time": 1764650155, "type": "recv", "message_id": "904881440", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“谁知道呢？”索西雅轻轻耸肩“我认为她还是诚实的，至少她还能被查出来不诚心信神”"}
{"time": 1764650254, "type": "recv", "message_id": "702756689", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“昨天提到的前教宗格拉西亚大人...她是谁？和露莉亚姐姐有关系吗”"}
{"time": 1764650635, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2013824006", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“前教宗法兰斯·格拉西亚……现任教宗歌兰蒂斯·格拉西亚已经亡故的祖父。十六年前，法兰斯教宗还在世，年仅7岁的露莉亚就是在那时被教宗从伪装者据点中带回教会收养”"}
{"time": 1764650811, "type": "recv", "message_id": "311161010", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这么说来，格兰蒂斯大人其实和露莉亚同岁呢？”"}
{"time": 1764650937, "type": "recv", "message_id": "337327357", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（睡了）"}
