{"time": 1764662564, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1897845882", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（问什么）"}
{"time": 1764662632, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1769685811", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“怎么样才能见到歌兰蒂亚大人呢”"}
{"time": 1764662879, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2055311626", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“打扰一下”"}
{"time": 1764662927, "type": "recv", "message_id": "925439974", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“你想见歌兰蒂斯大人？”接待的人愣了愣“教宗大人近期事务繁忙。你知道最近斯卡迪女王陛下正在对王国内的诸多突发事件召开会议吧？教宗大人自然要一场不落……平日里还有诸多事务，教宗大人还要兼职神术导师和仪典主持……”"}
{"time": 1764662958, "type": "recv", "message_id": "147142137", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“如果你能成为圣职者的话，或许见到的机会会多些”"}
{"time": 1764663050, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2091226270", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“.....好的，谢谢你”看样子自己应该没有机会了，至于成为圣职者...摇摇头，怎么可能呢，好像也只能先回去了"}
