{"time": 1764664913, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1629714944", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "）[CQ:at,qq=1252219916]"}
{"time": 1764665156, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2045701283", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我看看妈妈醒没醒啊)"}
{"time": 1764665176, "type": "recv", "message_id": "317653007", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "将醒未醒"}
{"time": 1764665184, "type": "recv", "message_id": "205521636", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(如果没醒，一睁眼肯定在她怀里。)"}
{"time": 1764665203, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1379403107", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2025589150]（）"}
{"time": 1764665266, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1339838188", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "想想自己的动静肯定会弄醒妈妈，加上爸爸只敲了一声，自己也不算完全清醒，但是应该睡不着第三次了。认真地端详妈妈的睡颜"}
{"time": 1764666522, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1714638902", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎，外貌描写）"}
{"time": 1764666528, "type": "recv", "message_id": "449877731", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(总该给了)"}
{"time": 1764666540, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1417076243", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（平平无奇啊）"}
{"time": 1764666566, "type": "recv", "message_id": "660093732", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(不管，我有滤镜)"}
{"time": 1764667098, "type": "recv", "message_id": "952678642", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "实际上是……很普通的一张素颜。只不过睫毛比较长，鼻梁还算挺。此时因为久睡显得脸有点肿，不过还好被棕发盖住了"}
{"time": 1764667219, "type": "recv", "message_id": "992118316", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "伸手抚在她的脸颊上，\"嗯...\"稍微捏了捏，\"再不醒的话，要赶不上午饭了哦——\"声音很轻"}
{"time": 1764667351, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1695808316", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……”她畏光般把下巴往怀里勾，四肢舒展起来“哈啊……午饭……中午了？”"}
{"time": 1764667597, "type": "recv", "message_id": "54533254", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯。\"说话的同时轻轻点点头，\"\n已经中午了，妈妈现在感觉怎么样?\""}
{"time": 1764667721, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1573014904", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯——啊”她狠狠地伸了个懒腰，睁开眼睛“睡了好久……好渴。舒茉早就醒了？”"}
{"time": 1764667815, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1724637099", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"中间醒了一次，被妈妈抱着又睡着了。\"依然侧身躺着看着她，\"嗯...刚刚爸爸来敲过门，应该是叫我们吃饭...\""}
{"time": 1764667969, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1759265048", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯嗯……先吃饭吧，好热，一会要好好洗个澡……舒茉也是。”她揉了揉你的头发“昨天没换衣服就睡了……现在洗的话明天能干吗？”"}
{"time": 1764668440, "type": "recv", "message_id": "759289491", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"妈妈昨天到底喝了多少啦？\"有些好奇，之前爸爸明明说自己酒量不如妈妈，\"真是的，明明醉成那样了。\""}
{"time": 1764669276, "type": "recv", "message_id": "831383339", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“大概……”舒蕾掰着手指头“算下来，两瓶多？”"}
{"time": 1764669307, "type": "recv", "message_id": "567091344", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(什么装，斤装吗)"}
{"time": 1764669327, "type": "recv", "message_id": "19998308", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（差不多吧）"}
{"time": 1764669335, "type": "recv", "message_id": "983165312", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（大绿瓶子.jpg）"}
{"time": 1764669345, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1748580556", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（其实是葡萄酒瓶）"}
{"time": 1764669420, "type": "recv", "message_id": "284476928", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "掐掐她腰上的软肉，\"喝太多啦——\"松开坐起身，\"不过舒茉的话...喝了一杯调酒就...\"鼓着脸颊，\"以后还要练啊...\""}
{"time": 1764669794, "type": "recv", "message_id": "790015642", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“一点点来嘛……不过也没有练的必要吧，好像？”她耸耸肩“这种东西，高兴的时候才会喝。如果喝了会觉得不高兴，那就不喝嘛”"}
{"time": 1764669884, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1138930993", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不过...\"身体前倾抱住她，\"昨天说的话...妈妈还记得吗？\""}
{"time": 1764670769, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1207838101", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“咯咯，你倒是上心得紧……别看我喝醉了，该记得的事我都记着呢”她眨眨眼"}
{"time": 1764670990, "type": "recv", "message_id": "477219519", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"毕竟妈妈看着就很像在说胡话的样子，不过...\"在怀里抬头看着她，\"就算不记得，我也会再说一遍...\"轻声开口，\"爸爸妈妈是舒茉最重要的人，所以...不许误会舒茉。\""}
{"time": 1764671040, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1511741539", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（误会是什么）"}
{"time": 1764671235, "type": "recv", "message_id": "689124070", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(只是这么说)"}
{"time": 1764671248, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1569995798", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(接在前面一句后面)"}
{"time": 1764671266, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1702694816", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不是，这有什么因果关系吗）"}
