{"time": 1764672862, "type": "recv", "message_id": "476001864", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1048045999]（哇，还有顶级搭配（）"}
{"time": 1764672944, "type": "recv", "message_id": "59458610", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=477219519]“我听见啦，舒茉也一样”她低头亲了亲你的额头“是爸爸妈妈最重要的人”"}
{"time": 1764673386, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1779159261", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯嗯...我先去洗漱啦。\"在妈妈脸上回一个吻，起床去洗漱，然后去敲敲父亲房门，\"爸——我们起来了。\""}
{"time": 1764674394, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1119924533", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1779159261]（你午饭想吃什么（））"}
{"time": 1764674457, "type": "recv", "message_id": "964760942", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(腐竹炒肉)"}
{"time": 1764674467, "type": "recv", "message_id": "465455458", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（气笑了）"}
{"time": 1764674483, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2059290366", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(好的，如果是舒茉的话)"}
{"time": 1764674509, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1800654262", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(冷的话果酱面包，热的话包子热牛奶)"}
{"time": 1764674524, "type": "recv", "message_id": "776111982", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那是午饭吗（））"}
{"time": 1764674545, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2138274369", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“喔，来吧”他给你们开了门，桌上摆着三菜两汤“还行，不算晚。还没冷”"}
{"time": 1764674592, "type": "recv", "message_id": "789459292", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你睡到中午了，肯定当早餐吃吧一般来说)"}
{"time": 1764674635, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1080119472", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（吃不饱啊）"}
{"time": 1764674661, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1705330557", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2138274369]\"妈妈太能睡了啦，昨天爸爸也不拦着点。\"带着些娇气嗔怪道，开玩笑的口吻，\"这么喝下去，妈妈都要变酒鬼了。\""}
{"time": 1764674784, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1987197102", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1148646914]没什么头绪，先回去了 确认一下行程"}
{"time": 1764674856, "type": "recv", "message_id": "891530183", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1705330557]“本来也……咳咳，好的，下次我尽力。” 他轻咳两声“我吃过了，你们先吃”"}
{"time": 1764674883, "type": "recv", "message_id": "730991702", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1705330557]（不是已经是了？）"}
{"time": 1764674956, "type": "recv", "message_id": "636078461", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯。\"心情很好，海晏河清，蹦蹦跳跳地走到桌边坐下，等着妈妈过来一起，\"下次带上舒茉好啦，我看着点妈妈。\""}
{"time": 1764674978, "type": "recv", "message_id": "168879076", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（不是最后一次）"}
