{"time": 1764675867, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1330273369", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=636078461]“可能确实有用吧”汉斯揶揄到“舒蕾可能会为了看着你而少喝点也说不定”"}
{"time": 1764676391, "type": "recv", "message_id": "463177736", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1330273369]\"妈妈要是多喝了，我就...我就...把她点的多的全喝了。\"说完自己先笑了出来，\"嘛...爸爸，我们还要在这待多久?\""}
{"time": 1764676539, "type": "recv", "message_id": "610015060", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“早些晚些，倒是都差不多。起码迈腾旅店给我们的报价相当稳定”汉斯吹了吹茶杯"}
{"time": 1764676745, "type": "recv", "message_id": "583325650", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"虽然舒茉也不急就是，待会妈妈过来问问她好了。\"摆好碗筷，等着她洗漱好过来。"}
{"time": 1764676791, "type": "recv", "message_id": "993403100", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（原来还没过来）"}
