{"time": 1764676957, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1555585965", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"妈——\"筷子敲敲碗看着她，\"哼哼...我刚和爸爸说好了，下次你喝酒，要带着舒茉一起。你喝多少，舒茉喝多少。\""}
{"time": 1764676984, "type": "recv", "message_id": "926031740", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "回房间发现汉斯叔叔不在，大概率舒茉已经已经醒了吧"}
{"time": 1764676991, "type": "recv", "message_id": "784027685", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "去隔壁敲敲门"}
