{"time": 1764677101, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1632141757", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“舒茉昨晚睡得怎么样”"}
{"time": 1764677109, "type": "recv", "message_id": "395102912", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1555585965]“不……那怎么行”舒蕾叉着腰“那样只会两个人都不舒服诶”"}
{"time": 1764677112, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1994527914", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1632141757]关心一下"}
{"time": 1764677223, "type": "recv", "message_id": "778852986", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=395102912]\"妈妈要是知道，那就少喝点啦。\"露出得逞的笑容，朝伊恩招招手，\"早上好——!睡得很舒服哦?刚刚才醒。\""}
{"time": 1764677258, "type": "recv", "message_id": "756105280", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（早上在哪（））"}
{"time": 1764677282, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1528470039", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“已经大中午了。。。。”不过自己醒的也很晚就是了“对了叔叔阿姨，我们大概在这边停几天”"}
{"time": 1764677404, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1376209104", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“现在大概也……不急？反正魔法学院应该已经开学了，早几天晚几天都是插班生。”"}
{"time": 1764677431, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1090407275", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这样啊，找个地方坐下”"}
{"time": 1764677439, "type": "recv", "message_id": "112048603", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这样啊”找个地方坐下"}
{"time": 1764677456, "type": "recv", "message_id": "462910308", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“舒茉等下有事吗”"}
{"time": 1764677504, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1447486252", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"怎么了?\"正准备动筷子，停下来看着他"}
{"time": 1764677565, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1123160966", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“昨天露莉亚姐姐帮了我们，去感谢一下她吧”"}
{"time": 1764677671, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1920833939", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"点点头，\"确实要感谢一下她...那，感觉明天就可以动身去西海岸了？\""}
{"time": 1764677935, "type": "recv", "message_id": "239358119", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "点点头“好啊”自己本来也没什么事做"}
{"time": 1764678021, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2032265716", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "总之，吃饭先"}
{"time": 1764678025, "type": "recv", "message_id": "578423645", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你吃了吗我在想)"}
{"time": 1764678036, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1464654384", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我吃了个饼）"}
