{"time": 1764701228, "type": "recv", "message_id": "357721393", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1534248214]“嗯...等你”"}
{"time": 1764701468, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1921909085", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(好的)"}
{"time": 1764701545, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1800522643", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我们就不去了”舒蕾顿了顿“你们要是准备入学……或者修炼魔法的话，需不需要买什么？”"}
{"time": 1764701642, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1101591947", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这个...舒茉不太懂啦。\"说完先起身，回房间找套简单的白色连衣裙，带着进浴室仔仔细细洗个澡，洗掉身上的黏腻，披上一件米色的披风，清清爽爽地出门"}
{"time": 1764701672, "type": "recv", "message_id": "294193736", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我也...”挠挠头“应该买些什么呢”完全没有头绪"}
{"time": 1764701732, "type": "recv", "message_id": "170790631", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你们有没有发现）"}
{"time": 1764701738, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1744548595", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你们的学识）"}
{"time": 1764701740, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1583889405", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（是0啊）"}
{"time": 1764701772, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2023048038", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎，虽然好像你们都不是学院派）"}
{"time": 1764701923, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1609956490", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(是啊，所以，魔法理论0分)"}
{"time": 1764701938, "type": "recv", "message_id": "877799630", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我好了——\"叫一声伊恩"}
{"time": 1764702042, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1971290099", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“啊啊……等你们真的入学之后，说不定我们就完全帮不上忙了”舒蕾坐在床上，有些无可奈何地摇摇头“得靠你们自己找引路人咯”"}
{"time": 1764702056, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1282032746", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...那我们先走了，叔叔阿姨再见”"}
{"time": 1764702157, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1717735762", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嘛，那种事之后再说啦，在学院里总能遇见愿意帮我们的人嘛。\"挥挥手，跟着伊恩出门。"}
{"time": 1764702343, "type": "recv", "message_id": "466964850", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "走在路上“要不要买点什么...对了”从口袋出掏出索西雅姐姐找的钱“舒茉昨天酒钱付多啦”"}
{"time": 1764702415, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1903921062", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哦...\"接过来，\"嗯...昨天急着走，我还以为那边的调酒会很贵...\"放进钱包，\"买什么的话...不知道她喜欢什么。\""}
{"time": 1764702492, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1025026082", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“是啊...一般女孩子的话，都喜欢吃甜食吧”手拖着下巴思考"}
{"time": 1764702627, "type": "recv", "message_id": "383575394", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"不好说是不是都是这样，\"至少，买了她不会生气。\""}
{"time": 1764702818, "type": "recv", "message_id": "594310261", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“就先买些甜品吧...话说舒茉还有什么喜欢的东西吗”"}
{"time": 1764702875, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1848326805", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"什么?哪方面啦\""}
{"time": 1764702995, "type": "recv", "message_id": "125405450", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“精美实惠的...装饰品？”"}
{"time": 1764703137, "type": "recv", "message_id": "164975170", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"装饰?\"手指挑起胸前的挂坠，\"这不是已经有了吗？\""}
{"time": 1764703221, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1084162013", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不是这种啦...摆饰，摆饰”"}
{"time": 1764703551, "type": "recv", "message_id": "80332689", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这样啊——\"随意笑了笑，\"在这边买的话，不如在西海岸吧？\"伸出手戳戳对方，\"不过真要说的话，我喜欢...精巧的机械哦?\""}
{"time": 1764703673, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1336566514", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（何意味）"}
{"time": 1764703690, "type": "recv", "message_id": "667649067", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（困了）"}
{"time": 1764703692, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1473290119", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "感觉舒茉好像误会了什么..不过此刻点破的话应该会让她失望的吧“精巧的机械吗？我之前倒是碰到一个大姐姐有个自制的机器...舒茉感兴趣的话，要去买一个吗”"}
{"time": 1764703869, "type": "recv", "message_id": "680831864", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶，在哪里?\""}
{"time": 1764703923, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1669340887", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“具体的位置我也不太清楚...不过可以找人问就是了”"}
{"time": 1764703938, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1449912082", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“要找的那个人我倒是知道”"}
{"time": 1764703960, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1460597468", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎，盒）"}
{"time": 1764704008, "type": "recv", "message_id": "20300500", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（和你这种，一言不合找到别人家里去的）"}
{"time": 1764704029, "type": "recv", "message_id": "784487407", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不过在那之前...我们先去找露莉亚姐姐吧”去甜品店"}
{"time": 1764704045, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1524288750", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嘛，是不是太麻烦了?\"听他这么说似乎有点不太轻松，\"还是先去看看露莉亚姐姐吧。\""}
{"time": 1764704100, "type": "recv", "message_id": "413617789", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(摆件的感觉，就齿轮卯榫啊，钟啊，这种放着会很舒服吧)"}
