{"time": 1764729687, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1693994301", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "点头，“我四处转转，待会再过来。”离开这边，去教会里四处转悠"}
{"time": 1764729709, "type": "recv", "message_id": "967683335", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（如果是男npc我感觉你不会这么好奇啊（）"}
{"time": 1764729710, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1639749071", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...”坐在椅子上等她回来"}
{"time": 1764729963, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1675162751", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "教会的占地面积相当大，哪怕去掉游客止步的部分，也比商会大得多。装修更是不遗余力地突出着圣洁感。功能更是纷繁多样，苦修室、告解室、圣餐领取处、医疗室、书库、唱诗班……似乎还有一处礼堂内正在举办婚礼"}
{"time": 1764730065, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1398892774", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯嗯...\"虽然很想去婚礼现场看看，不过贸然打扰似乎不太礼貌。去这里的书库看看。"}
{"time": 1764730171, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1610147737", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（4.23，和Sakura去明治神宫，那里有人在举办婚礼）"}
{"time": 1764730254, "type": "recv", "message_id": "229185095", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=C66E7F563658BD6BA5DF738742271B86.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhTnE4rW5JWq1PVET2qFXgtAXhnwWRiLzQQg_woohe6Ev7SgkQMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQ_iWSCdK12l7dLOYKm89EInoCEhKCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAISMAafAK3aqBdfGCmpBOWeLRXmYe8pxxof5TIWnzC5KEJI2PV3xzYnbD_-u1PvD78hIQ,file_size=75403]"}
{"time": 1764730340, "type": "recv", "message_id": "509875609", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1398892774]（哎，书）"}
{"time": 1764730347, "type": "recv", "message_id": "516884423", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（等我问问豆包老师）"}
{"time": 1764730694, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1019771198", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "书库采光良好，且有配套桌椅。窗户开着，阳光穿过半透的纱帘，加热着空气中的些微墨水味。大概是时常有人打理，书籍都按分类和顺序严格排列着。除了经书、祷言集和诗歌集，还有些艺术类和技艺类的相关书籍。"}
{"time": 1764730765, "type": "recv", "message_id": "642413708", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "随意地在里面转一转，翻翻看有没有有趣的时兴通俗文学"}
{"time": 1764730798, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1793062678", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "当然，没有"}
{"time": 1764730845, "type": "recv", "message_id": "268948097", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“唉...”低低叹口气，拿一本摆得最显眼的经文，找个采光良好的地方翻阅。"}
{"time": 1764730933, "type": "recv", "message_id": "486908343", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1639749071]等了些时间，露莉亚总算回来了。和往常一样，带着几乎是刻板印象的微笑，路过了你，准备开门"}
{"time": 1764731200, "type": "recv", "message_id": "990261714", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“露莉亚姐姐...你好啊，我是来为昨天的事情感谢你的”"}
{"time": 1764731320, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1525626174", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=268948097]大概是《福音书详解》。文字初看有些晦涩，语序也与日常交谈不同，但里头的神魔、天使、罪人和圣人、国王和叛徒的故事倒也有些意思，简单的祈使句反而有了些画面感"}
{"time": 1764731474, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1470319124", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "当做故事书看的话，读起来倒也津津有味，也不急于回去等着，等伊恩自己处理好了。安安静静地看书。"}
{"time": 1764731932, "type": "recv", "message_id": "934009884", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=990261714]她停下开门的手，转过头看向你，依然维持着微笑“……你的好意我心领了。不过谢礼就不必了。都只是我应该做的事情。”"}
{"time": 1764731953, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2063875131", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“没事...露莉亚姐姐就收下吧”把蛋糕递给她"}
{"time": 1764732101, "type": "recv", "message_id": "907889028", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（什么叫没事（）"}
