{"time": 1764743926, "type": "recv", "message_id": "780019481", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(?)"}
{"time": 1764743931, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1653600128", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(不知道，反正我已经)"}
{"time": 1764743941, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1133626315", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=20CEC3FE3ED922230D290ECA6BBD1B3D.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQI1fx5DUWcbeRSnWN48tne-k_hSBj04Aog_wookfniveegkQMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQKUzFvkeT5lbrj_aCrjhL6noCGoKCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAMSMJOiBw15YgOi9anzBqEtjPSfu3VEKvbSkDeb4znw-AGljH5KmxWk_49MR3wPSNa03g,file_size=176244]"}
{"time": 1764744051, "type": "recv", "message_id": "30644451", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（来了）"}
{"time": 1764744064, "type": "recv", "message_id": "919617964", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(唉，这课怎么就我一个24研)"}
{"time": 1764744103, "type": "recv", "message_id": "609015932", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "在前台前面找个位置坐下“两杯果汁，谢谢”"}
{"time": 1764744192, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2050446504", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "人比中午稍微多些，但有限。有一群壮汉围在角落掰手腕，一个把淡金色头发挽在脑后，身边飘着一个带螺旋桨的小球的女子坐在另一头，面前摆着杯冰咖啡，手里拿着支笔在纸上写写画画"}
{"time": 1764744347, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1498024467", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"跟着伊恩坐下，昨天的自己稍微有些不冷静了，回想起来有些羞耻"}
{"time": 1764744418, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1777747639", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（诶，那你还记得，索西雅刚刚跟你说过什么吗？）"}
{"time": 1764744473, "type": "recv", "message_id": "651604342", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我想想）"}
{"time": 1764744485, "type": "recv", "message_id": "799819072", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(首先肯定没跟我说)"}
{"time": 1764744494, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1604729066", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2050446504][CQ:at,qq=825734198] 确认一下是不是之前见过的那个"}
{"time": 1764744509, "type": "recv", "message_id": "509201945", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1990656118]（）"}
{"time": 1764744520, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1173120213", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1604729066]是的"}
{"time": 1764744520, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1458236639", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1990656118]（这个吗）"}
{"time": 1764744551, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1112530424", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“舒茉..那个姐姐就是我之前提到的”"}
{"time": 1764744581, "type": "recv", "message_id": "128851535", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1498024467]“这两天回头率真高呢。”索西雅笑笑“上次的‘烈酒’，感觉如何？”"}
{"time": 1764744642, "type": "recv", "message_id": "559563126", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"之前提到的?哪一个?\"稍微打量一下那边的人，听到问话扭过头，有些不好意思地笑笑，\"女士的特调很管用...要不再来一杯?\"眨眨眼。"}
{"time": 1764744696, "type": "recv", "message_id": "336383472", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“就是随身携带自制机器人的姐姐，你不是对那个感兴趣么，等下要去问问吗”"}
{"time": 1764744718, "type": "recv", "message_id": "977527852", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不行”急忙阻止“我们只要果汁就好了，拜托了索西雅姐姐”"}
{"time": 1764744758, "type": "recv", "message_id": "136910957", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（水割.jpg）"}
{"time": 1764744818, "type": "recv", "message_id": "973339557", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "吐吐舌头，\"嘛，那就没办法了，女士这里有水蜜桃吗？\""}
{"time": 1764744940, "type": "recv", "message_id": "390019653", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“除了柠檬，其他的没有鲜榨的，只有调好了的”她拿出两个冰杯“喝起来倒是没什么差别。”"}
{"time": 1764745002, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1948238791", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"麻烦女士了，我要少点冰。\"转头看向那边的机械，\"嗯...这种东西也不是摆饰吧？我说的那种...桌面摆件，摆件啦。\""}
{"time": 1764745150, "type": "recv", "message_id": "986027038", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那个小球也是她做的啊，桌面摆件说不定她也有呢”"}
{"time": 1764745250, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1274272718", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...只是感觉没必要在这里买吧?\"回过视线，\"她做的难道有什么特别的吗？\""}
{"time": 1764745306, "type": "recv", "message_id": "696799846", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“可能比较便宜？那个机器人功能多种多样的，只要五个金币就够了”"}
{"time": 1764745352, "type": "recv", "message_id": "445741732", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "总之，索西雅推了两杯冰镇果汁到你们面前，在一旁有心无心地听你们说话"}
{"time": 1764745461, "type": "recv", "message_id": "181313364", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "点头表示感谢，\"伊恩说得倒是轻巧。\"挑了挑眉毛，\"那我拿这个跟她换?\"手指挑起胸口的挂坠。"}
{"time": 1764745512, "type": "recv", "message_id": "154788739", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我有没有说过她的名字来着）"}
{"time": 1764745514, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1715692122", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不记得了）"}
{"time": 1764745540, "type": "recv", "message_id": "186109674", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(没吧，有吗)"}
{"time": 1764745548, "type": "recv", "message_id": "606825865", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（没有）"}
{"time": 1764745548, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1644439953", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "正说着，她又撕下一页纸，揉成纸团，随手塞给那个悬浮着的小球"}
{"time": 1764745560, "type": "recv", "message_id": "287155807", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=181313364][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “？”"}
{"time": 1764745590, "type": "recv", "message_id": "142323198", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不可以....”有些着急“我的意思是..摆饰应该会更便宜一些....”"}
{"time": 1764745620, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1525150692", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我身上大概还有两个金币左右...舒茉想要的话我等下去帮你问问”"}
{"time": 1764745764, "type": "recv", "message_id": "220939539", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"没必要啦——\"笑着敲敲伊恩的脑袋，\"我嫌麻烦。\"抿一口果汁"}
{"time": 1764745873, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1154704196", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好吧...那个姐姐好像是从天上来的，这样的人应该蛮少见的”"}
{"time": 1764745935, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1693484321", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"天上?\"刚想说这种话谁都可以说，突然想起现场有一个活着的百事通，\"索西娅女士，天上是什么地方?\""}
{"time": 1764746195, "type": "recv", "message_id": "821067433", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“天上的说法其实不太准确，应该叫天界才对……啊，真是古老的名称”索西雅的语气难得地沾上些感慨“就是字面意思了……天上的世界，在天空之海之上”"}
{"time": 1764746252, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1026584848", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“很久以前，天界和阿拉德大陆还是联通的。不过现在，就连这个词都鲜有人知了”"}
{"time": 1764746290, "type": "recv", "message_id": "157733805", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那天空之塔呢）"}
{"time": 1764746322, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1235992962", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（消失了啊）"}
{"time": 1764746345, "type": "recv", "message_id": "904439150", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"天界?\"有些不太懂，\"天空之海?啊...我们头顶还有一个世界?那...天有多高?\""}
{"time": 1764746640, "type": "recv", "message_id": "436027781", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“看吧..我没有胡说吧”自豪.jpg"}
{"time": 1764746657, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1856911528", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……谁知道呢？这些事也是我从祖辈那里听说的，我没实际见过。”索西雅摇头“只知道是个科技发达、而少有魔法的世界，偶尔会有人从上面，嗯……掉下来。据说千年前，天界的魔法还未绝迹，有一座通天的高塔链接着两个世界。直到……有一位暴君隔绝了彼此”"}
{"time": 1764746714, "type": "recv", "message_id": "622526448", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哦...\"受教地点点脑袋，喝一口果汁，\"嗯...掉下来的人能回去吗？\""}
{"time": 1764746755, "type": "recv", "message_id": "477045355", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“据我所知，没人成功过”"}
{"time": 1764746859, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1306224031", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那那座塔现在呢？”"}
{"time": 1764746868, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2146896465", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这样...\"深深吸了口气，后面的话憋了回去，\"真是奇怪的事情...从上面可以‘掉下来’，但是摔不死。\""}
{"time": 1764746916, "type": "recv", "message_id": "86512830", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“千年前就突然消失了”"}
{"time": 1764746933, "type": "recv", "message_id": "897104679", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“咦？消失了这么久吗”"}
{"time": 1764746946, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1704394689", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（真消失有这么久吗）"}
{"time": 1764746957, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1908972138", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（有啊）"}
{"time": 1764746967, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2039842738", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（巴卡尔统治天界一千年了）"}
{"time": 1764747021, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1650210686", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=9F1A39F976D9845F8EB381DFA19CC753.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhSWS55SI_Cdo5xr5FLBdeqmIHm8-RiunUkg_wooxvmb-vKgkQMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQt_-czz29DTdAZrDZvaqP3HoCS5qCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAMSMJOiBw15YgOi9anzBqEtjPSfu3VEKvbSkDeb4znw-AGljH5KmxWk_49MR3wPSNa03g,file_size=1199790]"}
