{"time": 1764747037, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1422735605", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（起摩托跳海）"}
{"time": 1764747061, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2058523721", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "摇摇头，\"怎么想都很奇怪...\"看了看那边的女人，\"算了，以后有机会再了解吧...嗯...女士能帮舒茉诊断魔力吗?之前...露莉亚姐姐也看过一次。\""}
{"time": 1764747153, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1569982504", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是我也不知道为什么跳下来还能活着）"}
{"time": 1764747165, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1854273609", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（天界人的超绝体质吧）"}
{"time": 1764747187, "type": "recv", "message_id": "449498469", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（毕竟都是能用肉体把吨级机器人一脚蹬飞的神人）"}
{"time": 1764747198, "type": "recv", "message_id": "459888118", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（振金膝盖）"}
{"time": 1764747209, "type": "recv", "message_id": "767855157", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（hh）"}
{"time": 1764747215, "type": "recv", "message_id": "521116055", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(好的)"}
{"time": 1764747272, "type": "recv", "message_id": "876948967", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“倒是没问题。说到露莉亚……怎么样了？”她对舒茉伸出手，却面向伊恩"}
{"time": 1764747343, "type": "recv", "message_id": "707501773", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "伸出自己的手，递给她，呼出一口气，放出自己的魔力。"}
{"time": 1764747371, "type": "recv", "message_id": "308654971", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“呃...”有点不好意思，挠挠头“我和露莉亚姐姐好像聊崩了...被她赶走了”"}
{"time": 1764747480, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1825080550", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"看向伊恩，\"说了什么?\""}
{"time": 1764747515, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1310559233", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“.....”有点难以启齿"}
{"time": 1764747526, "type": "recv", "message_id": "548610702", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我的问题.....”"}
{"time": 1764747542, "type": "recv", "message_id": "821846786", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我说话有点直”"}
{"time": 1764747573, "type": "recv", "message_id": "865858845", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=707501773]“哦，真可惜……哦？”索西雅的注意力转了回来“好特殊的力量……”"}
{"time": 1764747580, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1887577809", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"看他这个样子，也就没有追问下去，\"好啦好啦，女士...能看出什么吗？舒茉...前段时间才觉醒的魔力。\""}
{"time": 1764747894, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1476840639", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“相当特殊……一般来说，大多数魔法，都基于最基本的自然元素，火啦，光啦。也有一些受到特殊存在眷顾的体系，比如精神类，祷告，或者精灵魔法”索西雅掰着指头解释着“你的魔法与自然元素几乎无关，我想应该属于后者，但与目前已知的特殊存在都不一样……是全新的”"}
{"time": 1764748004, "type": "recv", "message_id": "253236340", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好厉害...我一开始就说舒茉是特殊的，你还不信”"}
{"time": 1764748106, "type": "recv", "message_id": "555897906", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"啊...\"感觉有些超出自己的想象，指尖逸散出一些雾气，\"女士...只是看错了吧?哈哈...舒茉一点也不特殊。\""}
{"time": 1764748129, "type": "recv", "message_id": "219374340", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“还在嘴硬”敲一下舒茉的头"}
{"time": 1764748240, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1365933438", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唔...\"另一只手捂了捂被敲的地方，心跳稍稍加速，\"真的...?可是...不应该吧...\""}
{"time": 1764748293, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1696586002", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“至少是我从来没见过的种类，而且看起来性质相当……温和”她的手指沾着些液体，在桌上画出一个小正方形，绿色的荧光亮起“介意我保留一点你的魔力吗？”"}
{"time": 1764748308, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1927519314", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“有什么不应该的，舒茉的厉害超乎舒茉想象”"}
{"time": 1764748350, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1883698287", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是说起来，埃尔文出事了的话，索西雅应该去找赛利亚了）"}
{"time": 1764748363, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1119650027", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（可能赛利亚已经在撤退的路上了（））"}
{"time": 1764748375, "type": "recv", "message_id": "620591682", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（不是她明天才出发？）"}
{"time": 1764748387, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1324585654", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1764748403, "type": "recv", "message_id": "590848927", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"朝着索西雅轻轻点点头，\"舒茉不介意...要怎么做...?\""}
{"time": 1764748416, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1786615949", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（她消息比你们灵通多了）"}
{"time": 1764748517, "type": "recv", "message_id": "234305311", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "浅绿色的魔力膜像气泡一样从桌上升起，围成一个几乎透明的立方体，框住了一小团雾气“可以了”"}
{"time": 1764748633, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1178352438", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对了索西雅姐姐，赛丽亚姐姐跟我们提到过你”"}
{"time": 1764748651, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1339370765", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"看着雾被圈起来，\"女士说是被特殊存在眷顾，那...是谁?\""}
{"time": 1764748670, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1689385257", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1178352438]（然后呢（））"}
{"time": 1764748680, "type": "recv", "message_id": "43621143", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（套个近乎啊）"}
{"time": 1764748685, "type": "recv", "message_id": "521393003", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（她被谁提到都很正常啊）"}
{"time": 1764748708, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1417848812", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“赛丽亚姐姐说你帮了她很多”"}
{"time": 1764748764, "type": "recv", "message_id": "333448079", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1178352438]“噢，你们认识赛丽亚？”她挑挑眉“这么说，你们是从格兰之森那边来的？”"}
{"time": 1764748822, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2009513770", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1339370765]“我也不知道，世间的超凡存在不可尽数，有许多体系仍在人们的认知之外呐”"}
{"time": 1764748870, "type": "recv", "message_id": "526157238", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好吧...\"问下去也不会再有答案，\"麻烦女士了。\""}
{"time": 1764748927, "type": "recv", "message_id": "26132616", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯，我们是从那边的一个小村庄来的”"}
{"time": 1764748934, "type": "recv", "message_id": "21389894", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...我们之前在银色马车逗留过一段时间，不然应该早就到这边了。\""}
{"time": 1764748944, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1678233421", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（银色村庄）"}
{"time": 1764748954, "type": "recv", "message_id": "627044543", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你要是说我们是逃难来的，就很变态了)"}
{"time": 1764748963, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1309399803", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（在格兰之森的是未白）"}
{"time": 1764748968, "type": "recv", "message_id": "583364758", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...我们之前在银色村庄逗留过一段时间，不然应该早就到这边了。\""}
{"time": 1764748973, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1130217278", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（变态在哪）"}
{"time": 1764748974, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1108302923", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(为什么我老是觉得是银色马车)"}
{"time": 1764748985, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1162454445", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我觉得最好不说)"}
{"time": 1764748987, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1594958345", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（又不是不知道防线出事了）"}
{"time": 1764748996, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1952756293", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（因为你太喜欢我开的那个团了）"}
{"time": 1764749013, "type": "recv", "message_id": "931975022", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（她还会怪你们两个未成年人逃难吗）"}
