{"time": 1764749054, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2127629997", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（她还会怪我们两个未成年人逃难吗）"}
{"time": 1764749147, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1992705817", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“喔？我听说银色村庄这几天发生了一些事情……”"}
{"time": 1764749204, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1189748037", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不过好像知情的人却不是很愿意透露呐”她不无遗憾地摇头"}
{"time": 1764749251, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1416845589", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...听说是矿难。\"本来打算开口，但既然那边选择不谈，自己也不能贸然开口。"}
{"time": 1764749290, "type": "recv", "message_id": "705981648", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "嗯，毕竟收了迈尔斯先生的礼物，所以也不说了"}
{"time": 1764749355, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1085395924", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对了，索西雅姐姐，之前关于我魔力的那个问题，还有谁能帮到我吗”"}
{"time": 1764749516, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1108453703", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“魔法协会里从不缺能人异士，如果想探寻可能性，那里应该是最多的……不过能不能对上眼，那就是另一回事了”"}
{"time": 1764749535, "type": "recv", "message_id": "849942822", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这样啊...”"}
{"time": 1764749570, "type": "recv", "message_id": "232458237", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "看向被绿色光圈圈住的自己的雾气有些出神，特殊存在...曾听见过的叹息，\"嗯...协会里会有能帮上我的人吗...连索西雅女士都不清楚的话...\""}
{"time": 1764749699, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1922772634", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（说不定没有瓶颈呢（）"}
{"time": 1764749800, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1642268204", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "自然是，没有人能给出一个明确的答案"}
{"time": 1764749917, "type": "recv", "message_id": "407610945", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "喝口果汁，然后把蛋糕拿上来，分给舒茉一个叉子"}
{"time": 1764749977, "type": "recv", "message_id": "407387620", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"下意识接过叉子，但还在神游天外，没人回答自己，怔怔地看着框住的雾"}
{"time": 1764750050, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1018994476", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看舒茉呆呆的样子，忍不住想要捉弄一下她，手沾一点点奶油，抹在舒茉鼻子上"}
{"time": 1764750368, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1657402687", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "凉凉的触感一下就拉回了自己的意识，抬手摸了一下，看了一眼自己的手指\"伊恩?\"转过头笑容满面地看着他。"}
{"time": 1764750418, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1280854913", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“别发呆了，快吃吧，还是舒茉想让我喂你呢”叉起一小块递到舒茉嘴边“啊!”"}
{"time": 1764750428, "type": "recv", "message_id": "4719690", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“别发呆了，快吃吧，还是舒茉想让我喂你呢”叉起一小块递到舒茉嘴边“啊～”"}
{"time": 1764750450, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1628511101", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我看有人快要死了）"}
