{"time": 1764750752, "type": "recv", "message_id": "3031973", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"你自己涂，还是我帮你?\"眼睛盯着蛋糕上的奶油，依然挂着不散的笑容。"}
{"time": 1764750843, "type": "recv", "message_id": "506110948", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "哑然失笑，另一只手沾一些奶油抹脸上“张嘴么”"}
