{"time": 1764784405, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2070351172", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这怎么看起来跟普通木头没什么区别”"}
{"time": 1764784420, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1311096317", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（深渊派对邀请函算不算一种魔法书（）"}
{"time": 1764784531, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1889973718", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...这个似乎也用不上。\"有些失望，把手里的魔法书递给他，\"有没有...很稀有，很神奇的东西?\""}
{"time": 1764784540, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1863491145", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "没什么……但是也不是完全没有，不过对你来说终究是可以预见地用不上“你来的不巧，前段时间才刚弄到一批战利品，里头就有一根雷电法杖……很快就有人高价收走了，嚯嚯”"}
{"time": 1764784645, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1646105718", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那根木杖可以让我看看吗”"}
