{"time": 1764809844, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1260212740", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"反正，看看应该也没事吧？\"对着伊恩眨眨眼，\"毕竟我们是顾客...吧？\""}
