{"time": 1764810366, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1846306037", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[芭芙娜]演奏出: 1D4=4"}
{"time": 1764810381, "type": "recv", "message_id": "791932022", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "过了好一会，夏洛克才从仓库里走出来，看起来他并不是很有收捡。两手各抓着一个小物件，腋下还夹着个袋子。左手上的是个看起来平平无奇的八音盒，右手上的是个花纹纷繁、色彩鲜亮，还用绒毛做了个兔耳兜帽的小小人像。腋下夹着的袋子则明显传出些暗属性的波动"}
{"time": 1764810470, "type": "recv", "message_id": "86772017", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“咦这些都是什么。可以挨个介绍一下吗”"}
{"time": 1764810484, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1118262330", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "他把左手拿着的八音盒放在摊面上“这个，6金币”\n又把右手的小小人像放在摊面上“这个8金币”"}
{"time": 1764810560, "type": "recv", "message_id": "108404889", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...它们的作用是什么?\""}
{"time": 1764810575, "type": "recv", "message_id": "707858828", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“功能啦，功能呢，光说价格我们也不知道是做什么的...”"}
{"time": 1764810649, "type": "recv", "message_id": "103552753", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（功能不是看你们打算怎么用么（）"}
{"time": 1764810761, "type": "recv", "message_id": "24518501", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那也要简单说一下吧？)"}
{"time": 1764810767, "type": "recv", "message_id": "154458454", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"一般是用在什么场合?\""}
{"time": 1764810817, "type": "recv", "message_id": "955405598", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这个八音盒里，收录的可是传说中‘魔笛’的声音，听见的人可是会发狂的……喔，可别在我这试用”"}
{"time": 1764810900, "type": "recv", "message_id": "831894491", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这个图腾可是可遇不可求，斯顿雪域的那些家伙可比哥布林还封闭……这个图腾被库尼族的祭司开过光，真的能带来祝福”"}
