{"time": 1764812718, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1660600443", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...”毕竟身上的钱真的不够，把图腾还给哥布林"}
{"time": 1764812801, "type": "recv", "message_id": "518999622", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "转身离开，心里盘算着什么地点可以弄到2金币，最后摇了摇头，\"好啦，我们去教会吧。\""}
{"time": 1764812842, "type": "recv", "message_id": "765627319", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“教会？那就是舒茉说的想去的漂亮的地方”有点疑惑"}
{"time": 1764812867, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1509389970", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "看你们没有付款的意思，他倒也没有开口说什么，只是失望地叹了口气"}
