{"time": 1764815386, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1346653145", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "脚步勾起空荡的回声，双翼投下大片阴影，很快就要和窗檐的阴影连在一起了"}
{"time": 1764815453, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1227050508", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "看着他跑过去，嘴角勾起轻笑，踩着端庄的步伐慢慢走上前，伸出自己的右手"}
{"time": 1764815558, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1283301280", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（是不是还要一起走一段）"}
