{"time": 1764819678, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1013224683", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（没有，我妈给我打了个电话）"}
{"time": 1764819814, "type": "recv", "message_id": "451115457", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯....”点点头“先这样吧...舒茉不是还有事要做么，至于回旅馆什么的，我不要..我就在教堂门口等你吧”"}
