{"time": 1764819943, "type": "recv", "message_id": "61901193", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=451115457]\"嗯哼?...难道放心不下?\""}
{"time": 1764819947, "type": "recv", "message_id": "883245476", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "伊恩听见门外有干草扫把在地面上拖动的声音，而且正在慢慢靠近"}
{"time": 1764820099, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1773308234", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好像有人来了..”不过也没做什么亏心事倒也无所谓“不是放心不下啦..只是想和舒茉有更多在一起的时间”"}
{"time": 1764820321, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1192134966", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"知道了啦。\"拍拍伊恩的脑袋，\"而且，往后还有很长呢——毕竟这条路永无尽头——\"挂着笑容，\"好啦，我去找找她?\""}
{"time": 1764820611, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1365535814", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...待会见...”"}
{"time": 1764820734, "type": "recv", "message_id": "176242972", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "推门出去看看，往露莉亚的房间走"}
{"time": 1764820811, "type": "recv", "message_id": "899211029", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "并不用走，露莉亚就在门口，手上拿着笤帚"}
{"time": 1764820872, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1952282826", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "假装没看见她，直接往外走 然后在一个拐角停下，偷偷看着二人"}
{"time": 1764820884, "type": "recv", "message_id": "221608563", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "她似乎没料到这个时间还有人在这里，忘记带上她最标准的微笑"}
{"time": 1764820952, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1583393910", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"你好啊——露莉亚姐姐?\"仔细观察着她的表情"}
{"time": 1764821090, "type": "recv", "message_id": "313454566", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "她很快就调整回最标准的状态，以至于你有些怀疑自己刚才是不是眼花了。她把笤帚暂时并在一只手上，依旧轻声开口“你好，需要什么帮助吗？”"}
{"time": 1764821156, "type": "recv", "message_id": "159584526", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"在思考自己要不要用最简单粗暴的办法，稍微摇了摇头，\"我有一件事，想问姐姐。\""}
{"time": 1764821184, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1326179246", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"失去的记忆，有办法找回来吗？\"轻声"}
{"time": 1764821185, "type": "recv", "message_id": "366156626", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（“和伊恩有关的，我不想听”（）"}
{"time": 1764821210, "type": "recv", "message_id": "311090552", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那很恨了（）"}
{"time": 1764821237, "type": "recv", "message_id": "829685294", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（起码不是懒说配听）"}
{"time": 1764821392, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2041692503", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1326179246]“我遇到过失忆的病人”她点点头“不多，一共3例。确实有一位病人找回了记忆。”"}
{"time": 1764821414, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1341940287", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...怎么做?\""}
{"time": 1764821414, "type": "recv", "message_id": "986943884", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“所以我想，应该是有办法的。但我不知道该怎么做”"}
{"time": 1764821465, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2085553496", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“或许是等待，或许是家人的陪伴。但同样的方法在另外两位身上没有奏效”"}
{"time": 1764821519, "type": "recv", "message_id": "84811065", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"点点头表示认可，\"不过舒茉觉得...有知道他过去的人帮忙拼凑的话，失去的记忆也可以被填补，对吗？\""}
{"time": 1764821567, "type": "recv", "message_id": "811185998", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“家人正在此列”"}
{"time": 1764821608, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1333928491", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"姐姐应该会帮助有困难的人吧？\"挽起自己的一侧鬓发挂在耳朵后面。"}
{"time": 1764821747, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1845308480", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯，这是我的职责”她轻轻点头"}
{"time": 1764821768, "type": "recv", "message_id": "261012732", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（太经典了）"}
{"time": 1764821946, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1266105708", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"舒茉请求露莉亚姐姐，告诉我姐姐知道的伊恩的过去，一部分也好...舒茉需要...姐姐的帮助。\"静静看着她"}
{"time": 1764821986, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1001840967", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（关键词不对（）"}
{"time": 1764822079, "type": "recv", "message_id": "557345090", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“抱歉，我不知道”她摇摇头“我对他的过去并不了解，我想他也不需要这样的帮助”"}
{"time": 1764822140, "type": "recv", "message_id": "218240173", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（伊恩甚至不是阿拉德人）"}
{"time": 1764822224, "type": "recv", "message_id": "518273685", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"是舒茉需要。\"继续看着她，\"未来我和他，会走到一起...所以，我想知道。拜托您，这也算是布施么?即便此时神明已经闭眸。\""}
{"time": 1764822335, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1708441108", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“算的”她点头，嘴角的弧度正在逐渐抚平“我并未说谎，也没有隐瞒。我对他的过去并不知晓。但是我确信忘却对他来说是一件好事。”"}
{"time": 1764822516, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1516701293", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我和他，都不愿意就此遗忘。\"仔细看着她的表情，\"您知道，他的过去经历了什么，甚至和您也有关系。\"手指停在自己的鬓发上，\"我曾见过漆黑的海...露莉亚姐姐，那是什么?\""}
{"time": 1764822578, "type": "recv", "message_id": "872125517", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（这个她真没见过（）"}
{"time": 1764822598, "type": "recv", "message_id": "700370578", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（海是一种）"}
{"time": 1764822601, "type": "recv", "message_id": "267329743", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（具象化）"}
{"time": 1764822606, "type": "recv", "message_id": "226795066", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（并没有真的海）"}
{"time": 1764822641, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2059951295", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(但我肯定是这么问)"}
{"time": 1764822655, "type": "recv", "message_id": "34755614", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(等她有端联想呗)"}
{"time": 1764822967, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1123144093", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我不知道，我没见过那样的东西。”她的神色进一步降温，嘴角已经完全抚平，像冰冷的水面“他的事与我无关，但我不想再看到他和他的魔力。”"}
{"time": 1764823147, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1014329409", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"放下手，\"舒茉只是在想...姐姐在过去，是不是见过那种魔力，或是相关的东西。\"停住，\"舒茉想知道，那是什么?\"指尖稍微有些雾气逸散开。"}
{"time": 1764823637, "type": "recv", "message_id": "581458983", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……你们出现在这里，不是专门为了等我的吧。来这里打扫是临时的安排。”她没直接回答你的问题“你说你们会永远一起走下去，想来已经寻求过见证了。作为我自己，我不想再回忆那种事情，我想这并不违背圣职者的准则。”"}
{"time": 1764823671, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1904260310", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(偷听了这么多（）"}
{"time": 1764823821, "type": "recv", "message_id": "582050970", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“如果你信神，请不要再为难祂的行者。”"}
{"time": 1764824813, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1007112546", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...那我就...自己看看?这样，没有问题吧？姐姐。\""}
{"time": 1764824863, "type": "recv", "message_id": "983073494", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（神秘出手女？）"}
{"time": 1764825109, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1842735982", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……请离开吧。我不想伤害任何人，包括我自己在内。所以关于黑暗之眼，我什么也不会说。”她摇头，重新拿好笤帚，准备越过你进入礼堂"}
{"time": 1764829462, "type": "recv", "message_id": "821439192", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（原来真的是你没回我）"}
