{"time": 1764836645, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2105740497", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（）"}
{"time": 1764836699, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1998383169", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "并不能想起什么，只是隐隐觉得似乎确实和自己有关"}
{"time": 1764836773, "type": "recv", "message_id": "218450096", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "这究竟是什么东西...."}
{"time": 1764836887, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1114028881", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我把他叫醒了）"}
{"time": 1764836904, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1289802321", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我被翔哥call了)"}
{"time": 1764836992, "type": "recv", "message_id": "819106146", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "从记忆中脱出，有些无力感，同时伴随着强烈的呕吐和眩晕"}
{"time": 1764837075, "type": "recv", "message_id": "755398447", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（记忆是无光的深海）"}
{"time": 1764837166, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1418763514", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"呃...\"扶着自己的额头，几乎有些摇摇欲坠"}
{"time": 1764837205, "type": "recv", "message_id": "527082894", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "幸好，至少没有吐在地毯上。露莉亚有些疑惑地转身，这才看到躬着身子的你"}
{"time": 1764837350, "type": "recv", "message_id": "793153106", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“你……”她犹豫了一会，终究是把笤帚立在一旁，对你伸出手“需要帮助吗？”"}
{"time": 1764837419, "type": "recv", "message_id": "196910051", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看到舒茉好像不太舒服的样子，冲过去扶住她"}
{"time": 1764837421, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1318145563", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“没事...”朝着她摆摆手，“露莉亚姐姐...姐姐...是很温柔的人呢...”"}
{"time": 1764837719, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2058478534", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“舒茉怎么了...发生什么了...”有些焦急"}
{"time": 1764837727, "type": "recv", "message_id": "3424872", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“伊恩...?”喉咙里还填满了呕吐物的酸涩感，实在有些狼狈，身体软软地靠在伊恩身上。"}
{"time": 1764837752, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1771082087", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“没事了..没事了...我在的”"}
{"time": 1764837779, "type": "recv", "message_id": "783551747", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……”她看着你们，表情相当生硬，但既然你拒绝了，她也不打算插手，于是径直朝外走“我去拿拖把”"}
{"time": 1764838062, "type": "recv", "message_id": "291547390", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（然后呢）"}
{"time": 1764838088, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1344459610", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“嗯...对不起...”靠着伊恩，“我们走吧...头好晕...呃...”手按在自己脖子下面一点，“呃...”紧紧皱着眉，表情有些痛苦，感觉随时都会再吐出来。"}
{"time": 1764838095, "type": "recv", "message_id": "503321636", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（别急，我在斟酌选词）"}
{"time": 1764838220, "type": "recv", "message_id": "845571650", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（起码是贝尔马尔内的事）"}
{"time": 1764838395, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2036348301", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（轮流睡觉？）"}
{"time": 1764838398, "type": "recv", "message_id": "299578716", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（[CQ:at,qq=1040972910] ）"}
{"time": 1764838404, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1549893143", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（应该，翔酱接？）"}
{"time": 1764838424, "type": "recv", "message_id": "668156595", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯。。。”背起舒茉“...舒茉怎么了...为什么突然这样了，露莉亚对你做了什么”"}
{"time": 1764838433, "type": "recv", "message_id": "595615053", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=299578716]（在打字）"}
{"time": 1764838520, "type": "recv", "message_id": "611075889", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=668156595]吗"}
{"time": 1764838592, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1651227546", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“不是...”尽量平息，“待会...待会再说...”"}
{"time": 1764838666, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1571626098", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...”看舒茉这么说也稍微冷静了些“...要不让露利亚姐姐给你治疗一下吧”"}
{"time": 1764838686, "type": "recv", "message_id": "890613707", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "前面的脚步突然停下了，露莉亚的动作停在一步刚迈完的瞬间，随后她转过身来。她比你们高些，居高临下地看着你们“……”"}
{"time": 1764838700, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1450218737", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "使劲摇着头，“带我...先去吐...呃...”"}
{"time": 1764838775, "type": "recv", "message_id": "813638563", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“什么叫，我对她做了什么吗？”她开口，语调一如往常地轻飘，但前所未有地带着些颤抖的尾调"}
{"time": 1764838848, "type": "recv", "message_id": "379274563", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对...对不起..我说错话了..露莉亚姐姐可以帮舒茉治疗一下吗...”"}
{"time": 1764838855, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1119918551", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "祈求🥺"}
{"time": 1764839054, "type": "recv", "message_id": "136800948", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“没...没...”咬着唇，有些忍不住了，哇的一声又吐了出来，这次肚子里倒是清空地差不多了，黏腻的漆黑和压迫感却仍然不散，还是带着强烈的眩晕感...身体使不上一点力气。"}
{"time": 1764839113, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1055317488", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（咦，那你是不是吐完身上了）"}
{"time": 1764839146, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1112346442", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1055317488]（我）"}
{"time": 1764839202, "type": "recv", "message_id": "434688502", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（没吧，吐在你前面地上大概）"}
{"time": 1764839211, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2105735452", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我背着你啊（）"}
{"time": 1764839229, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1229821503", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（脑袋放在肩膀上那种吧）"}
{"time": 1764839229, "type": "recv", "message_id": "445641203", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（感觉吐我前面地上是不是有点难（）"}
{"time": 1764839351, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1795267507", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“你们到底想要做什么？”她完全不理会你的补救，声音中的颤抖愈演愈烈“是……我是个不虔诚的圣职者，我应该聆听祈愿，应该回应求助……我愿意帮助需要帮助的人，我从未愧对我的职责。所以……为什么？我帮了我能帮的一切，我不曾亏欠你们吧？为什么……还要出现在我面前，非要揭露我的伤疤，自以为是地评价我的生活不可？”"}
{"time": 1764839667, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1852652147", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(咦，这里是哪个环节吗)"}
{"time": 1764839672, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1590363679", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1229821503]不顾身上的呕吐物“对不起..露莉亚姐姐...请你帮帮舒茉吧，我们之后绝对不会再打扰你了...”"}
{"time": 1764839677, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1949547317", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（是）"}
{"time": 1764839684, "type": "recv", "message_id": "642608593", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（早见沙织的暴走（）"}
{"time": 1764839808, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1803843708", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(翔哥，用你的机关枪打穿她的心之壁吧)"}
{"time": 1764840074, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1161580817", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1590363679]手按在他的肩膀上，摇摇头，强压着不适感，一字一句开口，\"露莉亚，你现在所行之事，是为了罪与罚，还是...单纯为了逃避，单纯回报某个人...\""}
{"time": 1764840091, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1379365151", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（先别急）"}
{"time": 1764840093, "type": "recv", "message_id": "433737892", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我在）"}
{"time": 1764840095, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1531763434", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（打字）"}
{"time": 1764840195, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1405783009", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我会对她做什么的。别找我，去找别的人吧。”她紧握的拳缝滴下殷红的液体“我就知道……黑暗之眼……我就不该抱有期待”"}
{"time": 1764840343, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1014806427", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1161580817](那总之接在这)"}
{"time": 1764840440, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1287309730", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对不起...对不起...”一时语塞，不知道该说些什么"}
{"time": 1764840568, "type": "recv", "message_id": "801312404", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "低头在伊恩耳边小声开口，\"嗯...不用道歉，伊恩。\"抬起头看向她，\"因为我们已经自以为是地在这里了，所以，不准你逃。\""}
{"time": 1764840576, "type": "recv", "message_id": "610421524", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“自以为是的……狂徒。”她的气息紊乱起来“你说这些，是想给谁救赎吗？神给不了，你也给不了，我也不需要。现在，请，闭嘴，然后离开”"}
{"time": 1764840688, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1487302013", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "既然舒茉这样说了..那也稍微强硬一点“不行...我们不走”"}
{"time": 1764840724, "type": "recv", "message_id": "261367824", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我就扎聋自己的耳朵）"}
{"time": 1764840850, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1620316482", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"黑暗之眼在你的过去做了什么?教宗清除了那些，给了你救赎，所以，你愿意留在教会?\"依然一字一顿，声音清晰。"}
{"time": 1764840987, "type": "recv", "message_id": "130499955", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"舒茉才不空谈救赎。\"瞪着她，\"我从来就不打算给谁救赎，对舒茉而言，只有记忆和自己不能背弃，所以，我会让伊恩想起来所有，哪怕是...不好的东西，我也会陪他一起面对。\""}
{"time": 1764841116, "type": "recv", "message_id": "214498834", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“与你无关。”她眼见劝离无果，她右手一挥，一道足以称得上耀眼的光墙凭空出现，立在你们之间，隔断了你们的视线"}
{"time": 1764841162, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1876432110", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "感觉心里暖暖的...."}
{"time": 1764841184, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2046315523", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "急忙闭上眼睛，感觉好刺眼..."}
{"time": 1764841238, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1002173543", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（如果你问她什么时候想成为的圣职者）"}
{"time": 1764841243, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1470129810", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（她会说always）"}
{"time": 1764841271, "type": "recv", "message_id": "537005937", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（她只是不信神，又不是讨厌教会）"}
