{"time": 1764841485, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1843732602", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你就抱憾终身了）"}
{"time": 1764841545, "type": "recv", "message_id": "810097777", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "不吐不快，总之过了这么个时间，身体也好受了一些，“伊恩..我们回去吧，这个问题，我已经知道谁会有答案了。”"}
