{"time": 1764846126, "type": "recv", "message_id": "33791525", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（总之路上没事）"}
{"time": 1764846207, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2034143424", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "经历过几乎可以说是造成了实质损伤如梦魇般的记忆，一路都有些昏昏沉沉，身体发软。"}
{"time": 1764846267, "type": "recv", "message_id": "580207788", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（只能说，那种经历，不是‘直面过去’就能坦然接受的）"}
{"time": 1764846359, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1140509640", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "升降台发出“叮”的一声，三楼到了"}
{"time": 1764846442, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1042558127", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看舒茉这么累，感觉后续的计划可能要暂歇一会了，敲敲舒蕾房间的门"}
{"time": 1764846490, "type": "recv", "message_id": "911732831", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "舒蕾很快开了门“回来啦，吃过晚饭了吗？……什么味道？”她抽了抽鼻子"}
{"time": 1764846524, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1038875380", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "脑袋耷拉着，\"我吐的...\""}
{"time": 1764846606, "type": "recv", "message_id": "35613026", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“怎么了？身体不舒服？”舒蕾牵住你的手，摸了摸你的额头“吃坏东西了？伊恩你也先去把衣服换了吧”"}
{"time": 1764846669, "type": "recv", "message_id": "298279089", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...”慢慢把舒茉放下“那我先走了，舒茉休息一下吧”"}
{"time": 1764846778, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2063474341", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"身体几乎是一瞬就跌倒到妈妈怀里，脑袋昏昏，\"舒茉做了坏事...\""}
{"time": 1764846843, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1996925276", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你继续说，我在听.jpg）"}
{"time": 1764847099, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1326789987", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...偷偷看了露莉亚姐姐的记忆...\"想到那种梦魇就浑身发抖，\"全是血...看完还要问姐姐她的过去...让姐姐生气了...妈妈...舒茉是不是错了...\"酸涩感从喉管蔓延上口腔，伸手压着自己的太阳穴，表情有些痛苦。"}
{"time": 1764847612, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1831950133", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“你……偷偷看了别人的记忆？”舒蕾愣了愣，一路抱着你先回到了床沿“……哎，我不知道……如果我也有这样的能力，可能我也会忍不住吧……但是窥探别人的隐私，总是……”舒蕾摇摇头，把否定留白“既然已经做了，就只能好好替人保守秘密了。不过，露莉亚小姐……看着明明那么明亮，居然……有血淋淋的过去吗？”"}
{"time": 1764847799, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1732366668", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "微微点点头，\"全是...全是血...舒茉...差点淹死在里面...现在也...\"酸涩上涌，连连干呕，\"呃...\"咬着牙，表情甚至可以说有些狰狞。"}
{"time": 1764848103, "type": "recv", "message_id": "179956578", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（翔哥呢）"}
{"time": 1764848311, "type": "recv", "message_id": "385560144", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "回去洗澡换衣服.jpg"}
{"time": 1764848379, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1264008782", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1732366668]“哎……也不知道舒茉有这样的能力，到底算好事还是坏事”她把你抱进怀里，轻拍着背给你顺气“那……要不要，去赔礼道歉？”"}
{"time": 1764848527, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1087422797", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"苦笑了一下，\"舒茉已经把姐姐彻底惹恼了...她当时没有动手，已经算是很温柔了吧...\"软绵绵地倒在妈妈怀里，\"还是不能...随随便便就揭开其他人的过去...\""}
{"time": 1764848560, "type": "recv", "message_id": "216601545", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=385560144][CQ:at,qq=1040972910] 总之会问你吃过饭没有.jpg"}
{"time": 1764848686, "type": "recv", "message_id": "917648262", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "闭上眼，一动也不想动，\"好累...好昏...\"说话的声音越来越低，\"妈...舒茉不想再看...那样的记忆...吐了两回...今天...\""}
{"time": 1764848706, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1951918585", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（第一次是什么）"}
