{"time": 1764848830, "type": "recv", "message_id": "437292915", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1764849007, "type": "recv", "message_id": "253836719", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1087422797]“嗯……越是强大的力量，越要谨慎对待才是”她顺着你的头发“至少应该征求对方的意见才对，吧？”"}
{"time": 1764849034, "type": "recv", "message_id": "939867613", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=628691282]“噢，我们稍微垫了点。一会要出去吃吗？”"}
{"time": 1764849064, "type": "recv", "message_id": "122270872", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我一想到露莉亚还要拖地）"}
