{"time": 1764849089, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1188405709", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“可以啊，不过等舒茉缓一下吧”"}
{"time": 1764849101, "type": "recv", "message_id": "704569627", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“或者好像给她带回来更好点”"}
{"time": 1764849130, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1386087564", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……？舒茉怎么了？”"}
{"time": 1764849149, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1246426969", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“她有点难受...吐了”"}
{"time": 1764849221, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1071893405", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“怎么？她又喝酒了？”汉斯像是触发了关键词"}
{"time": 1764849289, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1425398539", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那倒没有，舒茉...为了我，去看了露利亚姐姐的记忆，结果那段记忆有点太渗人了....”"}
{"time": 1764849371, "type": "recv", "message_id": "800499034", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=253836719]\"嗯...\"自己也有些不太确定...声音倒是越来越低，\"舒茉...不想思考了...\"被妈妈慢慢轻拍着背，意识感觉快要消于虚无中"}
{"time": 1764849410, "type": "recv", "message_id": "792769123", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1425398539]“呃，等一下……”他立起手掌“信息量有点大。露莉亚小姐？怎么要看她的记忆？和你有关系？”"}
{"time": 1764849490, "type": "recv", "message_id": "186828344", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "点点头“露利亚姐姐好像知道一些有关我过去的事情....”"}
{"time": 1764849544, "type": "recv", "message_id": "769273858", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=800499034]“嗯……先不想了，稍微睡一会吧”"}
