{"time": 1764850595, "type": "recv", "message_id": "848558001", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我...”之前已经说了无论遇到什么都要和舒茉一起走下去，但如果危险就是因为自己才有的呢,自己该离开吗... 摇摇头 这样好像太自私了，完全没有考虑舒茉的想法“我尊重舒茉的想法....如果她也觉得我太危险了，我就离开...”"}
{"time": 1764850638, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1080134119", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2059056710](今天之内嘛)"}
{"time": 1764850712, "type": "recv", "message_id": "97329480", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=848558001]“不对”他摇摇头“那是她怎么想，不行你怎么想”"}
{"time": 1764850722, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1485389627", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=848558001] “不对”他摇摇头“那是她怎么想，不是你怎么想”"}
{"time": 1764850813, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1372256695", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我自然是想和她一直走下去....已经约好了的...”"}
{"time": 1764850842, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1907377405", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "虽然语速很慢，但语气坚定"}
{"time": 1764851010, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1840622989", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我知道这么说听起来有些自私”他同样语速不快“如果真的有……那种时候。你知道我指的是什么，我希望，你能以大局为重”"}
{"time": 1764851079, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2125369599", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...”沉默了一小下“我会做出最合适的选择的”"}
{"time": 1764851192, "type": "recv", "message_id": "581135662", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯。既然有了头绪……还是早做准备吧”他站起身来“打算吃点什么吗？”"}
