{"time": 1764852554, "type": "recv", "message_id": "911854333", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（傻逼）"}
{"time": 1764852594, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1912084489", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "意外地睡得安稳，第二天倒是醒得相当早，天蒙蒙亮的时候就饿醒了，伴随着肚子叫睁开眼"}
{"time": 1764852607, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1541098302", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(看看处于什么状态。)"}
{"time": 1764852624, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1448658277", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（等我未来成了大业 就给她赐完全复生术卷轴）"}
{"time": 1764852670, "type": "recv", "message_id": "323041249", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（拉起来早就是undead了）"}
{"time": 1764852711, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1051597718", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那可以祈愿术加完全复生术）"}
{"time": 1764852744, "type": "recv", "message_id": "774895044", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1912084489]窝在舒蕾的怀里，她还睡着。空气中有淡淡的油醋汁的酸味"}
{"time": 1764852781, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1591663983", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（除非cos奥托冲树）"}
{"time": 1764852791, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2044943312", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（反正不给复活死人）"}
{"time": 1764852885, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1057113522", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "昨天看过的记忆对自己已经影响很小，但还是寻求温暖般靠得更近一些，伸手抱住她，安安心心地闭着眼等着她醒过来。"}
{"time": 1764852930, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1958763413", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "心里惴惴不安，睡得不是很好"}
{"time": 1764852932, "type": "recv", "message_id": "703369556", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那你们还）"}
{"time": 1764852938, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2096251654", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（去后巷吗，笑）"}
{"time": 1764853187, "type": "recv", "message_id": "224374877", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "总之，没什么异样的一天早上"}
{"time": 1764853198, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1685683336", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "大约七点半，舒蕾也醒了"}
{"time": 1764853226, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1575499777", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "双臂稍微用点力，让她知道自己是醒着的。"}
{"time": 1764853258, "type": "recv", "message_id": "285840819", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "辗转反侧，迷迷糊糊，等舒茉叫自己起床吧"}
{"time": 1764853283, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1455370077", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1575499777]（难说.jpg）"}
{"time": 1764853427, "type": "recv", "message_id": "313280532", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(呃)"}
{"time": 1764855187, "type": "recv", "message_id": "821055097", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1575499777]（你不如跟她眨眨眼）"}
{"time": 1764855253, "type": "recv", "message_id": "427330616", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……醒了？我都不记得昨天晚上什么时候睡着的……”她揉了揉眼睛“你中途醒过吗？啊，好像你的晚饭要变成早餐了”"}
{"time": 1764855652, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2063018286", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=427330616]\"都冷了啦...\"虽然不知道带的什么，摇摇脑袋，\"一直睡到现在，呼呼...\"不想动弹，依然保持抱着的姿势。"}
{"time": 1764855835, "type": "recv", "message_id": "157909153", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“本来就是凉面”她揉揉你的脸“伊恩说不知道你什么时候醒，选的这个”"}
{"time": 1764856335, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1649453651", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "惬意地嘟囔，\"不知道啦...早上才不想吃凉的——\"拖着尾音，\"都好久好久...没吃妈妈做的早餐了。\""}
{"time": 1764856388, "type": "recv", "message_id": "803032505", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（惨，伊恩）"}
{"time": 1764856469, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2057563300", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嘛，现在也没条件嘛”她似乎很受用，又抱了抱你“之后租到了房子，就可以咯”"}
{"time": 1764856546, "type": "recv", "message_id": "819088095", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（再无话说）"}
{"time": 1764856559, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1754850768", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那我问你，你早上吃凉的吗)"}
{"time": 1764856568, "type": "recv", "message_id": "45831976", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(吃冷的我会难受一整天)"}
{"time": 1764856628, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1747072887", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2057563300]\"嗯嗯。\"仰起脸在她脸颊上轻轻啄一下，\"今天要好好收拾...准备离开咯～\""}
{"time": 1764856929, "type": "recv", "message_id": "678018590", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……说的也是，每次中转都比预料花的时间长呢？”舒蕾点点头“下午出发吧”"}
{"time": 1764857148, "type": "recv", "message_id": "20706302", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好哦——\"揉揉眼睛，依依不舍地坐起来，\"待会舒茉再出趟门，还有什么要买的东西吗？\""}
{"time": 1764857535, "type": "recv", "message_id": "980648500", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“应该？没有了。昨天已经联系车队了”"}
{"time": 1764857590, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1410247749", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好吧。\"起床洗漱，去看看伊恩醒没醒"}
{"time": 1764857994, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1605464261", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "听到敲门声起身，穿好衣服洗漱一下去开门“来了～”"}
{"time": 1764858060, "type": "recv", "message_id": "46145642", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "精神满满地开口，\"嗨!早上好哦\""}
{"time": 1764858291, "type": "recv", "message_id": "857697541", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“早上好... 啊....”打个哈欠🥱，昨晚睡得并不是很好，刚刚洗漱的时候还看到了淡淡的黑眼圈"}
{"time": 1764858438, "type": "recv", "message_id": "790099405", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "不过看到元气满满的舒茉，感觉心情也变好了"}
{"time": 1764858508, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1897296180", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嘛～出发?\""}
{"time": 1764858749, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1767838204", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？去哪，找索西雅姐姐？”"}
{"time": 1764858763, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1808222860", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯。\""}
{"time": 1764858764, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1753486994", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“酒馆大早上感觉不会开门吧”"}
{"time": 1764858777, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2133837551", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"下午我们也要走了吧？\""}
{"time": 1764859101, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1659583441", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我的意思是中午去了...不过去看看也可以吧...”"}
{"time": 1764859146, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2052497576", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯。\"点头"}
