{"time": 1764873077, "type": "recv", "message_id": "173526976", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1764873100, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1476322780", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（发错了（））"}
{"time": 1764873103, "type": "recv", "message_id": "899258295", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=917453573]（这样吧，你说下理由就当你要过了）"}
{"time": 1764873108, "type": "recv", "message_id": "974934134", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=283306080]\"啊...事到如今还去找露莉亚吗？\"有些抗拒，不想去。"}
{"time": 1764873139, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1208336796", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那当然是，给索西雅买谢礼)"}
{"time": 1764873156, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1763931867", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(另外，哭穷一翻，说自己买衣服花了好多钱)"}
{"time": 1764873187, "type": "recv", "message_id": "945763313", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（厉害）"}
{"time": 1764873210, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1772622505", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯....我们不用见到她，不如说专门避开她...然后以一个被她救助过的人的口吻给她写一封匿名感谢信，在加点礼品之类的，她应该心里也会稍微舒服一些吧.....”"}
{"time": 1764873234, "type": "recv", "message_id": "947257542", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（不管怎么样，出门在外跟家里说自己没钱）"}
{"time": 1764873239, "type": "recv", "message_id": "755657989", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（肯定能拿到的啦）"}
{"time": 1764873261, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1235513097", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "虽然嘴上说着是为了露莉亚好...但其实主要是自己的心里有些过意不起"}
{"time": 1764873464, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1649947928", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"算了，到时候如果遇见了，只会更尴尬。\"用力摇头，\"我不去。\""}
{"time": 1764873555, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1300981803", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"先去酒馆吧——之后要是伊恩想去，我就一个人去后街。\""}
{"time": 1764873615, "type": "recv", "message_id": "123226938", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，我们下午几点走来着...露莉亚下午似乎会有一段固定的外出时间”"}
{"time": 1764873727, "type": "recv", "message_id": "492275965", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=123226938]\"...\"偷偷歪过头翻了个白眼，\"我不知道，你现在回去问吧。\""}
{"time": 1764873874, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1038001568", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“到时候再说吧...我们先去酒馆啦，至于后街的话，我也会陪舒茉一起去的”"}
{"time": 1764873968, "type": "recv", "message_id": "483558571", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "总之到了，还开着门"}
{"time": 1764873985, "type": "recv", "message_id": "990528687", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好啦好啦——\"也不想继续这个话题，拍拍嘴巴假装打个哈欠，推门进去，\"索西雅女士?早上好——\""}
{"time": 1764874075, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1006198038", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯，早……今天来的真早”她自己手里端着半杯葡萄酒“要喝点什么？”"}
{"time": 1764874082, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1698545692", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“早上好”坐到那个常坐的位置“两杯豆浆吧”"}
{"time": 1764874178, "type": "recv", "message_id": "549327227", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶...热可可吧。\"轻轻拧了一下伊恩的手臂，\"嘛，今天当然也是带着问题来的。\"手指扭了扭他的软肉，\"伊恩说吧?\""}
{"time": 1764874255, "type": "recv", "message_id": "588595338", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“...索西雅姐姐见多识广..有没有听过黑暗之眼的”期盼的看着她"}
{"time": 1764874630, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2037607134", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“有所耳闻”她点点头“说是眼，实际上没有固定形态。能源源不断地产生魔力……这东西被发现，也就是最近几十年的事情。”"}
{"time": 1764874707, "type": "recv", "message_id": "587302099", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "在旁边默默地听着，不打算插入这段对话，松开手，抱着手臂坐着。"}
{"time": 1764874775, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1611416711", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“最早是黑魔法的产物，不过在魔力浓度高的地方，也经常发现这种……能源”"}
{"time": 1764874787, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2024038412", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“源源不断？怎么可能....听起来好玄乎”"}
{"time": 1764874925, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1487309108", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“实际上不止魔力……黑暗之眼可以被移植到生物体内。尽管死亡率很高，但……成功之后，生命力也会得到极大增幅”"}
{"time": 1764874963, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1579520245", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"啊...\"忍不住惊呼出声，\"...\"随后又闭上了嘴"}
{"time": 1764875085, "type": "recv", "message_id": "926990252", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“......”自己之前有些伤好像确实好的有点快“公国之前也有出现过黑暗之眼吗....”"}
{"time": 1764875750, "type": "recv", "message_id": "574260028", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“有……按数量说，其实不少”索西雅点头“有的作为研究素材和备用能源，被各魔法组织封存，这类占大多数。还有的……”她顿了顿“被用于，实验，甚至还有一部分本身就是实验的产物”"}
{"time": 1764875801, "type": "recv", "message_id": "756041975", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“实验....”感觉听起来很邪恶的感觉"}
{"time": 1764875812, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1616943644", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“十多年前，在本地有出现过相关的恶性事件吗？”"}
{"time": 1764876290, "type": "recv", "message_id": "734318388", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……原来是这么回事”索西雅叹了口气，带着些同情的神色“14年前，南部溪谷的黑橡木教团……就是那小部分中的小部分。被前任教宗法兰斯大人亲自剿灭。据说，他们通过凝聚大量带恶念的魔力和生命力的方法，反向逼近黑暗之眼……同样也据说，被教团控制的人中，仅有一人幸存”"}
{"time": 1764876428, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1876021494", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那个人不会是......”有点不敢继续想下去"}
{"time": 1764876512, "type": "recv", "message_id": "413797278", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "没继续开口，“嗯...我们下午就离开了。”转移话题，“西海岸有什么值得注意的事吗？索西雅女士。”"}
{"time": 1764876605, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1294668226", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1876021494]“嗯，就是露莉亚小姐”她替你说完了没说出口的猜想"}
{"time": 1764876708, "type": "recv", "message_id": "324986823", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "怪不得...她那天会生气，怪不得她的记忆里都是血...“索西亚姐姐知道露莉亚姐姐有什么喜欢的东西吗...”"}
{"time": 1764876712, "type": "recv", "message_id": "194422007", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=413797278]“西海岸，是个比赫顿玛尔年轻的多的地区。节奏更快，生活更便捷，更商业化，人们普遍也更热情。”"}
{"time": 1764876728, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1328379052", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=324986823]（早有记载）"}
{"time": 1764876732, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1871737857", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(原来是北京上海)"}
{"time": 1764876741, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1305936391", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=194422007]（）"}
{"time": 1764876747, "type": "recv", "message_id": "758180236", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你还记得她的房间装饰么）"}
{"time": 1764876805, "type": "recv", "message_id": "415669665", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“...”听到这话不免有些无语，百无聊赖地盯着自己手里杯子里的可可。"}
{"time": 1764876807, "type": "recv", "message_id": "58362576", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=324986823]“抱歉，我不知道”她摇头“露莉亚小姐很少对什么东西表现出过特别的兴趣”"}
{"time": 1764876910, "type": "recv", "message_id": "12867057", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1124420588]“这样啊...还是谢谢索西雅姐姐了”"}
