{"time": 1764904374, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1921178118", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“记不太清，不过应该不会，我印象里几乎没见过她醉酒的样子”她摇头"}
