{"time": 1764906450, "type": "recv", "message_id": "132034666", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(可以)"}
{"time": 1764906460, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1157276669", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那我其实快到了)"}
{"time": 1764906640, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1539804489", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我不知道....”摇摇头“我也不确定哪样才是最好的，也许我们直接离开，再也不见也是一种好的方法....但是我们前几天的做法毕竟给她带了不少的压力...直接走的话感觉有些不太负责任.....如果露莉亚姐姐知道有人在默默的支持着自己，心里可能也会开心一些吧...毕竟她看起来还挺想当圣职者的，虽然很少人认可她就是了..........”"}
{"time": 1764906826, "type": "recv", "message_id": "951451195", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不认可她的只是教会内部的人吧？\"摇头，\"那你觉得——支持她的人，会知道她的房间吗？\"停下脚步，\"而且...负责啊...\""}
{"time": 1764906909, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1838675291", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（原来送的是72元标准款）"}
{"time": 1764906913, "type": "recv", "message_id": "403299763", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（刚刚下单失败了）"}
{"time": 1764906915, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1141622805", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"伊恩说了相当麻烦的话呢——\"皱起眉，\"负责可是...要做到哪一步的问题了。\""}
{"time": 1764906918, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1612340427", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（然后，简单来说）"}
