{"time": 1764907018, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1145992320", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎，好吧，既然舒茉都这样说了”"}
{"time": 1764907020, "type": "recv", "message_id": "374155215", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1141622805]\"现在这个情况——我们能为她做什么呢？\"语气凛冽了一些，\"见面无异于撒盐，你如果真的想做什么的话，就证明给她看。\""}
{"time": 1764907071, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1842042686", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“证明什么呢...我感觉我也没什么要向她证明的”"}
