{"time": 1764917791, "type": "recv", "message_id": "632178204", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(呃，也还好吧)"}
{"time": 1764917799, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1225812243", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(哈利波特也叫他老爹尖头叉子)"}
{"time": 1764918175, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1573880552", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1811481723]“哎……哎，随便了。反正这么多年过去，卢旺斯已经死了，应该也不用藏着掖着了”舒蕾撇了撇嘴“不过，少点……直接被叫名字很不习惯诶”"}
{"time": 1764918475, "type": "recv", "message_id": "931875504", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嘛——\"挽住她的胳膊，\"只限这一次啦，妈妈～\"走出升降梯，\"出发!西海岸。\""}
{"time": 1764918507, "type": "recv", "message_id": "535051714", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我在想，夏末秋初刮点台风挺正常的）"}
{"time": 1764918602, "type": "recv", "message_id": "45963979", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(这样吗"}
{"time": 1764918642, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1348596637", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“出发！西海岸！”跟着舒茉一起开心的喊道"}
{"time": 1764918648, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1857744764", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "这时你才后知后觉地感觉到，阅读露莉亚的记忆并非只带来了痛苦。你的魔力似乎也有些许增长"}
{"time": 1764918686, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1582681195", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（lv7）"}
{"time": 1764918855, "type": "recv", "message_id": "497183019", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "眨了眨眼，倒是没感觉到什么特别的，大概"}
{"time": 1764919137, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1719602914", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "很快你们就到了另一个商会，业务范围涵盖从诺伊佩拉到赫顿玛尔到西海岸沿线。马车看起来并不比迈腾商会的更大，但显然保养地更好。舒蕾包办了一中一小两架马车，莫辛和甘纳许上了小些的那个"}
{"time": 1764919253, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2076934671", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "帮着把行李搬上马车，随后自己坐进去，\"嘛...进来就感觉腰酸背痛了...\""}
{"time": 1764919530, "type": "recv", "message_id": "794137644", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“赫顿玛尔到西海岸可都是大路”舒蕾把行李塞到座位下。座位铺了红色的软垫，而且相当长，足够轮流侧躺的“十几年前就是这样了，而且这家的车身做了减震，安啦”"}
{"time": 1764919751, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1188190308", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“看起来比来的时候的马车要好上不少...”"}
{"time": 1764919820, "type": "recv", "message_id": "69351086", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（前段时间炫狗看魔法少女小圆）"}
{"time": 1764919832, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2125065224", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（然后给起了个贼南蚌了外号）"}
{"time": 1764919844, "type": "recv", "message_id": "826805315", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（魔法少女小方（）"}
{"time": 1764919870, "type": "recv", "message_id": "949664689", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯嗯。\"挑个角角坐下，\"呼...\"研究一下刚刚上涨的魔力，\"嗯...\"不知道这次会不会能掌握新的魔法"}
{"time": 1764920180, "type": "recv", "message_id": "145055736", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1188190308]“毕竟是跨国的大公司嘛”舒蕾撩开窗帘，玻璃窗外树丛已经开始后移，在风中招摇"}
{"time": 1764920208, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1234570474", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=949664689][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] 看如果舒蕾和汉斯坐一起的话，自然就去坐到舒茉的身旁了"}
{"time": 1764920217, "type": "recv", "message_id": "542940689", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=949664689]（我觉得隐身其实是，光学魔法啊）"}
{"time": 1764920332, "type": "recv", "message_id": "656176277", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "虽然在叔叔阿姨面前不能做太过分的事情，但牵牵手之类的应该无所谓"}
