{"time": 1764933825, "type": "recv", "message_id": "122392906", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这是？星星？”舒蕾原本靠在汉斯身上，这时凑了过来“亮闪闪的……现在是白天诶”"}
