{"time": 1764934123, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1883168315", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2000370559][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “嗯...怎么做到的...好厉害”"}
{"time": 1764934166, "type": "recv", "message_id": "388473675", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（光速全部分量用于在时间维度向前跑，所以光速在三维世界速度不变）"}
{"time": 1764934219, "type": "recv", "message_id": "441179663", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（所有物品实际上都是光速运动，物品在三维世界有实质速度，但由于光速不变，在三维世界有速度，在时间尺度上速度就变慢）"}
{"time": 1764934224, "type": "recv", "message_id": "473479578", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（所以钟慢）"}
