{"time": 1764936721, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1867132236", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1013513883]（所以还牵着吗（）"}
{"time": 1764936730, "type": "recv", "message_id": "835834713", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（肯定松开了啊）"}
{"time": 1764936965, "type": "recv", "message_id": "696345553", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "极轻的啪嗒声响起，像安眠曲的前奏，分不清是不是窗外风吹树叶的声音。随后嘀嗒声清晰地与风声分别开来，如同碎钻落入玉盘，那是雨滴落在车顶的声音"}
{"time": 1764937042, "type": "recv", "message_id": "269291350", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "轻轻靠在她身上，\"下雨了...\"好在在车内还算温馨，\"呼...早上和伊恩出门的时候明明天气还很好。\""}
{"time": 1764937068, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1141524089", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“中午的时候就已经是阴天了吧...舒茉忘记了吗”"}
{"time": 1764937147, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1683190362", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好惨一个）"}
{"time": 1764937149, "type": "recv", "message_id": "628651494", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（伊恩）"}
{"time": 1764937223, "type": "recv", "message_id": "414796235", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶...那会没什么感觉呢?\"手指搭在自己的脸上，\"不过...在车厢里听雨，很舒服...\""}
{"time": 1764937260, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1052661332", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯....感觉内心都平静了”"}
{"time": 1764937381, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1601480961", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"虽然这么说啦。\"语气轻轻地，\"狂风暴雨的时候...待在高高的塔尖的床上...说不定...嗯，想体验一下。\""}
{"time": 1764937521, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2135460242", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "好消息是，行车的方向与风向相同，门帘也够厚，暂时依然滴水不进。恐怕只是要苦一苦车夫。"}
{"time": 1764937572, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1461460424", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“希望雨不要再大些了...不过天估计要变得更冷了啊...”"}
{"time": 1764937611, "type": "recv", "message_id": "230045400", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "雨水打在玻璃上，拉出透明的雨线。车厢内的烛火稍有摇曳"}
{"time": 1764937625, "type": "recv", "message_id": "530235511", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（还有玻璃吗（）"}
