{"time": 1764940192, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2043502422", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=643781376]不管是余光，还是魔力感知的视野里……你都看见伊恩把手伸出窗外，正在开闸放魔力"}
{"time": 1764940251, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2070124821", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "合上书，坐回伊恩身边，拍拍他，\"在做什么?外面不是在下雨吗？\""}
{"time": 1764940508, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1937325280", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯....在释放魔力....魔力的问题还没有解决...有点点溢出了，而且想刺激一下那个东西...说不定就可以解决了”继续源源不断的释放"}
{"time": 1764940759, "type": "recv", "message_id": "152177739", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1937325280]\"...嗯...\"其实有些担心，之前自己魔力枯竭的时候...\"下车之后会不会好一些...我有些担心...\""}
{"time": 1764940783, "type": "recv", "message_id": "934968924", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（困了就睡（）"}
{"time": 1764940940, "type": "recv", "message_id": "947449459", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1937325280]（但是其实索西雅敲过你的胸）"}
{"time": 1764940947, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1504371540", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（基本能确定就在心脏了）"}
{"time": 1764940980, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2015833392", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是男法最变态的地方其实是）"}
{"time": 1764940988, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1869191334", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（他不是融合，是替换）"}
{"time": 1764941072, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1100007195", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=152177739][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “咦，应该没什么事吧，而且感觉估计要重复好多次”"}
{"time": 1764941151, "type": "recv", "message_id": "102970390", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1100007195]\"那...我看着点伊恩。\"牵起伊恩的手，\"嗯，不要勉强自己...我会一直看着的。\""}
{"time": 1764941197, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1887430512", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“没事啦....只是用光魔力应该没什么事情啦.”"}
{"time": 1764941217, "type": "recv", "message_id": "917399282", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我想不到为什么会有事，有的人还一丁点魔力没有呢）"}
{"time": 1764941228, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1443770018", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=102970390]另一只手摸摸舒茉的头"}
{"time": 1764941237, "type": "recv", "message_id": "651816932", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那你可能得）"}
{"time": 1764941243, "type": "recv", "message_id": "84550469", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（问萧炎）"}
{"time": 1764941265, "type": "recv", "message_id": "307842540", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我其实觉得每个人都有点，但是有些人用不了，就没有这种问题)"}
{"time": 1764941267, "type": "recv", "message_id": "501652055", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(大概)"}
{"time": 1764941404, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1398183078", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（倒不是这个问题。打个比方，有的人习惯天天喝白粥配酸菜，也活得好好的。有的人习惯天天大鱼大肉，身体习惯了，也有高需求，突然换成白粥当然受不了）"}
{"time": 1764941427, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1196242987", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（你们说的都对）"}
{"time": 1764941432, "type": "recv", "message_id": "804743153", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1887430512]\"嗯...\"尽管如此，手倒是没有松开，\"舒茉愿意看着嘛，这样的话，伊恩也能幅度大一些吧？\""}
{"time": 1764941438, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1166207016", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（但有没有问题，其实还是看龙哥怎么判）"}
{"time": 1764941452, "type": "recv", "message_id": "83611979", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那谢谢舒茉啦...”"}
{"time": 1764941620, "type": "recv", "message_id": "954628872", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "随着魔力放出，伊恩感觉体内一直充盈的魔力得到了释放。与此同时，胸腔中的什么东西一点点释放、融入身体各处。虽然不及释放的速度快，但的确弥补着放出的部分。不过空虚感确实在堆积。与疲乏不同，身体的灵敏、力量都没有受影响，但就是缺乏动起来的欲望"}
{"time": 1764941650, "type": "recv", "message_id": "536671185", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=83611979]\"嗯...\"靠在旁边的车厢里，\"不要太勉强哦——\""}
{"time": 1764941718, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1959397748", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "直到魔力近乎耗尽，胸腔内依旧有丝丝缕缕的魔力不依不饶地产出，又很快被流放，身体从容器转变为单行道的感觉就像被一个丝带贯穿，还在朝一侧拉动，莫名有些牵扯感"}
{"time": 1764941822, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1162107815", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "至于被放出去的魔力，很快就在大气中扩散了"}
{"time": 1764941845, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1314683736", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...谢谢舒茉关心啦...”魔力不断被放出，虽然感觉有些累...不过还不至于晕过去"}
{"time": 1764941962, "type": "recv", "message_id": "743789572", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我在想，对你来说魔力和生命力应该算同源的东西……）"}
{"time": 1764942011, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2099976722", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（你的意思我在放生命力？）"}
{"time": 1764942024, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1763123532", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（黑暗之眼还是挺聪明的啦）"}
{"time": 1764942035, "type": "recv", "message_id": "472325987", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（会留一手的）"}
{"time": 1764942057, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1849247872", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（一般情况还是放不到血的）"}
{"time": 1764942089, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1725408912", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "不过这种情况也持续不了太久，释放魔力还是会消耗一部分体力，气喘吁吁的把手收回来“呼...呼...”用火元素把手的水蒸发掉，后躺靠着墙"}
{"time": 1764942139, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1550621838", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是其实我也在想舒茉只是清空蓝条为什么和要死了一样（）"}
{"time": 1764942152, "type": "recv", "message_id": "308133919", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "自己还是头一回连着这么久使用魔力，体力稍微有些跟不太上“看来...到时候我也得和舒茉一起锻炼了....呼....”"}
{"time": 1764942303, "type": "recv", "message_id": "665777772", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不过如果只是嗯造黑暗之眼，猛猛激发，不往里头堆别的料的话）"}
{"time": 1764942318, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1940779148", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（感觉进阶会很黑暗啊（）"}
{"time": 1764942459, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1201511124", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（嗯造的话，好像进阶方向就是魔皇了）"}
