{"time": 1764942856, "type": "recv", "message_id": "217490360", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（厉害）"}
{"time": 1764942884, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1876649501", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=308133919]\"诶...嗯...\"通过握着的手给他提供一些自己的魔力，\"缓一下吧...伊恩...\""}
{"time": 1764943075, "type": "recv", "message_id": "954966288", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢...舒茉的魔力..很温暖.....”虽然自己稍微休息一下就好了，不过难得的和舒茉互动的机会并不想错过"}
{"time": 1764943134, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1464630018", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好啦，先休息一会嘛。多多依靠我也是可以的。\"另一只手拍拍自己的肩膀。"}
{"time": 1764943173, "type": "recv", "message_id": "539274952", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "魔力恢复的速度比想象中快些，说不定身体里真的有一口井"}
{"time": 1764943192, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1330721797", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "说着的同时还在供给自己的魔力，缓慢但是也算稳定"}
{"time": 1764943333, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1683078425", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“舒茉不要给我供给太多，自己到累着了...我已经差不多了”担心的说到"}
{"time": 1764943443, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1338307001", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1683078425]\"嗯...\"最后点点头，停下了供给，\"放心好了...我自己心里有数。\""}
{"time": 1764943591, "type": "recv", "message_id": "864205653", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“感觉...黑暗之眼的存在感比以前强了好多....现在我能清楚的感觉到，心脏处魔力随着血液不断的供给给身体的各个位置....”"}
{"time": 1764943703, "type": "recv", "message_id": "646040219", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"轻轻开口，\"会越来越好的。\""}
{"time": 1764944089, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2117664885", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...都会越来越好的...“摸摸舒茉的脸“对了，舒茉刚刚不是要睡的么，要不要我往那边靠靠，你躺我腿上”"}
{"time": 1764944182, "type": "recv", "message_id": "347065508", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶..\"偷偷看一眼妈妈。"}
{"time": 1764944224, "type": "recv", "message_id": "511750379", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎，我都不敢（）"}
{"time": 1764944357, "type": "recv", "message_id": "707497341", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“咳哼。”舒蕾清了清嗓子，同样挪到了一个躺下能刚好枕到腿的位置"}
{"time": 1764944361, "type": "recv", "message_id": "301413918", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "现在是，选择睡觉"}
{"time": 1764944366, "type": "recv", "message_id": "767570080", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "现在是，选择时间"}
{"time": 1764944455, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1867637997", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看到阿姨这样大概也知道结果了，尴尬的笑笑"}
{"time": 1764944525, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1788805049", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（起码没有追究你摸脸揩油的事情（）"}
{"time": 1764944536, "type": "recv", "message_id": "940620632", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎，我在阿姨面前都只敢和小龙女牵手）"}
{"time": 1764944615, "type": "recv", "message_id": "280152777", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"看见妈妈的反应，靠到她身边"}
{"time": 1764945067, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1831080443", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嘛...\"乖乖躺在她的怀里"}
{"time": 1764945166, "type": "recv", "message_id": "898144478", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "自己也靠在墙上稍微休息一下吧"}
{"time": 1764945180, "type": "recv", "message_id": "953133944", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "舒蕾莫名露出了有些得逞的、胜利者的表情"}
{"time": 1764945509, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1853377767", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "不知道说些什么，有些无奈，不过倒也正常就是了，睡觉吧，说不定能做一个不同以往的梦"}
{"time": 1764945546, "type": "recv", "message_id": "162785729", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（不同以往的浪漫梦境（））"}
{"time": 1764945661, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1161238204", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"妈妈...\"伸手掐掐她"}
{"time": 1764945815, "type": "recv", "message_id": "364773203", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "有些无可奈何的表情"}
{"time": 1764945994, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1537021849", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=364773203]“怎么了怎么了”她倒是一副理所当然的样子“我就不能撒娇吗？”"}
{"time": 1764946193, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1348550375", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"所以舒茉才没办法嘛...\"慢慢放下心来，\"妈妈撒娇太有杀伤力了...\"鼓了鼓脸颊。"}
{"time": 1764946624, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1733450754", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“好了”她似乎已经满意了“嗯，想去另一边也没关系哦？”"}
{"time": 1764947073, "type": "recv", "message_id": "388773637", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"没事嘛...抱都已经抱住了，哪还有松开的道理。\"翻了一下身子，换了一个仰躺的姿势，\"舒茉要枕到妈妈累了为止。\""}
{"time": 1764947433, "type": "recv", "message_id": "695069855", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……好好”她盖上你的眼睛，抽出两条毯子，一条交给汉斯盖在伊恩身上，一条盖在舒茉身上"}
{"time": 1764947735, "type": "recv", "message_id": "459360096", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"呼呼...就算这么说，一时也睡不着啦...\""}
{"time": 1764948121, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1725140172", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（话说今晚有吗（））"}
