{"time": 1764960953, "type": "recv", "message_id": "227316008", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "阴雨连绵，雨把自己从来客变成背景，不增不减，只有风声在逐渐变大"}
{"time": 1764961177, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1683656158", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "虽然那么说了，但是盖着摊子，迷迷糊糊在妈妈怀里就睡着了，jpg"}
{"time": 1764961967, "type": "recv", "message_id": "241295096", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（难道是我动吗）"}
{"time": 1764962009, "type": "recv", "message_id": "524955520", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不太懂，不过看你想不想动）"}
{"time": 1764962091, "type": "recv", "message_id": "561040939", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(看你想不想动呗)"}
{"time": 1764962098, "type": "recv", "message_id": "977443147", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(不动就skip)"}
{"time": 1764962129, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1678965025", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "很快便睡着了，甚至不知道汉斯叔叔帮自己盖了毯子"}
{"time": 1764962412, "type": "recv", "message_id": "370301103", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "你们在梦醒间浮沉了许久，车厢外惊雷炸响，车厢内远比预想中的黑"}
{"time": 1764962511, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1674534555", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "被雷声惊醒，骤然睁开了眼睛，\"唔...\"确认一下自己的状态"}
{"time": 1764962584, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1528610006", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“....？”揉揉眼睛，看看外面什么情况"}
{"time": 1764962608, "type": "recv", "message_id": "202621206", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "自然是安安稳稳，因为维持一个姿势睡觉稍有僵硬"}
{"time": 1764962734, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1288430209", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "视线回转，看看母亲"}
