{"time": 1764987058, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1463545383", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[顾时汐]演奏出: 1D20=14"}
{"time": 1764987198, "type": "recv", "message_id": "463090603", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=115786697]\"唔唔...妈妈多依靠依靠舒茉也是可以的嘛。\"紧靠着她坐着，又拍怕自己的肩膀。"}
{"time": 1764987342, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1005819448", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=925515841]远处又一道惨白的闪电落下，短暂地照亮了天地。朝靠右的窗口外看去，黑云拼成的背景前，数不清的百米高塔林立，笔直的塔身反射着光芒，像给背景刻下一道道亮线\n而在最近的山尖，似乎有一个身披长袍的人影居高临下地看着你，兜帽下的眼睛泛着青蓝色的、鬼火般的光芒，但转眼之间又不见了"}
{"time": 1764987433, "type": "recv", "message_id": "93698733", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "\"?我没睡醒吗\"再次揉揉眼睛“刚刚山顶是不是有个人”小声和舒茉交流"}
{"time": 1764987444, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1531458527", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1463545383]也看见了远处的高塔"}
{"time": 1764987458, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1607176629", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "但是或许是角度受限，没发现山尖的人影"}
{"time": 1764987512, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2076343212", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“而且...那些塔是什么，当地的景点吗....”"}
{"time": 1764987633, "type": "recv", "message_id": "532075799", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=463090603]她轻轻点头“好吧好吧”随后身形往下滑了点，歪过头来把脑袋靠在你肩膀上"}
{"time": 1764987728, "type": "recv", "message_id": "789332825", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"摇摇头，这里的景观，自己自然是一无所知，\"哪里有?\"脑袋稍微扭一扭，搭着妈妈，说话声音很小。"}
{"time": 1764987813, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2132146951", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（有一说一，我到现在都不知道）"}
