{"time": 1765093436, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2108246829", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“是魔法阵？”"}
{"time": 1765093487, "type": "recv", "message_id": "472336276", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“什么...？”摇醒妈妈，或者本来已经醒了，“感觉很不妙，我们不要靠近了。”"}
{"time": 1765093566, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2119706612", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "马匹似乎也觉得有些不妙，刚跑上没几步又停了下来，不安地在原地踱步着"}
{"time": 1765093592, "type": "recv", "message_id": "506330491", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“现在怎么办...”看看周围的环境，确认一下地形"}
{"time": 1765093627, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1046238789", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=472336276]“魔法？”舒蕾已经醒了过来，握着你的手，重复了一遍伊恩的判断“怎么会在这里？这个时候？”"}
{"time": 1765093677, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1488623902", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=506330491]右侧是山壁，后路也已经被泥石流截断。左侧是相对平缓的平原林地"}
{"time": 1765093725, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1779726087", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“不能在这里坐以待毙...”喊一下车夫，“先生，让马跑起来，不能去前边。”"}
{"time": 1765093795, "type": "recv", "message_id": "612998216", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“马在林地可以跑吗...”现在天气不太好，林子里应该相当泥泞，尤其还带着车，感觉估计不太行，但留在原地的话，这里有可能会发生泥石流..."}
{"time": 1765093801, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2043518194", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这……不去前边，还能去哪？”车夫也有些惊疑不定，拽着缰绳“马车可走不了林地”"}
{"time": 1765093867, "type": "recv", "message_id": "39680469", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "似乎现在只有弃车和向前两个选项了.....但前面也不一定是敌人吧..大概，这种可能性还是不要赌了，有些纠结，看看舒蕾阿姨怎么说"}
{"time": 1765093880, "type": "recv", "message_id": "243956244", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不说）"}
{"time": 1765093892, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1207167085", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（kpc这时候怎么表态，她又不懂魔法）"}
{"time": 1765093893, "type": "recv", "message_id": "264267449", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“我们先去左边...”自己当然也没什么好办法，简单快速画一个夜视的法阵，尝试在黑夜中看得更清。"}
{"time": 1765094039, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1681874489", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（诶，那你这个时候就可以过侦查了）"}
{"time": 1765094219, "type": "recv", "message_id": "883054589", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd20"}
{"time": 1765094219, "type": "reply", "message_id": "883054589", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[顾时汐]演奏出: 1D20=2"}
{"time": 1765094252, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1648198795", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（说起来不给伊恩也加一个吗）"}
{"time": 1765094258, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1096848269", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“伊恩，还记得这个吧？”把法阵递给伊恩，“试试看。”"}
{"time": 1765094427, "type": "recv", "message_id": "877128357", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "\"嗯....\"使用那个夜视阵法，眼前瞬间变得敞亮了起来"}
{"time": 1765094434, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1727865389", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": ".rd+4 侦查"}
{"time": 1765094434, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1727865389", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[伊恩]使用[侦查]演奏出:[1D20+4={17}+4=21]"}
{"time": 1765094798, "type": "recv", "message_id": "640173401", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "夜幕像是突然亮堂起来了，远处的路中间竟伫立着一根黑漆漆的柱子，柱子上白色的纹路蔓延，像是什么封印，又像是部件拼装的接驳处。在柱子周围，赫然有几具骨架骷髅，用骨节叩击着那柱子。先前所见到的灯火，赫然是那骨头眼窝中阴燃的鬼火"}
{"time": 1765094930, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1106319453", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“呀...”看见这幅场景忍不住惊呼“骷.....骷髅”这还是自己第一次见到这种生物，难免有些害怕“不能...不能往前了...”"}
{"time": 1765095055, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1218712745", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“骷髅？”拍拍自己的脑门，“什么？”"}
{"time": 1765095514, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1331208291", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“真的是骷髅....那也不是普通的火，是鬼火...”越说越害怕，忍不住打颤“绝对不能往前了”"}
{"time": 1765095536, "type": "recv", "message_id": "579900542", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（有点眼熟（）"}
{"time": 1765095630, "type": "recv", "message_id": "548244709", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“嗯...先往左边走吧。”"}
{"time": 1765095716, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1682415110", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“现在的话……去林子里过夜吗？”舒蕾见状也压低声音“不知道莫辛他们有没有雨披”"}
{"time": 1765095827, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2069743406", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...不管怎么样，也不能靠近那个东西。感觉很不好。\""}
{"time": 1765095900, "type": "recv", "message_id": "373118979", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（是哦，都忘记莫辛了，那她们的马不怕冷吗（）"}
{"time": 1765095916, "type": "recv", "message_id": "400207631", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（）"}
{"time": 1765095933, "type": "recv", "message_id": "56347823", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你就当一起干了吧）"}
{"time": 1765095955, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1699330914", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（远程精准投放？）"}
{"time": 1765095962, "type": "recv", "message_id": "728685435", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好吧）"}
{"time": 1765095989, "type": "recv", "message_id": "6354736", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=579900542]（不过）"}
{"time": 1765096047, "type": "recv", "message_id": "820438517", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "叫住莫辛她们，然后一起去林子里先躲着吧，等天亮再说"}
{"time": 1765096061, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1454044462", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（然后发现林子其实是猛毒雷鸣废墟（））"}
{"time": 1765096085, "type": "recv", "message_id": "745690326", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我的意思是，上次也是坐马车到一半发现有问题（）"}
{"time": 1765096106, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1504277414", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1454044462]（直接给你发配去悲鸣洞穴吧要不）"}
{"time": 1765096398, "type": "recv", "message_id": "884642472", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=820438517]车夫开始着手解开马匹的缰绳，看起来不打算就这么放弃。莫辛和甘纳许知晓了原委，自然不会拒绝。莫辛紧紧抓着甘纳许的手，在宽大的雨披下都能看出她的颤抖"}
{"time": 1765096430, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1715644776", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "在这期间，骷髅叩击石柱的声音也没有停下"}
{"time": 1765096656, "type": "recv", "message_id": "922122953", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "抓着妈妈的手，这种情况简直闻所未闻，只希望不要出事..."}
{"time": 1765097042, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1182534310", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "只有你们眼前的线条还算清晰，其他人只能摸黑前行，马夫小心翼翼地探着路，生怕牵着的几百斤的庞然大物有什么差池。耳边的声响杂得不成样子，风雨声中，时不时就能听见谁的鞋子踩在湿滑的地面上滑动的声音，往往还接着些轻呼"}
{"time": 1765097057, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1716315761", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "至于那阴寒的气息……似乎还在变浓"}
{"time": 1765097194, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1558698944", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我怎么感觉....不太好的样子”"}
{"time": 1765097237, "type": "recv", "message_id": "252503370", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“林子里好像也不太对....要不我们原地停下吧”"}
{"time": 1765097262, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1032324415", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（原地是哪个原地）"}
{"time": 1765097324, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1124123818", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...在这种情况下，不管做什么...都不清楚对错。\"摇摇头，\"不要停下来。\""}
{"time": 1765097613, "type": "recv", "message_id": "996488957", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(大人呢"}
{"time": 1765097623, "type": "recv", "message_id": "806537780", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（这种时候让小孩做决断吗（））"}
{"time": 1765097647, "type": "recv", "message_id": "648039339", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那你觉得她们有什么建设性意见吗（）"}
{"time": 1765097659, "type": "recv", "message_id": "598061808", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...好吧，都听舒茉的”点点头"}
