{"time": 1765179091, "type": "recv", "message_id": "428881115", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（而且，这里对于舒茉有点难开口，一方面急着拉人走，一方面在想要不要不管他之类的，所以我的棘手在多方面。）"}
{"time": 1765179278, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1748911513", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（[CQ:at,qq=1040972910] 别hellball了）"}
{"time": 1765179317, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1362077830", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我也不知道该怎么回了（）"}
{"time": 1765179337, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1938187240", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（不清楚现在该休息还是🥲继续逃跑）"}
{"time": 1765179367, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1459607465", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那站着？）"}
{"time": 1765179380, "type": "recv", "message_id": "427103321", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（让我想想）"}
{"time": 1765179392, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1942969089", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（虽然角色塑造层面，舒蕾可能该做点决断）"}
{"time": 1765179403, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1767879766", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（帮帮舒茉，刘想和先生）"}
{"time": 1765179539, "type": "recv", "message_id": "362541918", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1008449946]虽然看到小屋有些开心，但身后的危险仍然还在，还是不能就此休息“林子里好像有什么东西...在追我们”"}
{"time": 1765179562, "type": "recv", "message_id": "387215326", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“嗯，而且很危险，老伯最好一起离开。”"}
{"time": 1765179821, "type": "recv", "message_id": "240918958", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "在你们交涉的当口，莫辛见缝插针地在檐下的台阶上坐下歇脚。而门内依旧在跨服聊天“野猪又下山了？小屋里倒是可以躲一躲……这么大的雨，还上哪去”"}
{"time": 1765179849, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1811954160", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "至少窗内透出了些火光"}
{"time": 1765180005, "type": "recv", "message_id": "421829324", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“....不是野猪...”但是想到门内的反应力和年纪，除非扔下他不管...求助地看向母亲。"}
{"time": 1765180008, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1297936175", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不是野猪...是其他东西，气息很邪恶....而且我们还看见了骷髅..总之很危险”"}
{"time": 1765180024, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1011213377", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（这是幸运16吗，怎么把我架火上烤了）"}
{"time": 1765180061, "type": "recv", "message_id": "555401094", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（幸运16就是现在还没追过来啊（））"}
{"time": 1765180070, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2112054216", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（说不定去服务器了）"}
{"time": 1765180073, "type": "recv", "message_id": "233570223", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（服务区（））"}
{"time": 1765180422, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1963261830", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“啊，骷髅？”里头的声音听起来清醒了些\n“嗯，虽然听起来难以置信，但这不是恶作剧。这儿不能再久呆了”汉斯开口，舒蕾则摇摇头，轻声对你们开口“说到这里就行了，我们带着也没法让他走得更快”"}
{"time": 1765180542, "type": "recv", "message_id": "899675904", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"虽然有些挣扎，但是知道父母是对的，最后叹了口气，\"不打扰老人家了。\"咬了咬牙，甩一甩衣服往前走，离开这里。"}
{"time": 1765180778, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1842259252", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "去扶着甘纳许“阿姨我来帮你吧....莫辛呢，还有力气吗”"}
{"time": 1765180819, "type": "recv", "message_id": "994479055", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“骷髅……附近有个小乡村，村里有教堂”里头的人开了门，火光流淌出来。屋主看上去已经五十岁往上，两鬓斑白，手里攥着个硬纸筒“往南直走，大概就两公里……是真的的话，我先把信号弹打了吧”"}
{"time": 1765181034, "type": "recv", "message_id": "692634207", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“行...谢谢...”两公里，不算太远“老伯你也快和我们一起走吧”"}
{"time": 1765181050, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1810061299", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"事已至此，点点头，走到门边吧莫辛扶起来，\"接下来还得继续...莫辛靠着些我好啦。\""}
{"time": 1765181056, "type": "recv", "message_id": "635679117", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"事已至此，点点头，走到门边吧莫辛扶起来，\"接下来还得继续...莫辛靠着些我好了。\""}
{"time": 1765181150, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1588678997", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我觉得他应该是老猎人吧，那50岁应该老当益壮，跑的挺快的感觉（））"}
{"time": 1765181248, "type": "recv", "message_id": "465731659", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（中世纪背景50岁已经不小咯，GSD都才52岁（））"}
{"time": 1765181428, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1044807456", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "莫辛点点头，抹了抹睫毛上的雨水，站了起来，上下牙有些打架“我还可以……”\n背后的压迫感似乎停滞了会，没有再靠近，反倒似乎远了些"}
{"time": 1765181635, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1038800077", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“嗯...？”察觉到了情况，现在的话...身侧开始弥散出雾气，很快遮掩住包括小屋在内的一片，“这片雾可以藏起我们...先休息一会吧...”虽然不算确定，但至少对方没有再靠近，这是个好兆头。"}
{"time": 1765182277, "type": "recv", "message_id": "570548891", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（所以是休息？）"}
{"time": 1765182320, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1556629340", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(当然是静观其变的同时休息)"}
{"time": 1765182341, "type": "recv", "message_id": "173534250", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“休息五分钟吧....别太久了，两公里的话不算太远...”"}
{"time": 1765182591, "type": "recv", "message_id": "463556156", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...虽然不知道有没有用...\"尽力扩散自己的雾气，\"好好休息一下...\""}
{"time": 1765182627, "type": "recv", "message_id": "210412511", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "守林人拉动信号弹的引信，短暂的硝烟过后，一团红色的礼花弹逆着雨幕升上天空，还未入云就先爆开，持续闪烁十余秒才黯淡下去"}
{"time": 1765182640, "type": "recv", "message_id": "229331077", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“舒茉的魔力量够用吗....用不用我分你一些”"}
{"time": 1765182653, "type": "recv", "message_id": "645119362", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你才是不够用的那个好吧（）"}
{"time": 1765182680, "type": "recv", "message_id": "968518222", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我已经挺长一段时间没用魔力了（）"}
{"time": 1765182693, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1565555699", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你tm一路上都在取暖）"}
