{"time": 1765182887, "type": "recv", "message_id": "773922796", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（其实应该倒也不止十分钟）"}
{"time": 1765182905, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1297673051", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是在这种，回蓝主要靠嗑药的世界观（）"}
{"time": 1765182919, "type": "recv", "message_id": "301341751", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...不用，只是几分钟的话...\"维持在笼罩小屋以及周边三米的范围，\"大家好好休息一下...老人家...\"看向护林员，\"我们能进屋烤会火吗？\""}
{"time": 1765182937, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1631903654", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（算你每小时回150吧，凑合凑合）"}
{"time": 1765182951, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2143146773", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（常态恢复接近短休说是）"}
{"time": 1765182971, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1759044489", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1765183093, "type": "recv", "message_id": "49247705", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=301341751]他点了点人数，叹了口气“挤一挤应该可以吧……这么大的雨，亏你们能找到这”"}
{"time": 1765183234, "type": "recv", "message_id": "249938119", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"自己稍微坐在门边一点靠着墙，维持着雾气不散，同时时刻注意着身后的方向传来的动静。"}
{"time": 1765183354, "type": "recv", "message_id": "953841252", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢老伯了....”坐到舒茉身旁"}
{"time": 1765183489, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1296489110", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "身上的衣服大概是湿透了，不过也没有条件换干净的衣服，沾了水的头发让脑袋沉沉的，慢慢拧着自己的衣袖，至于裙子，暂时大概是不管了。"}
{"time": 1765183530, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1151868024", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "他往壁炉里多填了几块柴，又按住旁边正准备呲牙的狼狗。舒蕾一样坐在门边，马夫倒是很知止地让开了壁炉旁的位置，甘纳许犹豫了会，还是牵着莫辛坐过去了"}
{"time": 1765183764, "type": "recv", "message_id": "681928866", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“大半夜的，这都……”他看了看墙上的挂钟“快十点了，你们看着也不像那什么，传说中的影卫？”"}
{"time": 1765183775, "type": "recv", "message_id": "17737935", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“怎么这个点到这儿来了”"}
{"time": 1765183825, "type": "recv", "message_id": "834493559", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我们本来是要去西海岸的...结果路上就遇到了骷髅，后路还被泥石流拦住了，只能往林子里跑了...幸好遇到了老伯”"}
{"time": 1765183856, "type": "recv", "message_id": "127337915", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“我们是赶路的时候...”既然伊恩开了口，自己就不继续说下去了，转身戳戳妈妈，对着她扯了扯自己湿透的头发"}
{"time": 1765184035, "type": "recv", "message_id": "885037005", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（怎么不让伊恩帮你烘干）"}
{"time": 1765184055, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1271233744", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（）"}
{"time": 1765184074, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1962861343", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（怎么不让伊恩帮你烘干）"}
{"time": 1765184082, "type": "recv", "message_id": "298800799", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我来帮舒茉吧...”"}
{"time": 1765184134, "type": "recv", "message_id": "294361373", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "刚刚那段时间，自己的魔力也恢复了一些，至少烘干衣服和头发肯定是轻轻松松的"}
{"time": 1765184291, "type": "recv", "message_id": "996211881", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=127337915]舒蕾望着窗外出神，被你戳了戳低头看了一眼，伊恩已经着手加热，于是只是点点头，又望向窗外"}
{"time": 1765184428, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1538985892", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...麻烦伊恩了。\"转一下身子，把后背交给他，自己继续打量着妈妈，有些不安地牵住她的手，窗外都是自己制造的雾气...\"妈妈在想什么...\"小声"}
{"time": 1765184439, "type": "recv", "message_id": "451014695", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=834493559]“骷髅……我活了这么多年还没见过呢”他挠了挠头“这附近一直很安定的啊，除了野猪比较多。上次有怪东西出现，据说还在几百年前……”"}
{"time": 1765184554, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2070399910", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "摇摇头\"看起来我们运气不太好的样子“叹口气”对了老伯，我看见骷髅好像在砸一个柱子，你知道那是什么吗\"给他描述一下柱子的外貌"}
{"time": 1765184587, "type": "recv", "message_id": "892231172", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1538985892]“没怎么……”她摇摇头“只是觉得，最近让人不安的事越来越多了。在未白、在白银村庄……还有刚刚。你爸爸之前看到的报纸也说最近公国里的恶性事件时有发生”"}
{"time": 1765184607, "type": "recv", "message_id": "837819249", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2070399910]（我之前可能没说明白）"}
{"time": 1765184618, "type": "recv", "message_id": "283828793", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但那玩意杵在马车要走的大路上）"}
{"time": 1765184640, "type": "recv", "message_id": "38071751", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（正中间？）"}
