{"time": 1765184666, "type": "recv", "message_id": "133334971", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（总之在路上杵着，显然不是钉子户）"}
{"time": 1765184863, "type": "recv", "message_id": "171537099", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（总之要问也是问马夫，但是答案都是）"}
{"time": 1765184864, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1879501557", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=892231172]“...就好像舒茉走到哪哪里就会出事...”咬着嘴唇，越想越有些悲观，不吱声了。"}
{"time": 1765184865, "type": "recv", "message_id": "879789664", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“从来没见过”"}
