{"time": 1765186506, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1277857652", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"应该...应该不会出什么事了吧？\"闭上眼。"}
{"time": 1765186531, "type": "recv", "message_id": "879256257", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“舒茉累的话，睡一会吧。有事我会叫醒你的”"}
{"time": 1765186612, "type": "recv", "message_id": "888379613", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "圣职者还未追上，服务区的方向，一根粗大的雷柱落下，随后火光和硝烟冒起，相隔数公里也能远远地看见朦胧的红光"}
{"time": 1765186675, "type": "recv", "message_id": "966914047", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那是....什么....”看到那雷柱有些发抖"}
{"time": 1765186753, "type": "recv", "message_id": "990077423", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "被那惊雷吓得瑟瑟发抖，\"一震之威...乃至于此...\"不敢想象要是自己面对那种怪物会发生什么，\"唔唔...\"抓着母亲的手更是抖个不停。"}
{"time": 1765187469, "type": "recv", "message_id": "857208248", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（？）"}
